{
  "Official": [
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::246175816",
      "Source": "A fantastic gift for any Creature. Can be used in place of any imprinting or passive-taming request.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"赠予任何生物的绝佳礼物。可代替任意印痕或被动驯服需求。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1098822326",
      "Source": "A large Structure used to construct, fast-travel, and manage Ships. Must be place in water.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"用于建造、快速旅行和管理船只的大型建筑。必须放置在水中。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2821228868",
      "Source": "A mass-produced ball of metal, capable of moderate damaging just about anything it hits... except Player-owned Structures.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"量产金属炮弹, 能对几乎任何命中目标造成中等伤害...玩家建筑除外。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3339172638",
      "Source": "Embark on your next epic odyssey within the world of ARK with Astraeos! Explore and survive in a land of colossal proportions, steeped in Greek mythology.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在《星耀》中开启你在方舟世界的下一段史诗远征! 这片巨境浸透希腊神话气息, 等待你探索、求生。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3435352495",
      "Source": "Get ready to complete your animated collection! This extensive pack brings you a selection of creatures and characters, ensuring you're well on your way to a full set of skins based on ARK: The Animated Series. Dive in and deck out your ARK in animated style!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"快来补全你的动画收藏! 这款大型外观包囊括多款生物与角色皮肤, 助你一步步集齐《方舟: 动画系列》主题外观。踏入方舟, 以动画风格装点你的世界!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1050438353",
      "Source": "Meet the Pyromane, ARK: Survival Ascended's first Fantastic Tame! This fiery feline transforms from a flamethrowing shoulder-kitten into a rideable, lava-walking lion that sets enemies ablaze with explosive dashes. It even cooks meat, preserves jerky, and fuels forges for ultimate utility!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"炽炎猫 ——《方舟：生存飞升》的首只奇幻驯兽! 这只烈焰猫科生物能从喷吐火焰的肩宠幼猫, 化为可骑乘、踏熔岩而行的雄狮, 以爆燃冲刺点燃敌人。它还能烹肉、保存风干肉, 并为熔炉供能, 用途惊人!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2795758820",
      "Source": "Shrouded in darkness and whispered about in legends, the Dreadmare is a creature of myth and nightmare. Use its uncanny abilities to control the battlefield, weaken your enemies, and strike from the shadows, as you ride into the apocalypse together!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"黑暗笼罩, 传说低语, 梦魇马是神话与噩梦孕育的存在。驾驭它诡谲的力量掌控战场、削弱敌人, 从暗影中发动突袭, 与它一同踏入末日!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::880109212",
      "Source": "Unlock Bob's animated Explorer Notes to hear his legendary ARK saga! Experience 3 epic themes: ride Trains & tame the Oasisaur in the Wild West Frontier Showdown. Pilot Zeppelins with Cosmo & SIR-5rM8 in the subterranean Steampunk Ascent. Drive custom BattleRigs & fight alongside the Armadoggo in the post-apocalyptic Wasteland War!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"解锁鲍勃的动画探险者笔记, 聆听他的传奇方舟冒险! 体验3大史诗主题: 在荒野西部边境对决中驾驶火车、驯服绿洲龙; 在地下蒸汽朋克崛起中, 与星灵蛛和求生搭档 SIR-5rM8 一同操纵齐柏林飞艇; 在后末日废土战争中驾驶自定义废土战车, 与铠护犬并肩作战!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2222914419",
      "Source": "Fantastic Tames Season 1 brings three mystical new companions to your tribe: Burrowbuck, Cerberax, and Enigmasaur. Tunnel through the earth, tear through the front lines using multi-headed attacks, or mimic stolen creature-forms!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"《奇幻驯兽》第一季为你的部落带来三位神秘伙伴: 穴角兔、刻耳柏拉克斯与谜龙。遁地穿行, 以多头攻势撕开前线, 或化身盗取而来的生物形态!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1954652634",
      "Source": "Build & customize your ships, and set sail for adventure across the high-seas this massive ARK gameplay expansion! Explore an uncharted ocean frontier to hunt for buried treasure, tame deep-sea monstrosities, and battle ruthless pirate armadas in PvE & PvP!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"打造并自定义你的船只, 在这款大型方舟玩法扩展中扬帆远航! 探索未知海疆, 搜寻埋藏宝藏, 驯服深海巨兽, 并在PvE与PvP中迎战凶残的海盗舰队!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3837122175",
      "Source": "Take flight into ARK: Dragontopia, a new cloudbound world of floating islands, mythical dragons, powerful skill trees, invading legions, filled with new vehicles, items, and challenges. Tame the legends, and rule the skies!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"振翼飞入《方舟: 龙之国度》—— 云端新世界由浮空岛、神话巨龙、强力技能树与入侵军团交织而成, 更有全新载具、物品与挑战。驯服传说, 统御苍穹!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2630956260",
      "Source": "Even More!!!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"还有更多!!!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
