    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2570724296",
      "Source": "Sates your hunger, and provides health while being digested.  Lasts longer than cooked meat.\r\nWild carnivores will eat it, but prefer raw meat. Acts as a substitute for Cooked Meat Jerky. \r\n\r\nMmmmm...  Bacon....",
      "Trans": {"SC":"能填饱肚子, 并在消化时恢复生命值。保存时间比熟肉更久。\r\n野生肉食生物会吃它, 但更偏好生肉。可替代熟肉干。\r\n\r\n嗯...培根...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2934083861",
      "Source": "Sates your hunger, and provides health while being digested.  More effective than normal meat jerky, and lasts longer than cooked prime meat.\r\nWild carnivores like this meat a lot.\r\n\r\nActs as a substitute for Prime Meat Jerky\r\n\r\nMmmmm... Crispy Bacon....",
      "Trans": {"SC":"能填饱肚子, 并在消化时恢复生命值。效果优于普通肉干, 保存时间也比熟优质肉更久。\r\n野生肉食生物非常喜欢这种肉。\r\n\r\n可替代优质肉干\r\n\r\n嗯...香脆培根...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
