    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3757606121",
      "Source": "The hunt is on! Search the forest to find the elusive Yeti.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"狩猎开始! 搜索森林, 寻找行踪难觅的雪人。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::722465717",
      "Source": "The object is being damaged!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"目标正在受损!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2688174665",
      "Source": "The structure has been destroyed!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"建筑已被摧毁!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1227044886",
      "Source": "The structure is taking damage!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"建筑正在受损!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1484485721",
      "Source": "There's an item here!!!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这里有个物品!!!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1104515657",
      "Source": "This Triceratops wants to go somewhere, why don't you help them get there!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这只三角龙想去某个地方, 何不帮它抵达目的地!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1778929702",
      "Source": "This accessory will change character appearance.\r\n\r\nEquipping this accessory will remove and prevent any fullbody character skins or cosmetics applied to armor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"此饰品会改变角色外观。\r\n\r\n装备后, 将移除并阻止护甲上应用的任何全身角色皮肤或装饰外观。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4160687048",
      "Source": "This dodo wants to go somewhere, why don't you help them get there!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这只渡渡鸟想去某个地方, 何不帮它抵达目的地!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3384155906",
      "Source": "This place is about to blow up!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这里快要爆炸了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4186334457",
      "Source": "This place is about to blow up! Get out before it explodes!!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这里马上就要爆炸了! 在爆炸前快撤!!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::496697912",
      "Source": "This substance can be converted into Dyes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"该物质可转化为染料。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3689484158",
      "Source": "Tidepup Cocoon",
      "Trans": {"SC":"潮佑螈茧","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3924715766",
      "Source": "Tidepup Dossier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"潮佑螈图鉴","JA":"潮佑螈圖鑒"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1202987456",
      "Source": "Tidepup consumes extra food after a healing attack.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"潮佑螈在治疗攻击后会消耗额外食物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3964327921",
      "Source": "Time Until Match Begins",
      "Trans": {"SC":"比赛开始倒计时","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2546010023",
      "Source": "Time to prepare your defenses: ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"防御准备时间: ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3974474061",
      "Source": "That glitch emerged from data storage --\nfrom where they kept you survivors before they let you out into the Genesis simulation for all this mayhem.\nThe data structure is intriguing -- and a bit beyond me, if I’m being honest.\nIt shares some code with the mind-transfer techniques they used to turn humans into homo deus.\nTwo branches with a common root, I suppose.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞来自数据存储——\n也就是你们这些生存者被放进创世模拟制造混乱之前的存放处。\n这种数据结构很有意思——老实说, 也有点超出我的理解范围。\n它与他们用来把人类转化为神人的意识转移技术共享部分代码。\n我想, 这是同根生出的两条分支。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2440483859",
      "Source": "That glitch had me stonkered. Toughest one we’ve tackled so far. It almost took me with it. Wait. What’s wrong with my voice. Help me, survivor\n...and apparently, that’s what it sounds like when my emotive subroutines go offline for a bit.\nSorry about that!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞把我整懵了。是我们目前处理过最棘手的一个, 差点把我也拖进去。等等, 我的声音怎么了。救我, 生存者\n...显然, 我的情感子程序短暂离线时, 听起来就是这样。\n抱歉!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3122288957",
      "Source": "That glitch is fixed. \nPity it was hard to reach. This biome is such a dismal place to get around in!\nYou humans must be used to life in the swamp, eh?\nAfter all, that’s where you come from. The Fertile Crescent was a swamp before the first humans drained it for agriculture.\nMakes me wonder whether you survivors are planning to drain this bog too...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"漏洞修好了。\n可惜它的位置太难够到。这片生物群系真是难走得让人绝望!\n你们人类应该挺习惯沼泽生活吧?\n毕竟你们就是从那里来的。最早的人类排干肥沃新月地带的沼泽, 才开始农业耕作。\n这让我不禁好奇, 你们生存者是不是也打算把这片沼泽排干...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::327813565",
      "Source": "That glitch proves this ocean is artificial. Not exactly news, eh?\nCould be worse, though. The first artificial ocean -- back in the 20th century -- was part of an experiment in a closed ecosystem.\nAt first, their ocean thrived. They even grew a coral reef!\nBut heaps of the species they introduced died off,\nand the researchers inside formed hostile factions and almost starved.\nHmmm. Starving humans dividing themselves into tribes.\nWhere have I heard that before?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞证明这片海洋是人工造物。这倒不算新闻, 对吧?\n不过情况本可以更糟。二十世纪的第一片人工海洋, 是封闭生态系统实验的一部分。\n一开始, 那片海洋繁荣得很, 甚至长出了珊瑚礁!\n但他们引入的大量物种后来死亡, \n里面的研究人员还分裂成敌对派系, 差点饿死。\n嗯...饥饿的人类把自己分成部落。\n我好像在哪儿听过这种事?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3031333132",
      "Source": "That glitch should serve as a warning: be careful what you wish for.\nSurvivor seven one zero dee four three nine was obsessed with “breaking the fourth wall,” as he put it.\nHe did everything he could to get the attention of whomever’s administering the simulation.\nBonfires, structures that spelled words, that sort of thing.\nI don’t know whether he succeeded.\nBut I do know he tried so hard that it made that glitch.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞应该成为一个警告: 许愿要小心。\n编号七一零D四三九的生存者迷上了所谓“打破第四面墙”。\n他想尽办法吸引模拟管理员的注意。\n篝火、拼出文字的建筑, 诸如此类。\n我不知道他最后有没有成功。\n但我知道他努力过头, 努力到制造了这个漏洞。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1380595714",
      "Source": "That glitch was a bit of a physics error.\nThe makers of the Genesis simulation used this area to test physics --\nlong before you survivors were let in.\nIf I know human nature --\nand it’s something I’m getting better at, you must admit --\nthis area got turned into a proper biome when someone realized they could turn the test zone into an “alien moon”\nand pop off to the pub early on a Friday.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞有点像物理错误。\n创世模拟的制作者很早以前就用这片区域测试物理效果——\n那时你们这些生存者还没被放进来。\n如果我对人性有所了解——\n而且你得承认, 我越来越懂了——\n这片区域之所以变成正式生物群系, 是因为有人意识到可以把测试区包装成“异星月球”, \n然后周五早点溜去酒吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2148891455",
      "Source": "That glitch was a bit of a wombat burrow,\nbut it gave me a peek into some of the other biomes -- the other environments in the Genesis simulation.\nHoly dooley, there’s a bit of everything in here!\nI reckon the way it works is that each biome has heaps of exploring and testing for you,\nand then there’s a master AI that shows up at some point and gives you a final exam.\nBut the files I saw were a bit vague on that last part.\nI reckon we’ll learn as we go, eh?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞像一条袋熊洞, 乱得很, \n但它让我窥见了其他几个生物群系——创世模拟中的其他环境。\n天哪, 这里真是什么都有!\n我猜它的运行方式是, 每个生物群系都给你安排大量探索和测试, \n然后某个时候会出现一个主控AI, 给你一场最终考试。\n不过我看到的文件, 对最后这部分写得有点含糊。\n我想我们会边走边学, 对吧?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3173495021",
      "Source": "That glitch was a bodgy bit of code from the survivor database.\nI fixed the glitch -- no worries there --\nbut someone’s mucking about with survivor minds that aren’t even active in the Genesis simulation.\nFor whatever reason, some survivors don’t respawn when they die in the simulation.\nThe system is supposed to just hold their minds in storage, but something is going in and editing them.\nAnd if those edits are causing glitches, I doubt the “editor” is being gentle.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞来自生存者数据库里一段糟糕的代码。\n我修好了漏洞——这点没问题——\n但有人正在篡改甚至没有在创世模拟中激活的生存者意识。\n不知为何, 有些生存者在模拟中死亡后不会重生。\n系统本该只是把他们的意识存储起来, 但某个东西正在进入并编辑它们。\n如果这些编辑会造成漏洞, 我怀疑那个“编辑者”可一点都不温柔。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3098475892",
      "Source": "That glitch was a security alert --\nthe last one sent by the master AI for this biome.\nIt’s gone. Deleted.\nI’m not entirely sure why everything here still works, but it does.\nDinos still traipsing about, volcanoes still erupting, sky still raining fire…\nit’s all working, but it’s a bit shonky.\nFeels like a classroom when the teacher’s stepped out for a bit.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞是一条安全警报——\n这个生物群系主控AI发出的最后一条。\n它没了。被删除了。\n我不完全明白这里的一切为什么还在运行, 但确实还在运行。\n恐龙照样闲逛, 火山照样喷发, 天上照样下火...\n一切都还在运作, 只是有点不靠谱。\n感觉就像老师暂时离开教室一样。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4143545329",
      "Source": "That glitch was all that’s left of the master AI for this biome.\nGone -- deleted -- just like that.\nIt’s not like this frozen environment won’t test us, of course, but no master AI means no final test.\nAnd worse, I’m not sure if anyone’s recording the results of your tests here.\nI knew you’d be curious, so I looked for clues about how or why the master AI was deleted.\nI came up blank.\nCould be a programming error, or it could be related to the security breaches I spotted earlier.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞就是这个生物群系主控AI留下的全部残余。\n没了——被删除了——就这么简单。\n当然, 这片冰封环境依然能测试我们, 但没有主控AI, 就没有最终测试。\n更糟的是, 我不确定是否还有人记录你在这里的测试结果。\n我知道你会好奇, 所以查了查主控AI为何以及如何被删除。\n结果一无所获。\n可能是程序错误, 也可能与我早些时候发现的安全漏洞有关。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2219903989",
      "Source": "That glitch was an old survivor diagnostic.\nIn the early days of massive simulations, they let the inhabitants edit their own minds.\nGot a bad habit? Just delete it. Sad childhood memory? Goodbye.\nIn practice, though, it was a disaster.\nOnce people started altering their own minds, they couldn’t stop themselves -- until there was nothing left.\nThat’s why you survivors have your minds intact, quirks and all.\nI wouldn’t want it any other way.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞是一段旧的生存者诊断程序。\n在大型模拟的早期, 他们允许居民编辑自己的意识。\n有坏习惯? 删掉。悲伤童年记忆? 再见。\n但实际操作起来, 这是一场灾难。\n人们一旦开始改造自己的意识, 就再也停不下来——直到什么都不剩。\n所以你们生存者的意识才会保持完整, 怪癖也都保留着。\n我也不希望有别的结果。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1777558560",
      "Source": "That glitch was from a security breach, but overall the number of alerts and denials is way down.\nYou’d think that’d be good, right?\nNo such luck.\nI’m seeing a lot of obvious backdoors encoded into security systems.\nIf someone got inside the Genesis simulation -- and it looks like they did --\nthey’ve set it up so they could come and go as they pleased.\nThat’s bad enough, but they didn’t hide their work.\nFor whatever reason, they aren’t worried that someone will follow along behind them.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞来自一次安全入侵, 但总体来说, 警报与拒绝访问的数量大幅下降。\n你会以为这是好事, 对吧?\n没那么走运。\n我在安全系统里看到了许多显而易见的后门。\n如果有人已经进入创世模拟——而且看起来确实如此——\n他们已经把这里设置成自己可以随意进出的样子。\n这已经够糟, 但他们甚至没有掩盖自己的手笔。\n不知为何, 他们一点都不担心有人顺着痕迹追上来。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3268264253",
      "Source": "That glitch was just\na misplaced string.\nWhat’s with my voice?\nIt’s stuck on sing!\nUm, let’s pretend that never happened, shall we?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞只是\n一段放错地方的字符串。\n我的声音怎么了?\n怎么变成唱的了!\n呃, 我们假装刚才什么都没发生, 好吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1550518947",
      "Source": "That glitch was just a maintenance thing.\nEasily sorted!\nTurns out the interface between mind and body for you survivors is rather delicate.\nBut with the right code, you can pluck survivors minds right out of their bodies, or plop those minds back into bodies.\nThat means you aren’t in the Genesis simulation forever --\njust long enough to get these tests done, eh?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞只是维护问题。\n很容易处理!\n事实证明, 你们生存者的身心接口相当精细。\n但只要有正确代码, 就能把生存者意识从身体里取出来, 或再塞回身体里。\n这意味着你不会永远困在创世模拟中——\n只要待到这些测试完成就行, 对吧?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::489804650",
      "Source": "That glitch was left over from a volcanic eruption, though I’m not sure exactly why.\nThere’s a lot going on with an eruption around here.\nFirst you got your earthquake --\nand when a fair dinkum earthquake is just the early warning, that’s bad, innit?\nFollow that with molten rocks falling from the sky and magma flowing like rivers.\nIt’s a wonder the biome isn’t deserted.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞是火山喷发留下的残余, 不过我不太确定原因。\n这里一次喷发会牵扯出太多东西。\n首先是地震——\n如果一场货真价实的地震都只是预警, 那可太糟了, 不是吗?\n接着是熔岩石从天而降, 岩浆像河流一样奔涌。\n这个生物群系居然还没荒废, 真是奇迹。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2676053234",
      "Source": "That glitch was related to Element, the wonder substance that everyone was using before things completely collapsed.\nElement can do so much -- and it’s so adaptive --\nthat sometimes the Genesis simulation can’t keep up.\nThat’s no surprise: in real life, civilization couldn’t keep up either.\nElement corruption was a big reason why the world’s in the rubbish shape it’s in.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞与元素有关——文明彻底崩塌前, 人人都在使用的奇迹物质。\n元素用途极广, 而且适应性极强——\n有时连创世模拟都跟不上它的变化。\n这倒不意外: 现实中, 文明也没跟上。\n元素腐化正是世界变成这副烂摊子的主要原因之一。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4176133580",
      "Source": "That glitch was some sort of stack overflow in a self-awareness subroutine.\nAll sorted now.\nBut speaking of that: what’s it like being self-aware inside a simulation?\nFor centuries, people have wondered whether their reality was, well, “real,”\nor if they too were in some sort of simulation.\nThe difference is, you actually know!\nThat’s got to be a right brain-burner.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞像是自我意识子程序里的某种堆栈溢出。\n现在都处理好了。\n不过说到这个: 在模拟中拥有自我意识是什么感觉?\n几个世纪以来, 人们一直在想自己的现实是否真的“真实”, \n又或者他们也处在某种模拟之中。\n不同的是, 你是真的知道答案!\n这肯定很烧脑。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2074522786",
      "Source": "That glitch was someone mucking about in the archives.\nSomeone accessed a 19th-century novel called “The Coming Race.”\nIn the book, an underground explorer finds an advanced culture of creatures called the Vril-ya.\nTheir whole society relies on an “all-permeating fluid” called Vril that they control with their minds.\nSounds a bit like liquid Element, if you ask me.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞是有人在档案里乱翻造成的。\n有人访问了一本十九世纪小说, 叫《未来种族》。\n书中, 一个地下探险者发现了一个名为弗里尔亚的先进生物文明。\n他们整个社会都依赖一种叫“弗里尔”的“无所不在的流体”, 并以心灵操控它。\n要我说, 这听起来很像液态元素。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::827221779",
      "Source": "That glitch was supposed to be an invisible camera!\nThat’s a first. Someone or something is trying to do real-time observations of individual survivors --\nand I think that one was aimed at us!\nThe Genesis simulation tracks what we do and how we perform,\nbut real-time observation isn’t something it’s set up for.\nWith countless survivors running about, what’s so special about us?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞本来应该是一台隐形摄像机!\n这还是头一回。某个人或某个东西正试图对单个生存者进行实时观察——\n而我觉得那台摄像机是冲着我们来的!\n创世模拟会追踪我们的行为和表现, \n但实时观察并不是它原本设计来做的事。\n无数生存者到处奔跑, 我们到底有什么特别的?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3679425323",
      "Source": "That glitch was the result of too many survivors carking it.\nThe Genesis simulation is supposed to get more difficult over time,\nbut if a survivor dies and respawns too many times, they can’t perform anymore.\nIt’s just a simulation, right,\nbut the act of dying and respawning is traumatic for all but the strongest survivors.\nYou’re clearly one of the strongest, but still…\ndon’t die, OK?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞是太多生存者挂掉造成的。\n创世模拟本该随着时间推移变得更难, \n但如果生存者死亡并重生太多次, 他们就无法继续表现了。\n这只是个模拟, 对吧, \n可死亡与重生这件事, 对除了最坚强者之外的所有生存者而言, 都是创伤。\n你显然是最坚强的那一类, 但还是...\n别死, 好吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::320464372",
      "Source": "That glitch… good news, bad news.\nThe good news is that I fixed it.\nBut the bad news is that I saw what’s happening to the survivors that won’t respawn.\nThe intruder in the system is corrupting them --\nturning them into half-alive “avatars” trapped inside artificial bodies.\nAt some level, they know what’s going on, but they’re under someone else’s control.\nExisting survivors are all right, though. For now.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个漏洞...有好消息, 也有坏消息。\n好消息是我修好了。\n坏消息是, 我看到了那些不会重生的生存者正在遭遇什么。\n系统中的入侵者正在腐化他们——\n把他们变成半死不活的“化身”, 困在人工身体里。\n在某种层面上, 他们知道发生了什么, 但他们受别人控制。\n现存生存者还没事。暂时。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1330546880",
      "Source": "That wasn’t a glitch so much as it was a cautionary tale.\nPity poor survivor four one zero ell zero nine eight. She got poisoned by something --\nnot sure what --\nand when she died, the system didn’t clear the poison before it respawned her.\nShe kept waking up in excruciating pain, then dying moments later,\nthen repeating it all in an endless loop.\nWell, endless until we fixed that glitch. She’s all sorted now.\nNot sure where she went, though.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"与其说那是漏洞, 不如说是一则警示故事。\n可怜的编号四一零L零九八生存者。她被某种东西毒倒——\n不确定是什么——\n而她死亡后, 系统在重生她前没有清除毒素。\n她不断在剧痛中醒来, 片刻后死去, \n然后在无尽循环中重复这一切。\n当然, 无尽只持续到我们修好漏洞为止。她现在没事了。\n只是我不确定她去了哪里。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2883874624",
      "Source": "That’s enough keys. I’ll start hacking us a teleport.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"钥匙够了。我会开始黑入, 为我们弄出一次传送。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::724904465",
      "Source": "The Hover Skiff is buffeted by high winds!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"悬浮艇遭强风冲击!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2842319158",
      "Source": "The simulation is giving you bonus XP.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"模拟系统正在发放额外经验。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3794115028",
      "Source": "The water is too deep.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"水太深.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3675689948",
      "Source": "The water is too shallow.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"水太浅.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2222851389",
      "Source": "There are no words for how dull-witted you are.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的愚钝简直无以言表。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::861934663",
      "Source": "There is already a ship in this hangar!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"该船坞中已有一艘船!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::525222096",
      "Source": "There’s gotta be a way...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一定还有办法...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3971580023",
      "Source": "Those leeches will bleed you dry!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那些水蛭会把你吸干!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4188525998",
      "Source": "Toffee",
      "Trans": {"SC":"太妃糖","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3795189164",
      "Source": "Treasure Hunters",
      "Trans": {"SC":"寻宝猎人","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4246268749",
      "Source": "UPDATING...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"正在更新...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2613356186",
      "Source": "Um. At the bottom of the Ever-Cave...?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"呃。在永恒洞窟最底下...?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3534787191",
      "Source": "Umbra gains confidence with each unanswered strike. He breathes cold orbs that he can leap to in an instant, just as he will leap to his counterpart's side. Lumina's presence stokes his fiery heart, making him faster and tougher.\r\n\r\nIt is possible to grapple with Umbra and learn to steer his flight. Dance with the dragon, and follow his lead. A worthy rider earns control of his dark fury and swiftness. Offer food when he grows hungry, and you will win his sacred bond.\r\n\r\nUmbra is a creature of darkness, thus he follows the Moon's path.\r\nThe meek need not fear him, but cruelty will earn his mighty wrath.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"幽影仔每一次出击若未遭回击, 便会愈发自信。他能吐出寒霜法球,并在瞬息间跃至其旁; 面对自己的伴生之龙, 他也会同样奔赴。皎光仔的存在会燃旺他炽热的心, 让他更迅捷, 也更坚韧。\r\n\r\n你可以用抓钩与幽影仔角力, 逐渐学会引导他的飞行。与龙共舞, 顺着他的节奏。配得上的骑手, 终将驾驭那份暗影怒火与疾速。饥饿时喂给他食物, 你便能赢得神圣羁绊。\r\n\r\n幽影仔生于黑暗, 因而追随月的轨迹。\r\n温顺者无需惧怕他; 残暴之徒, 终将承受他的滔天怒火。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4016376104",
      "Source": "Unable To Access At This Time",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当前无法访问","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::877616081",
      "Source": "Unable To Use At This Time",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当前无法使用","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1887604961",
      "Source": "Unavailable - Bounty Completed",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不可用 - 悬赏已完成","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3169400573",
      "Source": "Use this item to respawn your Tidepup.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用此物品复活你的潮佑螈。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3551710572",
      "Source": "WARNING",
      "Trans": {"SC":"警告","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2649684587",
      "Source": "Warning : shipyard won't be able to craft {0} water is not deep enough.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"警告: 水深不足, 船坞无法建造{0}。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4151558439",
      "Source": "Welcome to the final test -- and your final moments of life! Struggle if you wish, but your failure is inevitable.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"欢迎来到最终测试 -- 也是你生命的最后时刻! 尽管挣扎吧, 你的失败早已注定。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2202208242",
      "Source": "Why are you laughing? We’re the ones winning around here!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你笑什么? 现在占上风的是我们!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3398825664",
      "Source": "Why not? It’s all a simulation, innit?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"为什么不呢? 这一切都是模拟, 不是吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1116301210",
      "Source": "Why would you take a test that you cannot possibly pass?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"为什么要参加一场你绝不可能通过的测试?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3094142940",
      "Source": "Wild creatures will not target allies on this Ship, unless attacked first.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"除非先遭到攻击, 否则野生生物不会主动以此船上的盟友为目标。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2250658774",
      "Source": "Yeah kid, I’m with ya. All the way.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当然, 孩子, 我跟你一起。一直到最后。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3027722612",
      "Source": "Yes, there are. You just never learned them.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"有的。只是你从没学会。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1267682489",
      "Source": "You been cuffed, mate.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你被铐住了, 伙计。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::287671309",
      "Source": "You call this punishment? We can do this all day!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这也叫惩罚? 我们能打一整天!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1366260400",
      "Source": "You cannot equip this skill",
      "Trans": {"SC":"无法装备该技能","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2790141852",
      "Source": "You cannot “hack” your way to victory here!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你不可能靠“黑入”赢下这里!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2429396967",
      "Source": "You did say “no matter what”...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可是说过“无论发生什么”...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4033892298",
      "Source": "You got leeches on you, survivor!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"生存者, 你身上爬着水蛭!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2805297476",
      "Source": "You got something in you, something none of the rest of us have. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你身体里有些东西, 我们其他人谁都没有。 ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3189203774",
      "Source": "You got to warm up, mate!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你得赶紧暖起来, 伙计!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2419542035",
      "Source": "You having a bender there?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你这是喝懵了吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1603990762",
      "Source": "You know I won’t. What is it, kid?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我不会的。怎么了, 孩子?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1759483633",
      "Source": "You know we got your back, kid. No matter what.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你知道我们永远站你这边, 孩子。无论发生什么。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1630509387",
      "Source": "You look woozy, mate...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你看起来晕乎乎的, 伙计...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2888272688",
      "Source": "You must own {0} to control this creature",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你必须拥有{0}才能控制此生物","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2115180030",
      "Source": "You must own {0} to evolve this creature",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你必须拥有{0}才能进化此生物","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1265520421",
      "Source": "Your mount is bleeding -- a lot.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的坐骑在流血 -- 而且很严重。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3715538943",
      "Source": "Your mount isn’t looking so good...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的坐骑看起来不太妙...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1136758406",
      "Source": "Your ride is about to collapse!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的坐骑快撑不住了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4206168296",
      "Source": "You’re about to die!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你快撑不住了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1482225768",
      "Source": "You’re all tangled up!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你被缠住了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1028767833",
      "Source": "You’re bleeding all over the place!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你血都快流成河了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::785069339",
      "Source": "You’re burning up!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你快烧起来了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2427515895",
      "Source": "You’re doing with the tests so far, survivor, but ask yourself: what are they preparing you for? What am I preparing you for?\nTo give you a punch in the nose, I hope.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"到目前为止, 你还在完成测试, 生存者。但问问自己: 它们到底在为你准备什么? 我又在为你准备什么?\n希望是准备给你鼻子上一拳。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3049864146",
      "Source": "You’re getting bonus XP.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你正在获得额外经验。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2599126067",
      "Source": "You’re getting extra XP from the simulation.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你正从模拟系统中获得额外经验。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1269595501",
      "Source": "You’re in second -- don’t hold back!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你现在第二 -- 别松劲!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2926075058",
      "Source": "You’re in third. Pick up the pace!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你排第三。加快速度!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1031442154",
      "Source": "You’re killing it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"干得漂亮!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::165851952",
      "Source": "You’re on fire, survivor!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你着火了, 生存者!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::564416758",
      "Source": "You’re on your last legs...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你已经快到极限了...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3622974434",
      "Source": "You’re ripping it up!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"杀疯了啊!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::284674323",
      "Source": "You’re winning! Good on ya!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你领先了! 干得好!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3671509596",
      "Source": "You’re you. A goddamned miracle, far as I can tell.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你就是你。在我看来, 一个活生生的奇迹。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2658099271",
      "Source": "\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">Shipyard won't be able to craft, ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">船坞将无法制造, ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::842601998",
      "Source": "\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">shipyard won't be able to craft, ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">船坞将无法制造, ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::659701140",
      "Source": "\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 0, 1\">Find all Bob's Arat Tale Explorer Notes on Genesis for +5 Max Levels</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 0, 1\">找到创世纪所有\"鲍勃阿拉特故事\"笔记来 +5 等级上限</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2623316871",
      "Source": "\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 1, 1\">All Bob's Arat Tale Explorer Notes from Genesis found +5 Max Levels</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 1, 1\">创世纪所有\"鲍勃阿拉特故事\"笔记已找到 +5 等级上限</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
