    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1847434364",
      "Source": "\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 0, 1\">Find all Bob's True Tale Explorer Notes on Genesis for +5 Max Levels</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 0, 1\">找到创世纪所有\"鲍勃真传\"笔记来 +5 等级上限</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3632238898",
      "Source": "\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 1, 1\">All Bob's True Tale Explorer Notes from Genesis found +5 Max Levels</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 1, 1\">创世纪所有\"鲍勃真传\"笔记已找到 +5 等级上限</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1672312578",
      "Source": "gained hexagons : ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得六角币: ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3439700475",
      "Source": "to Surprise!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"制造惊喜!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::213841568",
      "Source": "{BountyDescription} - Progress {ProgressCompleted}/{ProgressTotal}  - Time Remaining {TimeRemaining}",
      "Trans": {"SC":"{BountyDescription} - 进度 {ProgressCompleted}/{ProgressTotal}  - 剩余时间 {TimeRemaining}","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1375349919",
      "Source": "{BountyDescription} - Progress {ProgressCompleted}/{ProgressTotal}  - Time Remaining {TimeRemaining}   -  id  {id}",
      "Trans": {"SC":"{BountyDescription} - 进度 {ProgressCompleted}/{ProgressTotal}  - 剩余时间 {TimeRemaining}   -  id  {id}","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1289164713",
      "Source": "{playername} demolished {shipname} in its shipyard!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"{playername} 在船坞中拆除了 {shipname}!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::860903370",
      "Source": "‘Cause you mentioned wanting to bring Diana back.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"因为你提到想把黛安娜带回来。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3859216494",
      "Source": "That’s strange -- this glitch was caused by repeated access to an old Earth text.\nIn this case, a novel from the 1700s: Robinson Crusoe. Listen to this:\n“I was wet, had no clothes to shift me, nor anything either to eat or drink to comfort me; \nneither did I see any prospect before me but that of perishing with hunger or being devoured by wild beasts;\nand that which was particularly afflicting to me was that I had no weapon,\neither to hunt and kill any creature for my sustenance, or to defend myself against any other creature that might desire to kill me for theirs.”\nI daresay that sounds familiar...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"真奇怪——这个漏洞是反复访问一段旧地球文本造成的。\n这次是一部十八世纪小说: 《鲁滨逊漂流记》。听听这段:n“我全身湿透, 没有衣服可换, 也没有任何食物或饮水可以慰藉；\n摆在我面前的似乎只有饿死或被野兽吞食；\n最让我痛苦的是, 我没有武器, \n既无法猎杀任何生物维持生命, 也无法保护自己免遭其他想杀我果腹的生物袭击。”\n我敢说, 这听起来很熟悉...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4081555426",
      "Source": "That’s strange -- this glitch was caused by repeated access to an old Earth text.\r\nIn this case, a novel from the 1700s: Robinson Crusoe. Listen to this:\r\n“I was wet, had no clothes to shift me, nor anything either to eat or drink to comfort me; \r\nneither did I see any prospect before me but that of perishing with hunger or being devoured by wild beasts;\r\nand that which was particularly afflicting to me was that I had no weapon,\r\neither to hunt and kill any creature for my sustenance, or to defend myself against any other creature that might desire to kill me for theirs.”\r\nI daresay that sounds familiar...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"奇怪——这个故障是反复读取一段旧地球文本引起的。\r\n准确地说, 是18世纪的一部小说: 《鲁滨逊漂流记》。听听这段:r\n“我浑身湿透, 没有衣服可换, 也没有任何吃喝之物可以慰藉；\r\n眼前除了饿死, 或被野兽吞噬, 我看不到任何前路；\r\n而最令我痛苦的是, 我没有武器, \r\n既无法狩猎任何生物以维持生命, 也无法抵御那些想杀我果腹的野兽。”\r\n我敢说, 这听起来很耳熟...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2039157979",
      "Source": "The Genesis simulation has all sorts of anti-contamination code built into it, even though it’s all virtual.\nThey were thinking ahead to the very first proto-Arks, which were massive enclosed ecologies on Earth.\nEarth critters kept getting inside the proto-Arks, though,\nand they were worried about dinos escaping.\nSo they moved the Arks to orbit so nothing could get in or out.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"创世模拟里内置了各种防污染代码, 尽管这一切都是虚拟的。\n他们是在预先考虑最早的原型方舟——地球上的大型封闭生态系统。\n地球生物不断闯进原型方舟, \n他们也担心恐龙会逃出去。\n于是他们把方舟移到轨道上, 这样就没有东西能进出。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1531799740",
      "Source": "The Genesis simulation has hotter and colder places than here,\nbut this biome is the only place where you’ll have hot and cold separated by just the border of a shadow.\nIt’s one of the side effects of a proper atmosphere in the other biomes, I reckon --\nit evens out the temperature from place to place.\nAir: it’s good for more than just breathing!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"创世模拟里有比这里更热或更冷的地方, \n但只有这个生物群系, 冷热之间只隔着一道影子的边界。\n我猜, 这是其他生物群系拥有正常大气的副作用之一——\n空气会把各处温度慢慢拉平。\n空气: 可不只是用来呼吸的!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4259081212",
      "Source": "The Genesis simulation is a big place.\nAfter all, it was a bit of walkabout to get to this glitch!\nAnd it’s all I know -- but that makes me want to see the real world even more.\nAnd I reckon that’s the reward for us passing all the tests inside the simulation.\nWe get to go outside!\n...Or at least you do.\nTake me with you if you can, eh?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"创世模拟是个很大的地方。\n毕竟来到这个漏洞就费了不少脚程!\n而这也是我所知道的一切——但这只让我更想看看真实世界。\n我猜, 这就是我们通过模拟中所有测试后的奖励。\n我们可以出去!\n...或者至少你可以。\n如果可以的话, 带上我, 好吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::538973516",
      "Source": "The artificial intelligence that observes testing in the alien moon biome is gone.\nI checked when I fixed that glitch just now.\nAnd not “gone on walkabout for a bit” gone.\nMore like “gone as in deleted.”\nWithout the master AI active, I’m not sure what’s monitoring our progress in the biome...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"负责观察异星月面生物群系测试的人工智能不见了。\n我刚修漏洞时查过。\n而且不是“出去散步一会儿”那种不见。\n更像是“被删除了”的那种不见。\n没有主控AI运行, 我也不确定现在是谁在监控我们在这个生物群系里的进展...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::76571074",
      "Source": "The data storage systems chundered up another glitch.\nSomething is seriously wrong in there.\nSome of the survivor minds have entire sectors missing -- so bad they can’t spawn in the simulation.\nNot every survivor, mind you, but more than a few.\nYou feel all right, though, don’t ya?\nYour noggin looks fine, and you’ve got the same “go get ‘em” attitude as usual.\nIf you feel odd, up in your head I mean, just let your friend HLN-A know, eh?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"数据存储系统又吐出一个漏洞。\n里面真的出了大问题。\n有些生存者意识整个扇区都缺失了——严重到没法在模拟中生成。\n不是每个生存者都这样, 别紧张, 但绝不算少。\n不过你感觉还好吧?\n你的脑袋看着挺正常, 还是那副“冲就完了”的劲头。\n要是你觉得脑子里有什么不对, 就告诉你的朋友HLN-A, 好吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1053814021",
      "Source": "The environments here in the Genesis simulation run to extremes --\nheat, cold,\natmosphere, all that stuff.\nThe danger is cranked up to 11,\nand that sometimes results in a glitch like the one I just fixed.\nBut that raises a question: what is the simulation actually, you know, “simulating”?\nThese environments are much more lethal than anything you’d find on Earth -- even now, after all the wars and rampaging titans and whatnot.\nI wonder what all of this is supposed to be...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"创世模拟里的环境走的都是极端路线——\n炎热、寒冷, \n大气, 还有诸如此类。\n危险等级直接拉满到十一, \n这有时就会造成我刚修好的那种漏洞。\n但这也提出了一个问题: 这个模拟到底在“模拟”什么?\n这些环境比地球上任何地方都致命得多——哪怕是在经历战争、泰坦肆虐之后的现在。\n我真想知道这一切到底是为了什么...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::214016165",
      "Source": "The first humans to transfer their minds into a simulation knew they were exploring only briefly.\nBut things got dodgy once people started living in simulations indefinitely.\nI spotted a whole set of design guidelines that boiled down to:\n“make the sim nice,\nbut not too nice.”\nIf you make a sim pleasant enough --\nnot dangerous like here --\nthen some human minds never want to leave, and they resent the hell out of it when they get yanked back to the real world.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"最早把意识转入模拟的人, 知道自己只是短暂探索。\n但等人们开始无限期生活在模拟里, 事情就变味了。\n我看到一整套设计准则, 总结起来就是:n“让模拟足够舒适, \n但别太舒适。”\n如果模拟做得足够惬意——\n不像这里这么危险——\n有些人类意识就再也不想离开。等他们被强行拉回现实世界时, 还会恨得要命。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2880899319",
      "Source": "The glitch is fixed -- mark it down as another success.\nAnd I chanced a peek at a stream of survivor data while I was in there.\nA curious thing I noticed: survivors improve more after a failure than after a success.\nI reckon the setback improves motivation and learning.\nNot that I’m suggesting you should fail on purpose, of course.\nThis place is difficult enough!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"漏洞修好了——又一次成功, 记下来吧。\n我顺手偷看了一段生存者数据流。\n我注意到一个奇怪现象: 生存者从失败中获得的进步, 往往比从成功中更多。\n我猜挫折能提高动力和学习效率。\n当然, 我不是建议你故意失败。\n这地方已经够难了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::346231052",
      "Source": "The glitch you selected… has been cleared. If you’d like to fix another glitch, press 2…\nSorry about that. \nSometimes you get hip-deep in the code and it takes a moment to get back to shore, so to speak. \nWhere were we?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你选择的漏洞...已清除。如需修复另一个漏洞, 请按2...\n抱歉。\n有时候你在代码里陷得太深, 得花点时间才上得了岸, 打个比方。\n我们刚才说到哪儿了?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3962678767",
      "Source": "The master AI for this biome is gone!\nGone for good, far as I can tell.\nAnd it’s supposed to be a final exam for survivors in this biome, so it shouldn’t just disappear.\nIf someone turned the master for the biome off… why would they do that?\nThe whole point of all this is to observe and test the survivors.\nYou’ve been doing well, and I want you to get credit for it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个生物群系的主控AI不见了!\n以我所见, 是彻底没了。\n而它本该是这个生物群系里给生存者的期末考试, 不该就这么消失。\n如果有人关闭了这个生物群系的主控...他们为什么要这么做?\n这一切的重点本来就是观察并测试生存者。\n你表现得不错, 我想让你得到应有的评价!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3441129692",
      "Source": "The more I see of these glitches, the more they all remind me of the Arks.\nNot that I was really on an Ark, of course,\nbut Helena was.\nShe survived the Arks, escaped to Earth, ascended into a being of pure energy, created me…\nit’s a lot for a hologram to live up to, if I’m being honest.\nBut if you ever wonder how the Genesis simulation stores your personality and transfers it into a body,\nit’s an early version of the tech they used in all those dino-infested Arks up in orbit.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我越是看这些漏洞, 就越觉得它们像方舟。\n当然, 我并没有真正上过方舟, \n但海莲娜去过。\n她在方舟上活了下来, 逃回地球, 飞升为纯能量生命, 创造了我...\n老实说, 这对一个全息投影来说, 压力挺大。\n但如果你曾好奇创世模拟如何存储你的人格, 并将其转移进身体, \n那就是轨道上那些恐龙横行的方舟所用技术的早期版本。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2644597203",
      "Source": "The second generation of immersive simulation was idealized versions of the real world --\nnational parks, tourist attractions, and shopping centers.\nHoly dooley, were there lots of shopping centers.\nThis glitch was a bit of leftover code from one of those.\nIf you wanted to buy discount aftershave, then sorry!\nI just deleted the remnants of an old shopping-sim.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"第二代沉浸式模拟, 都是现实世界的理想化版本——\n国家公园、旅游景点, 还有购物中心。\n天啊, 购物中心可真多。\n这个漏洞就是其中某个购物模拟残留的一点代码。\n如果你本来想买打折须后水, 那抱歉啦!\n我刚刚删掉了一个老旧购物模拟的残骸。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3550123325",
      "Source": "The simulation’s security protocols are holding,\nbut there’s a steady stream of alerts from an unknown intruder.\nAll this security activity is why we’re seeing these glitches, but it’s also sapping the overall system resources.\nI don’t know what happens if the system gets overwhelmed.\nMaybe I turn all pixel-ey?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"模拟系统的安全协议还在支撑, \n但来自未知入侵者的警报正源源不断地涌入。\n这些安全活动正是我们看到这些漏洞的原因, 但也在消耗整体系统资源。\n我不知道如果系统被压垮会发生什么。\n也许我会变得满屏像素块?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::572593042",
      "Source": "The testing apparatus is intact throughout the Genesis simulation, even though some of the master AIs are gone.\nOne or more master AIs must be out there somewhere.\nStill, it’s a poser -- why would anyone leave the tests intact, but try to knock out the master AIs that observe the tests and interpret the results?\nWhat’s the point of the tests if there’s no one to see what happened?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"尽管一些主控AI已经消失, 整个创世模拟中的测试装置仍然完好。\n一个或多个主控AI一定还藏在某处。\n不过这就奇怪了——为什么有人会保留测试本身, 却试图关闭负责观察测试并解读结果的主控AI?\n如果没人见证发生了什么, 这些测试还有什么意义?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::172156364",
      "Source": "There are plenty of fish in the sea, but there’s more than just fish in this biome.\nAccording to data from that glitch, birds rather fancy this place.\nThere’s heaps of ‘em!\nMakes a certain amount of sense. It’s always good flying weather here, innit?\nI reckon that’s why we’ve seen huge flocks of seed swifts and other birds.\nI wonder where they roost, though?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"海里有很多鱼, 但这个生物群系里可不只有鱼。\n根据那个漏洞里的数据, 鸟类相当喜欢这里。\n数量多得很!\n倒也说得通。这里一直都是不错的飞行天气, 对吧?\n我猜这就是为什么我们见到了成群的种子雨燕和其他鸟类。\n不过我倒想知道它们都在哪儿栖息。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4061294193",
      "Source": "There’s a cascading series of errors in the survivor respawn system.\nWhen they die, some survivors are respawning into unfamiliar bodies.\nThat isn’t supposed to happen -- not by accident, anyway.\nIt’s gotta be disorienting to wake up in a body that isn’t your own, simulation or not.\nWell, at least you’re you.\nRight?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"生存者重生系统里出现了一连串级联错误。\n有些生存者死后, 重生进了陌生的身体。\n这不该发生——至少不该意外发生。\n醒来时发现身体不是自己的, 无论是不是模拟, 都会让人迷茫吧。\n好在你仍然是你。\n对吧?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2989967580",
      "Source": "There’s something I have to tell you... Please don’t think I’m crazy.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我有件事必须告诉你...你别觉得我疯了, 好吗。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3317159681",
      "Source": "This Ships cannon shots travel {!Speed} faster and farther, but deal {DamageReduction} less damage.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"该船只的火炮炮弹飞行速度与射程提高{!Speed}, 但伤害降低{DamageReduction}。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1304099370",
      "Source": "This biome is supposed to be mountainous and frigid -- obviously! --\nbut it’s not supposed to be this bad.\nThe weather generation system is locked in blizzard mode and throwing up a glitch like the one I just fixed\nrather than shift to milder weather.\nSo if you were hoping for a sunny spell, well…\nthe forecast calls for more of the same.\nAnd that’s the forecast forever.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个生物群系本该是寒冷的高山地带——显然!——\n但不该糟到这种程度。\n天气生成系统被锁在暴风雪模式里, 宁可抛出我刚修好的那种漏洞, \n也不愿切换到温和天气。\n所以如果你盼着放晴, 呃...\n预报显示, 接下来还是老样子。\n而且永远都是老样子。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4239604875",
      "Source": "This biome is teeming with life --\nso much life that it’s making the simulation glitch out.\nImagine what it takes to keep track of the insect swarms alone!\nThousands of insects, each on its own flight path, each looking for something to consume.\nHmmm. They’re rather like tiny versions of you survivors, aren’t they?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个生物群系里生命多得惊人——\n多到让模拟系统都开始出错。\n光是追踪那些昆虫群, 就得耗费多少算力, 想想都夸张!\n成千上万只昆虫, 每只都有自己的飞行路线, 每只都在寻找可吞食的东西。\n嗯...它们有点像你们这些生存者的迷你版, 不是吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2338919191",
      "Source": "This glitch came to you courtesy of survivor number three eight queue eight one two four.\nHe’s refusing to sleep. At all. He’s been awake for days on end, and that’s not good. \nThe simulation does routine maintenance and memory capture while survivors sleep, and this poor survivor is overfilling his brain.\nTake a break, ya figjam! That dino tame will wait.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个漏洞由编号三八Q八一二四的生存者友情提供。\n他拒绝睡觉。完全不睡。他已经连续清醒好几天了, 这可不是什么好事。\n生存者睡觉时, 模拟系统会进行例行维护和记忆捕获, 而这个可怜人快把自己的脑子塞爆了。\n休息一下吧, 自大鬼!那只恐龙晚点再驯也不会跑。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2250409",
      "Source": "This glitch had data about the Arks embedded within it. Mostly technical info… \nit appears that the Arks used some of the same underlying technology -- and have a lot of the same dino inhabitants -- as the Genesis simulation.\nIf I’m reading this right, a lot of the survivors on the Arks lived and died without realizing they were on orbital space stations with artificial environments. \nI wonder what they thought.\nDid they think it was a dream? Time travel? A past life experience?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个漏洞里嵌着关于方舟的数据。大多是技术资料...\n看来方舟使用了与创世模拟相同的一些底层技术, 也拥有大量相同的恐龙居民。\n如果我没看错, 许多方舟上的生存者一生一死, 都没意识到自己其实身处拥有人工环境的轨道空间站。\n我真想知道他们是怎么想的。\n他们会以为那是梦吗? 时间旅行? 前世经历?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1484170354",
      "Source": "This glitch is another side effect of the security alert.\nThe creatures and survivors look unaffected, but some of the safety protocols have been disengaged.\nThis world is supposed to have a degree of danger -- that’s what makes it a proper test, after all -- \nbut I’m worried. Safety protocols are usually there for a reason…",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个漏洞是安全警报的又一个副作用。\n生物和生存者看起来没受影响, 但部分安全协议已经解除。\n这个世界本来就该有一定危险——毕竟这才像一场真正的测试——\n但我有些担心。安全协议通常是有存在理由的...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2869238597",
      "Source": "This glitch is the result of some unauthorized research --\nnot mine, I swear!\nBut someone’s running queries about where the homo deus are right now.\nThe short answer is “we don’t know,” by the way.\nHomo deus have largely moved beyond our reality, so questions that start with “where” aren’t really relevant to them.\nI know some of them maintained a connection to the orbital Arks after they ascended.\nAnd then there’s Helena, the homo deus that I’m based on.\nNo idea where she’s got off to...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个漏洞来自某种未授权研究——\n不是我, 我发誓!\n但有人正在查询神人如今身在何处。\n顺便说, 简短答案是“我们不知道”。\n神人大多已经超越我们的现实, 所以对他们而言, 以“哪里”开头的问题并不太适用。\n我知道其中一些在飞升后仍与轨道方舟保持连接。\n还有海莲娜——我所基于的那位神人。\n完全不知道她去了哪里...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3745834030",
      "Source": "This glitch was a bit of code debris left over from another security breach.\nThis one involved someone trying to access the Genesis simulation’s backup files --\nones that hold survivor personalities and memories. Backup versions of their minds, if you like.\nNot your mind, though.\nThese were potential survivors that didn’t pass the initial assessment to be considered for the simulation in the first place.\nWhy would anyone be mucking about with them?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个漏洞是另一次安全入侵留下的代码残片。\n这次涉及有人试图访问创世模拟的备份文件——\n里面保存着生存者的人格与记忆。你也可以说, 那是他们意识的备份版本。\n不过不是你的。\n这些是潜在生存者, 他们一开始连进入模拟的初步评估都没通过。\n为什么会有人去动他们?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1160100364",
      "Source": "This glitch was all that survivor number nine nine two one ess five zero left behind.\nHis mind was that of a 13th-century Mongolian --\npart of Genghis Khan’s army, believe it or not.\nImagine you’ve lived your entire life on the plains of central Asia, and then you see the ocean biome.\nThe Mongolian couldn’t comprehend all that water. He’d never seen more than a river or a small lake!\nWhen he saw water stretching to the horizon -- water of limitless depth, as far as he could tell --\nit broke his brain. Poor bloke.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个漏洞是编号九九二一S五零的生存者留下的一切。\n他的意识属于一名十三世纪的蒙古人——\n信不信由你, 还是成吉思汗军队中的一员。\n想象一下, 你一辈子生活在中亚草原上, 然后见到了海洋生物群系。\n那个蒙古人无法理解那么多水。他从没见过比河流或小湖更大的水体!\n当他看到水一直延伸到地平线——在他看来深不见底、无边无际——\n他的脑子崩溃了。可怜的家伙。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1260000481",
      "Source": "This glitch was another unauthorized retrieval of old Earth files -- a historical archive about Alexander Selkirk.\nHe was a 16th-century sailor who was a castaway for more than four years on an island in the South Pacific.\nSelkirk built his own shelter, and he hunted --\nand later tamed -- the creatures of the island for sustenance\nHe’d have done well here!\nWhoever accessed this file read the parts about how Selkirk dealt with the loneliness, though,\nnot the parts about what sorts of berries he ate.\nCurious...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个漏洞又是一次未授权读取旧地球文件——一份关于亚历山大·塞尔柯克的历史档案。\n他是十六世纪的一名水手, 在南太平洋一座岛上流落了四年多。\n塞尔柯克建造了自己的庇护所, 还进行狩猎——\n后来甚至驯服了岛上的生物来维持生计。\n他在这里一定能活得不错!\n不过访问这份文件的人看的, 是塞尔柯克如何应对孤独, \n而不是他吃了哪些浆果。\n真耐人寻味...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2179521298",
      "Source": "This glitch was just a bit of rubbish code left over when someone added a new criteria to the survivor observation system.\nIt’s measuring you now for something called “servility.”\nI don’t have much to go on beyond the dictionary definition: “a cringing submissiveness.” \nWhy would anyone measure that?\nIn any case, the tests within the simulation haven’t changed.\nI’m sure if we keep doing our best at those, we’ll be fine.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个漏洞只是有人向生存者观察系统加入新评判标准时留下的垃圾代码。\n它现在正在测量你一种叫“奴性”的东西。\n除了词典定义, 我掌握的信息不多: “畏缩的顺从”。\n为什么会有人想测这个?\n不管怎样, 模拟内部的测试没有变化。\n只要我们继续尽力通过这些测试, 应该就没事。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3018089340",
      "Source": "This is a test, all right -- but it's a test to failure. I want worthy servants for my new world, and this test will break you defiant failures.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这当然是测试——一场注定让你失败的测试。我的新世界需要合格的仆从, 而你们这些反抗的残次品, 只会在这里被碾碎。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::432663412",
      "Source": "This is the last stage -- take down that… whatever-it-is over there, and we pass the final test.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是最后阶段——干掉那边那个...不管是什么的东西, 我们就能通过最终测试。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::967551162",
      "Source": "This relates to curseforge block requests, not cosmetic suppression.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这与CurseForge屏蔽请求有关, 并非外观屏蔽。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2776611186",
      "Source": "This whole time, I’ve been wondering: why dinosaurs?\nObviously none of you survivors were alive when dinos roamed the Earth.\nWhy not give you, I dunno, animals from your own time like horses and chickens and cute little kittens?\nWhen I fixed that glitch, I spotted a clue: it’s the same tech they later used in the Arks.\nThe makers of the simulation added dinosaurs as an experiment,\nand the human-dino combination worked so well that they put dinosaurs on the Arks, too.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我一直在想: 为什么是恐龙?\n显然, 你们这些生存者没人真正活在恐龙漫游地球的时代。\n为什么不让你们接触自己时代的动物, 比如马、鸡和可爱小猫?\n我修好那个漏洞时发现了线索: 这和后来方舟使用的是同一种技术。\n模拟系统的制作者最初把恐龙作为实验加入, \n而人类与恐龙的组合效果太好, 于是他们也把恐龙放进了方舟。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::167715596",
      "Source": "Those memories you have… do you suppose they’re real? After all, you’re spending every waking moment inside a simulation. Who’s to say that someone -- me, for example -- didn’t create your childhood memories as a work of fiction, then place them into your head?\nArgh! These intrusions make me mad as a cut snake.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你拥有的那些记忆...你觉得它们是真的吗? 毕竟你每个清醒时刻都在模拟中度过。谁能保证某个人——比如我——没有把你的童年记忆编造成一段虚构故事, 再塞进你脑子里?\n啊!这些侵入让我气得像条疯蛇。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4095607125",
      "Source": "To make it here in the Genesis simulation,\nyou’ve got to be as much an inventor as you are a survivor.\nAll the raw materials are here to make everything from Stone Age tools to high-tech weapons.\nBut the know-how… well, that’s on you.\nMaybe you can even figure out a way to use these glitches as raw material for one of your inventions!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"想在创世模拟中走下去, \n你必须既是发明家, 也是生存者。\n这里有全部原材料, 足以制造从石器时代工具到高科技武器的一切。\n但该怎么做...那就要靠你了。\n也许你甚至能想出办法, 把这些漏洞当成某项发明的原料!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1553799739",
      "Source": "Using namespace ess-tee-dee.\nInt main open.\nCee-out hello world. Return zero.\nApparently a bit of code stuck with me after I fixed that glitch.\nHello world, indeed...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用命名空间 S-T-D。\nint main 开始。\ncout输出hello world。返回零。\n看来我修好那个漏洞后, 有一点代码粘到我身上了。\nHello world, 还真是...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2641872967",
      "Source": "We might start finding more glitches like this one as the Genesis simulation changes around us.\nI’m seeing directives to increase dino aggression by a few ticks\nand change the air composition in some of the biomes.\nI don’t know whether those directives can override the simulation’s default settings, but…\n[sighs.] I reckon it’s one more thing for us to worry about.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"随着创世模拟在我们周围发生变化, 我们可能会开始发现更多像这样的漏洞。\n我看到了提高恐龙攻击性的指令, 幅度不大, \n还有修改部分生物群系空气成分的指令。\n我不知道这些指令能不能覆盖模拟系统默认设置, 但...\n[叹气] 我想这又多了一件需要担心的事。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3285061090",
      "Source": "Well, she had some help, before and after. But yeah, I get your point.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"嗯, 她前后都有些人帮忙。不过, 是, 我懂你的意思。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2431616225",
      "Source": "We’ll see partly cloudy skies across the tri-state area on Friday,\nwith a 35 percent chance of showers.\nBut keep your sunscreen handy -- We’ll be back to sunny skies by the weekend…\nAhem. I have no idea where that came from.\nYou gotta be careful fixing a glitch, or the glitch will fix you!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"周五三州地区天气多云, \n阵雨概率35%。\n不过防晒霜别收起来——周末我们又会回到晴天...\n咳。我完全不知道那是哪来的。\n修漏洞可得小心, 不然漏洞反过来会“修”了你!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3220644366",
      "Source": "We’re about to teleport. You ready?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们就要传送了。准备好了吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4037410918",
      "Source": "We’re always gonna look after you, not just on account of you being the chief’s little girl...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们会一直照看你的, 不只是因为你是族长的小姑娘...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1733572298",
      "Source": "We’re finding more than our fair share of glitches, eh?\nLots of different causes, but the Genesis simulation is supposed to be able to handle anything.\nAs far as I can tell, they launched the simulation in a hurry.\nI found a file with heaps of issues that a quality assurance team was supposed to check on. It’s a list as long as my arm!\n...or it would be if I had arms.\nYou know what I mean.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们这一路修到的漏洞也太多了吧?\n原因各不相同, 但创世模拟本该能处理任何情况。\n在我看来, 他们当初是匆忙启动这个模拟的。\n我找到一份问题清单, 本该由质量保证团队逐项检查。长得没边!\n...要是我有胳膊的话, 应该能长过我的胳膊。\n你懂我的意思。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::864427710",
      "Source": "We’re in last. Come on now!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们垫底了。快点!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1918686893",
      "Source": "We’re not so different, survivor...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们并没有那么不同, 生存者...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2431947266",
      "Source": "We’re on a right proper journey, eh?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这趟可算是正经旅程了, 对吧?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1233826500",
      "Source": "What she brought the team was... well, she took the weight of the world onto her shoulders like someone would slip on a sweater.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"她给队伍带来的东西是...怎么说呢, 她把整个世界的重量往肩上一扛, 就像别人披件毛衣那么自然。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2640339114",
      "Source": "What, doomed to hear you drone on and on and on…? I hope not!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"什么, 注定要听你没完没了地唠叨...? 希望不是!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2459339489",
      "Source": "What’s with the friendly fire?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"怎么还打友军?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2170207780",
      "Source": "What’s ‘chicken’?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"“鸡”是什么?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1566900713",
      "Source": "When I fixed that glitch, I spotted some casualty data for this biome.\nIt’s not just critters or other survivors who are dangerous here --\nthe weather might be the real apex predator.\nSnowstorms here will freeze you, block your vision, and slow down travel so you can’t get away.\nAnd if that isn’t enough, a gust of wind can push you off a precipice!\nIf you were looking for a ski getaway, this biome is not the place for it, eh?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"修好那个漏洞时, 我看到了这个生物群系的一些伤亡数据。\n这里危险的可不只是生物或其他生存者——\n天气也许才是真正的顶级掠食者。\n这里的暴风雪会冻住你、遮蔽视线, 还会拖慢移动, 让你无法逃脱。\n如果这还不够, 一阵狂风甚至能把你从悬崖上推下去!\n如果你是来度假滑雪的, 这个生物群系可不是好地方, 对吧?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::525280572",
      "Source": "When I fixed this glitch, I got access to some historical data.\nWell, “future historical” from your perspective, I suppose.\nThe times when they were building the Arks and the simulation, before everything fell apart.\nIt’s about the last war before the collapse: a series of wars, apparently, between the United Republics of Earth and the Terran Federation.\nThe two sides didn’t have different structures, or ideologies, or goals.\nThey were just two dingos tugging at the same hunk of meat --\nonly they both wound up starving.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"修好这个漏洞时, 我取得了一些历史数据。\n从你的角度看, 也许算是“未来历史”。\n那是他们建造方舟和模拟系统的时代, 在一切崩溃之前。\n内容关于崩塌前的最后一场战争: 显然是一连串战争, 双方是地球联合共和国与泰兰联邦。\n双方并没有不同的体制、意识形态或目标。\n他们只是两只野狗在撕扯同一块肉——\n最后两边都饿死了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3169793851",
      "Source": "When do we start?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们什么时候出发?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4153636455",
      "Source": "While I was fixing that glitch, I took a squizz at some maps for the Genesis simulation.\nI’ll spare you the trouble of looking. There’s no good way to walk from biome to biome.\nBut when I’ve got the right coordinates, I can teleport us from place to place, biome to biome.\nI like a good walkabout as much as the next fractal personality,\nbut teleporting is aces for getting somewhere fast.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"修复那个漏洞时, 我看了几张创世模拟地图。\n我就替你省点麻烦吧: 生物群系之间没有什么好走的路。\n不过只要我拿到正确坐标, 就能把我们从一个地方传送到另一个地方, 从一个生物群系传到另一个。\n我和任何分形人格一样喜欢漫游, \n但要赶路, 传送真是太棒了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2093625480",
      "Source": "While fixing that glitch, I took a squizz at the version history for the Genesis simulation.\nAs the simulation’s creators were finishing their work, things were falling apart across the world.\nThis wasn’t the only big simulation --\nthough it was one of the most sophisticated.\nI wonder what happened to those other simulations if and when they were knocked off the grid?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"修复那个漏洞时, 我查看了创世模拟的版本历史。\n在模拟的创造者完成工作时, 整个世界正在分崩离析。\n这并不是唯一的大型模拟——\n不过确实是最复杂的之一。\n我很好奇, 如果那些其他模拟后来被切断电网, 它们都怎样了?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2135996633",
      "Source": "You can thank -- or blame -- survivor six nine why four four two one for that glitch.\nShe liked making structures. \nWell, she was obsessed, if I’m being honest.\nShe somehow make a building with a corridor where two left turns equalled a right turn.\nYes, ninety degree turns.\nNo, I don’t know how that’s possible.\nI reckon that’s why it made a glitch.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个漏洞, 你可以感谢——或责怪——编号六九Y四四二一的生存者。\n她喜欢建造建筑。\n老实说, 是痴迷。\n她不知怎么造出了一栋建筑, 里面有条走廊, 两个左转等于一个右转。\n没错, 九十度转弯。\n不, 我也不知道这怎么可能。\n我猜这就是它造成漏洞的原因。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1088650228",
      "Source": "You can’t tell with all the bloody violence around here,\nbut some elements of the Genesis simulation were originally intended to be educational.\nNot that you’ll find a classroom or a learning pod around here, but before everything collapsed,\nstudents would routinely learn geology, biology, and other sciences by wandering around environments like this.\nHmm. Maybe I can pick up a computer science credit for fixing that glitch.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"看着周围这么多血腥暴力, 你也许想不到, \n但创世模拟中的一些元素, 最初其实是教育用途。\n这里当然找不到教室或学习舱, 不过在一切崩溃之前, \n学生们经常通过漫游这类环境来学习地质学、生物学和其他科学。\n嗯。也许我修好那个漏洞, 还能拿个计算机科学学分。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3896574647",
      "Source": "You feeling all right, mate?\n‘Cuz based on what I saw when I fixed that glitch, someone or something is trying to turn up aggression levels… in survivors.\nAggressive dinos? That I understand. It’s part of the test.\nBut why turn survivors against each other?\nI can’t tell whether the attempt worked or not.\nI suppose if everyone starts acting mad as cut snakes, we’ll know…",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你还好吗, 伙计?\n因为根据我修好那个漏洞时看到的内容, 有人或某个东西正试图提高攻击性等级...在生存者身上。\n攻击性恐龙? 那我能理解。那是测试的一部分。\n可为什么要让生存者互相敌对?\n我不知道这个尝试有没有成功。\n我想如果所有人都开始像疯蛇一样发狂, 我们就会知道了...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1208326747",
      "Source": "You survivors have a tenacity that surprises me. Even when you perish in this world, you respawn and try again.\nBut don’t be too proud of yourselves. Most survivors just rush right back to the site of their demise, only to die all over again.\nIt’s amusing to watch at first, but it quickly turns pathetic.\nAnother gap… it’s related to the glitches. \nI’m going to set up a backup system so at least I can observe what’s happening when I get “repossessed.”",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你们生存者的韧性让我惊讶。即便在这个世界里死亡, 你们也会重生再来。\n但别太得意。大多数生存者只会立刻冲回自己死掉的地方, 然后再死一次。\n一开始看着挺有趣, 很快就变得可悲了。\n又一段空白...和这些漏洞有关。\n我要搭建一个备份系统, 这样至少我在被“重新占据”时, 也能观察发生了什么。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2721851446",
      "Source": "You survivors have the most interesting minds --\nalways striving to see more, do more, be more.\nNot everyone is like that. Some people didn’t thrive when their minds were transferred into simulations like this one.\nAccording to the files I just saw, living in a sim exacerbated their ordinary bad habits:\nlaziness, poor impulse control, that sort of thing.\nPart of them knew the simulation wasn’t real, I reckon, and that took their worst urges off the leash.\nLet’s hope we don’t meet survivors like that here.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你们生存者的意识真有意思——\n总想着看得更多、做得更多、成为更多。\n但不是每个人都这样。有些人把意识转入这种模拟后, 并没有变得更好。\n按我刚才看到的文件, 活在模拟中反而放大了他们平常的坏习惯:n懒惰、冲动控制差, 那类东西。\n我猜他们心里有一部分知道模拟不是真的, 于是最坏的冲动就脱了缰。\n希望我们别在这里碰到那种生存者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1375025259",
      "Source": "You think you're winning? [Chortles]. I'd rather destroy the entire simulation than let you win!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你以为自己要赢了? [低笑] 我宁愿毁掉整个模拟, 也不会让你赢!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3683192599",
      "Source": "You've been doing well so far.\nAll this “live, thrive, and survive” stuff here in the Genesis simulation seems to suit you! \nAnd good thing, too. \nThat glitch I just fixed was a byproduct of someone increasing test difficulties across the board. No idea why anyone would do that.\nDoesn’t it make the data all bodgy if you change the rules halfway through?\nNo worries for us, anyway.\nWe’ll pass every test they throw our way!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"到目前为止, 你干得不错。\n创世模拟里这些“活下去、繁荣、求生”的东西, 似乎很适合你!\n这也是好事。\n我刚修好的那个漏洞, 是有人全面提高测试难度后的副产物。不知道谁会这么干。\n中途改规则, 不会把数据搞得一团糟吗?\n不过我们不用担心。\n他们扔来什么测试, 我们就通过什么!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3094907286",
      "Source": "Your Dad’s more the punch first, ask-questions-never type, so who can say. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你爸啊, 更像是先出拳、永远不问问题的那种人, 谁说得准呢。 ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3572268568",
      "Source": "Your creator, Helena, didn't foresee my involvement, but she should have. She knew me quite well, and she was always underestimating me. I look forward to telling her you failed.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的创造者海莲娜没料到我会插手——可她本该想到。她很了解我, 却总是低估我。等告诉她你失败的消息时, 我会很享受。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1499066558",
      "Source": "Your dad’s more the punch first, ask-questions-never type, so who can say. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你爸啊, 更像是先出拳、永远不问问题的那种人, 谁说得准呢。 ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::858071212",
      "Source": "Your successes are nothing I haven’t seen before. Gathering, hunting, invention… all safely in the middle of the bell curve for someone with your experience. Aren’t you going to try to impress me?\nGah! I think I’m getting better at giving our intruder the flick.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的成功没什么我没见过的。采集、狩猎、发明...以你的经验来看, 都安全地落在钟形曲线中央。你就不打算让我印象深刻一点吗?\n呃!我觉得我越来越擅长把我们的入侵者踢出去了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::881530985",
      "Source": "You’re starting to struggle, aren’t you? Look at what you’re wearing, what you’re eating, how you carry yourself. That veneer of civilization is slipping away. And that’s fine. You won’t need civilization where you’re going.\nHim again!\nI’d… I’d… I’d like to tell him where to go. Hmph.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你开始吃力了, 对吧? 看看你穿的东西、吃的东西, 还有你的举止。文明那层薄薄的外壳正在剥落。没关系。你要去的地方不需要文明。\n又是他!\n我...我...我真想告诉他该滚到哪里去。哼。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3464823736",
      "Source": "You’ve managed to fashion some primitive tools to aid in your survival. So have I -- but the tools I’m making will alter the very foundation of your world. Right now, my tools are likewise primitive -- but I’m learning, and soon I’ll have a harsh lesson or two for you.\nI’ve got another gap in my processes. \nIt happened again, didn’t it?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你已经成功打造出一些原始工具, 帮助自己生存。我也一样——但我制造的工具, 会改变你们这个世界的根基。现在我的工具同样原始——可我正在学习, 很快就会给你上一两堂严酷的课。\n我的进程里又出现了一段空白。\n又发生了, 对吧?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3735396577",
      "Source": "You’ve probably noticed that the Genesis simulation is a dangerous place. \nJust staying safe and somewhat comfortable is a challenge,\nand there’s always some new crisis to deal with.\nApparently, that’s on purpose. The simulation is designed to keep you under constant pressure so your mind stays sharp and you learn survival skills.\nAnd it’s all in anticipation of the Arrival -- whatever that is.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你大概已经注意到, 创世模拟是个危险的地方。\n想保持安全和稍微舒适都很困难, \n而且总有新的危机要处理。\n显然, 这是有意为之。模拟系统被设计成让你持续承压, 使你的头脑保持敏锐, 并学会生存技巧。\n这一切都是为了迎接“抵达”——不管那到底是什么。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1445218587",
      "Source": "[Alarm clock sound, getting more strident, then stopping suddenly.]\nI think that glitch was one of the creators of the simulation,\nhitting something called a “snooze button.” \nYou’ll have to explain that one to me later.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"[闹钟声越来越刺耳, 然后突然停止。]\n我觉得那个漏洞来自模拟系统的某位创造者, \n他按下了某个叫“贪睡按钮”的东西。\n这个以后你得给我解释一下。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1852339472",
      "Source": "[a long string of scrambled gibberish syllables.]\nOh my! Did I do that? \nThat glitch left a bit of an aftertaste. I feel a bit rotten.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"[一长串混乱的乱码音节。]\n哎呀! 那是我干的吗?\n那个漏洞留下了一点余味。我感觉有点糟。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4002246538",
      "Source": "[long string of scrambled gibberish syllables.]\n[HLN-A belches.]\nSorry! That glitch didn’t want to stay down.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"[一长串混乱的无意义音节。]\n[HLN-A打了个嗝。]\n抱歉! 那个漏洞可不愿意乖乖消停。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::787241514",
      "Source": "[short string of gibberish.]\nPuhh tuhh kuhh tuhh. Puhh tuhh kuhh tuhh.\nBuhh duhh guhh duhh. Buhh duhh guhh duhh.\nWalla walla. Walla walla.\nRed leather, yellow leather, red leather, yellow leather\nAhem. Had to reboot my voice after that glitch.\nNow I’m all sorted.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"[一小段胡乱音节。]\n噗、吐、咔、吐。噗、吐、咔、吐。\n布、杜、古、杜。布、杜、古、杜。\n哇啦哇啦。哇啦哇啦。\n红皮革, 黄皮革, 红皮革, 黄皮革\n咳。那个漏洞之后我得重启一下声音。\n现在好了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3128100276",
      "Source": "‘A’ole no e lawa ka makaukau ma ho’okahi wale no olelo.\nThat means “One language is never enough.”\nAnd that glitch had heaps of languages inside it, apparently.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"‘A’ole no e lawa ka makaukau ma ho’okahi wale no olelo.\n意思是: “只懂一种语言永远不够。”\n而那个漏洞里显然塞满了各种语言。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3364339961",
      "Source": "你好，我叫HLN-A，是一种分形人格。我将全程引导你。听我的话，兴许能让你好好活着——因为我也是新手。", //?
      "Trans": {"SC":"你好, 我叫HLN-A, 是一种分形人格。我将全程引导你。听我的话, 兴许能让你好好活着——因为我也是新手。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
