    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::994169539",
      "Source": "You have more in common with me than the so-called ‘Homo deus’.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你与我，比与那所谓的“神人”更为相似。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1161438480",
      "Source": "You have no right to judge me!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你没有资格审判我！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3984420975",
      "Source": "Your soul is already Lost like ours. I can sense it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的灵魂早已与我们一样堕入失落。我能感觉到！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1163102949",
      "Source": "You’re the monster here... you must see that!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"真正的怪物是你...你难道看不见吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::569915062",
      "Source": "You’ve been very lucky so far, but you can’t win.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你一路走来不过是运气好罢了，但你赢不了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1040753252",
      "Source": "You’ve fought well, and earned my respect.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你战得不错，赢得了我的尊重。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2483484402",
      "Source": "Why risk death, when you could be immortal?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"何必冒着死亡的风险？你本可以获得永生！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1582063902",
      "Source": "You had to have done terrible things too, to survive this long.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你能活到现在，也一定做过可怕的事。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::450702755",
      "Source": "We are the last true family of humanity! The world belongs to us, not Thralls.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们才是人类最后真正的家族！这世界属于我们，而非失落者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1763552981",
      "Source": "We’ve endured so much... earned our right to go on.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们历经苦难……才换来继续存在的权利。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3400464762",
      "Source": "What’s the use? Why did I think you might understand?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"还有什么意义？我竟以为你会理解。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3250859348",
      "Source": "Turn on your mistress and fight for my kingdom.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"背叛你的主人，为我的王国而战。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4212469075",
      "Source": "There’s nothing left for you to prove here.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你已经无需再证明什么。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2674181959",
      "Source": "Think of the Children!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"想想那些孩子！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::223882494",
      "Source": "There’s no need for us to keep on fighting like this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们没必要继续这样厮杀下去。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3393142269",
      "Source": "Stop this, before we both end up dead!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"停手吧，否则我们都会死在这里！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::994790778",
      "Source": "No -- No! I can’t let you win...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不——不！我不能让你赢……","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::854670414",
      "Source": "My patience for your stubborn defiance is nearly exhausted.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我对你顽固的反抗，耐心所剩无几。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4116962188",
      "Source": "Make mincemeat of the interlopers!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"把这些闯入者剁成肉泥！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3686953276",
      "Source": "Like you, we cling to life by whatever means necessary.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"和你一样，我们也是不择手段地活下去。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4072479384",
      "Source": "Listen to me -- you belong with us. You have to know that!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"听我说——你本就属于我们，你心里明白！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2624269028",
      "Source": "Let’s see if we can come to an understanding after all.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"也许我们仍能达成共识。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2017009867",
      "Source": "Let the flames purify you!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"让烈焰净化一切！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2360818774",
      "Source": "I’m not sure how much longer I can resist making a meal of you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我已经快要忍不住，把你当成一顿盛宴了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2537626671",
      "Source": "It’s time for you to stand down and claim your prize.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"现在该放下武器，领取你的奖赏了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3069044386",
      "Source": "It’s still not too late to make a deal...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"现在谈条件还不算太晚……","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2325117641",
      "Source": "I will not see you destroy our way of life!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我绝不会让你毁掉我们的生存方式！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::910051791",
      "Source": "I see now I was wrong to underestimate you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"看来我低估了你。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::968317531",
      "Source": "I might still consider letting you join us, if you beg for mercy!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"若你跪地求饶，我或许还能考虑接纳你。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2853005130",
      "Source": "I can taste your fear... It’s intoxicating.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我能尝到你的恐惧……令人沉醉。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2982152554",
      "Source": "I can still call off my pet...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我还可以召回我的宠物……","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3571290175",
      "Source": "I can offer you peerage -- a dominion all your own...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我可以赐你爵位——赐你一片属于自己的领地……","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::787594507",
      "Source": "How are you doing this? And why?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你到底是怎么做到的？又是为了什么？","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2036916022",
      "Source": "For my Children... I must not fail you...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"为了我的孩子……我不能失败……","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3497421475",
      "Source": "Feel yourself weakening? I know you do.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"感觉到自己在衰弱了吗？我知道你感觉到了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3341349977",
      "Source": "Feel the heat, and burn!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"感受这炽热，然后化为灰烬！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1943784669",
      "Source": "Everything I’ve done was to protect my people.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我所做的一切，都是为了守护我的子民。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3830036274",
      "Source": "Don’t you think you’ve taken this far enough?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"难道你还觉得自己做得不够吗？","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::223750486",
      "Source": "Don’t force me to tear you limb from limb.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"别逼我把你撕成碎片。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1511473128",
      "Source": "Can you just take a moment, and think this through?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你能不能停一停，好好想清楚？","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3668475645",
      "Source": "Are you so eager to die like some common farm animal? You can do better than that!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你真想像牲畜一样死去吗？你本可以做得更好。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3463764907",
      "Source": "A shame to let all your efforts be for nothing.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可惜你所有努力都将化为乌有。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3585199531",
      "Source": "This is your last chance to submit, and pledge yourself to me.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是你最后的机会，俯首称臣，向我效忠。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::604813254",
      "Source": "You're poisoned and bleeding! You're losing 0.5% Health per second and torpor is rising, get some Antidote!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你已中毒并流血! 每秒失去0.5%生命值, 眩晕值持续上涨, 快用解毒剂!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
