      "NamespaceHash": "Content::143293691",
      "Source": "Equip a Grand Tortugar with this to ride it. You can build structures on the large platform to make a mobile base.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"给巨甲龟装备这个以骑乘它。你可以在大型平台上建造结构来制作移动基地。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4070555597",
      "Source": "Discover Astraeos, a colossal 260km² map steeped in Greek mythology. Explore stunning landscapes, from majestic marble cliffs and blossoming cherry groves to the scorching, shifting sands of the new Pyranthos desert. Face powerful new enemies, and tame unique creatures found only on Astraeos, from the nimble Maeguana and the Grand Tortugar, a massive amphibious living fortress!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一起来探索星耀这张以希腊神话为主题的广袤地图吧! 踏上这片260km²的土地, 将这壮丽景观尽收眼底: 从巍峨的大理石断崖, 到樱花盛放的秘境森林, 再到以“火之花”为名的皮兰索斯炽热沙漠。在这里, 有着全新强敌等你来挑战, 更有地图专属生物 —— 迅疾如风的“风行蜥”以及体型超大、水陆两栖、宛如移动堡垒的“巨甲龟”正等待你来驯服!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //有点费脑子😣
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2168398223",
      "Source": "Pyranthos",
      "Trans": {"SC":"皮兰索斯","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
