    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4220674864",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of small storage box. Great for placing decor pieces on top.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以用这个来更换小储物箱的外观。非常适合在上面放置装饰件。","JA":""},
