      "Trans": {"SC":"甜蜜的储物柜 & 铁匠台","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2311738893",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of storage items including:\r\n- Small storage box\r\n- Large storage box\r\n- Bookshelf\r\n- Smithy\r\n\r\nSet the mood and feel the love with more inviting storage!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以用它来更换以下储物类物品的外观皮肤: \r\n- 小储物箱\r\n- 大储物箱\r\n- 书架\r\n- 铁匠台\r\n\r\n用更吸引人的储物来营造氛围, 感受爱!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1798561894",
      "Source": "Lovely Spicy Rose Bush",
      "Trans": {"SC":"甜蜜的辛香玫瑰丛","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2467023042",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of a Plant Species X to look like Spicy Rose Bush!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以用这个来将X异种植物的外观更换为辛香玫瑰丛的样子!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2319616830",
      "Source": "Lovely Rose Petal Patch",
      "Trans": {"SC":"甜蜜的玫瑰花瓣","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3342957719",
      "Source": "Tucked inside this tiny decor box lives a little piece of Valentine's magic!\r\n\r\n With a sprinkle of mischief and a whole lot of love, the small decor box is turned into lovely rose petals  to decorate your homes.\r\n\r\n Can manually trigger a flurry effect of roses.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个小小的装饰箱里藏着一点情人节的魔法!\r\n\r\n 带着一丝俏皮与满满爱意, 这个小巧装饰盒会化作可爱的玫瑰花瓣, 装点你的家。\r\n\r\n可手动启用玫瑰纷飞的特效。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::650563862",
      "Source": "Lovely Rose Vase",
      "Trans": {"SC":"甜蜜的玫瑰花瓶","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3079515750",
      "Source": "Tucked inside this tiny decor box lives a little piece of Valentine's magic!\r\n\r\n With a sprinkle of mischief and a whole lot of love, the small decor box is turned into lovely vase to decorate your homes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个小小的装饰箱里藏着一点情人节的魔法!\r\n\r\n带着一丝俏皮与满满爱意, 小巧的装饰盒化身成可爱花瓶, 为你的家增添浪漫氛围。","JA":""},
