    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1178105495", //锻造台信息
      "Source": "The result item will have a rating equal to the rating of one of the items (50% chance of picking the highest rating item as the main item), added to 25% of the rating of the other 2 items.\r\nThis operation cannot fail.\r\nOnly 1 of the items being combined can be an item crafted by a player.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"输出的物品其品质将选取其中一件物品的品质 (有50%的概率选取最高品质的物品作为主材料), 再加上另外两件物品总品质的25%\r\n此操作不会失败。\r\n参与合成的物品中, 最多只能包含一件玩家自制物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
