      "Source": "Some day, you'll be a big fox!\r\n\r\nCompletion",
      "Trans": {"SC":"有朝一日, 你会成为一只大狐狸的!\r\n\r\n成长","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1627011797",
      "Source": "Once I might have pitied you, mortal.",
      "Trans": {"SC":" 昔日我或许会对你心生怜悯, 凡人。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4213403234", //H
      "Source": "Survivor, it's up to you now. Take one last look around, because these are your last moments on Earth.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"生存者, 现在该由你启程了。再看看周围的一切吧, 因为这是你在地球停留的最后时刻了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2077841144", //H-old
      "Source": "Once you disable shielding over Arat Prime, you can upload Codex, along with your own engrams.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一旦你关闭阿拉特·源域的护盾, 你就可以上传元码, 以及你自己的印痕。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::928326485", //H
      "Source": "Once you disable the shielding over Arat Prime, you can upload the Codex, along with your own engrams.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一旦你关闭阿拉特·源域的护盾, 你就可以上传元码, 以及你自己的印痕。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3480396594", //H
      "Source": "Come join us in this new world... you've been waiting to get here long enough.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"来这个新世界加入我们吧...你为了来到这里已等候了太久太久。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::14213696", //LQ
      "Source": "Relent, and I might grant you a swift end.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"屈服吧, 我或可赐你一个痛快的下场。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::842521646", //LQ
      "Source": "Show me some spark of effort! Do not insult me.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"且让我看一眼你拼尽全力的样子! 莫要轻慢于我。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2796907374", //LQ
      "Source": "So fragile, like frost crunching underfoot.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"脆弱不堪, 犹如足底碎裂的冰渣。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3540668426", //LQ
      "Source": "You were a fool to ever set foot here.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你何其不智, 竟敢踏足此地。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3627560213", //LQ
      "Source": "I am beyond decay. You are simply meat destined only to rot.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我已长存不朽。你不过是一抔注定腐烂的血肉。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3469985615", //LQ
      "Source": "You are just a ripple, lapping against a mountain.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你溅起的这点水花, 也妄图撼动山岳。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4161168093", //LQ
      "Source": "Your life is but a flickering candle in this darkness without end.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的生命, 不过是永夜中摇曳的残烛。","JA":""}, //🌚怎么感觉, 这些新对话就是杨紫琼的中文, 然后将其翻译成的英文。
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1397455711", //LQ
      "Source": "How long could you ever hope to survive here, as we have?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你还奢望在此地支撑多久, 也配与我等比肩?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2267445888", //LQ
      "Source": "My time is infinite. Yours, alas, grows short.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我的时间无穷无尽。而你的, 可惜了, 时日无多。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2321881867", //LQ
      "Source": "You are a stupid beast, trapped in a slaughtering pen!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你不过是一介蠢物, 待宰的羔羊!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3946715123", //LQ
      "Source": "Like soft flesh and brittle bone, tossed against cold granite.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"区区凡躯肉体, 不过是以卵击石。","JA":""}, //备用-区区残躯软肉
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::532526716", //LQ
      "Source": "Like prey caught out on a snow field, you have nowhere to flee!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"犹如雪中困兽, 你已插翅难飞!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2387003919", //LQ
      "Source": "You are just a mayfly in a web. Your short life ending already.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你不过就是网中蜉蝣。命不久矣。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::471809014", //LQ
      "Source": "I can barely remember what your kind was ever like.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"吾几忆不起, 尔等族类昔日是何模样。","JA":""}, //扩-吾长存不朽, 尔等卑贱之族旧貌, 几已忘却。
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::269941536", //LQ
      "Source": "Are you even capable of forethought or strategy?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你究竟有无半分文韬武略?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3160993052", //LQ
      "Source": "Can you not provide any challenge at all? Pathetic!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"连一点点的挑战性都没有吗? 可悲!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3279395073", //LQ
      "Source": "I've been so bored for so long. Thank you for trying to amuse me.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我已许久没有消遣过了。多谢你的费心取悦。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3675723100", //LQ
      "Source": "It almost seems like a shame to end even this clumbsy, pathetic dance.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这场笨拙的猴戏也该收场了, 倒也有几分“遗憾”","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1925799799", //LQ
      "Source": "That person no longer exists! My will is unyielding",
      "Trans": {"SC":"昔日之人已死。我的意志无可动摇","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3181275816", //LQ
      "Source": "There's no use to appealing to my humanity! I surrendered that long ago.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"休要以人性相求! 那东西我早就舍弃了。","JA":""}, //休以人性相劝! 吾早已弃之。
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3006094786", //LQ
      "Source": "Ages of abandonment have hardened me, like molten steel quenched in ice.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"永世的孤绝已铸就了我, 犹如熔铁淬冰。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2061037996", //LQ
      "Source": "There is nothing you could ever do to hurt me!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"任你百般作为, 也休得伤我分毫!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1072702806", //LQ
      "Source": "I was broken and remade long before you woke up on any ARK.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在我历经破碎重生之际, 尔等尚在方舟之中沉眠未醒。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3417536644", //LQ
      "Source": "Your weak efforts can't touch what I have already endured.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"凭你这点能耐休想撼动我久经历炼之心。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1400962036", //LQ
      "Source": "I am untouchable. No long capable of feeling.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我身已超然物外。我心亦再无悲欢离合。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3813007726", //LK  🌚它真的会喷火吗? 还是纯嘴炮修辞
      "Source": "Ignite, Gigadesmodus! Taste unyielding hellfire!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"燃起吧, 巨翼魔蝠! 尝尝无尽炼狱业火!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::930215879", //LK
      "Source": "Feel heat, and burn!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"感受热浪, 焚烧殆尽!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::953704049", //LK
      "Source": "Unleash hell, Gigadesmodus!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"大开杀戒, 巨翼魔蝠!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2644151717", //LK
      "Source": "Let flames purify you!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"让烈焰净化你!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2359607785", //LK
      "Source": "Tear them apart!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"撕碎他们!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2948526413", //LK
      "Source": "Rip them to shreds!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"把他们撕成碎片!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2171248667", //LK
      "Source": "Make mincemeat of interlopers!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"碾碎这些入侵者!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2359987007", //LK
      "Source": "Slice them to pieces!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"把他们剁成碎块!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3449788021", //LK
      "Source": "Cut them to ribbons!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"让他们碎尸万段!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1422440061",
      "Source": "Increases overall size and number of victims Ossidon can carry in its Bolus.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"提高奥西顿用粘液团可携带的目标总体积与数量。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2906328204",
      "Source": "Increases head crest size and the duration Ossidon can roll its Bolus.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"提高头冠尺寸, 并延长奥西顿滚动粘液团的持续时间。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3539891493",
      "Source": "Increases fur length and the distance Ossidon can fire its Icicle Rain.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"提高毛发长度, 并增加奥西顿施放冰锥雨的射程。","JA":""},
