      "Source": "Mission Abandoned",
      "Trans": {"SC":"任务失败","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1153582508",
      "Source": "Defeat the Outpost Leader",
      "Trans": {"SC":"击败哨站首领","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2996533712",
      "Source": "Feeding Station",
      "Trans": {"SC":"投喂站","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4038612832",
      "Source": "Feeding Troughs",
      "Trans": {"SC":"喂食槽","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3273567862",
      "Source": "Barn",
      "Trans": {"SC":"畜棚","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3032326521",
      "Source": "Current Health Cost",
      "Trans": {"SC":"消耗当前血量","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3924871263",
      "Source": "Threatening", //buffname
      "Trans": {"SC":"潜在威胁","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1307875246",
      "Source": "You're considered a potential threat to the Lost-Aligned faction!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你已被失落正营视为潜在威胁!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2124283545",
      "Source": "Taming Aureliax", //buffname
      "Trans": {"SC":"驯服寒辉雪龙","JA":"馴服寒輝雪龙"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1138996899",
      "Source": "Board Aureliax",
      "Trans": {"SC":"骑上寒辉雪龙","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1415993069",
      "Source": "Like my menagerie? I keep a rotating collection of my favorite gargoyles on display here, in order to ward off invaders and rogues.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"喜欢我的这些藏品吗? 这里轮番陈列着我最中意的魔像, 为的就是抵御入侵者与那些宵小之徒。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3046233147",
      "Source": "You've finally made it to the upper city, where my most esteemed children are to be found free of worry and insecurity.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你终于到上城区了, 我最受器重子民们就住在这里 -- 无忧无虑, 毫无烦忧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3499843856",
      "Source": "You could be quite comfortable here...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你在这里也是可以过得相当舒适...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //You could be从语音的语气与字面分析这里算是一种邀请, 不是你本可以; 你也可以加我们, 成为失落大军的一员成为我的得力干将, 你会在上城过的很舒适。
      //(开局lk就已经发出了邀请, 现在再发出邀请)
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::591049849",
      "Source": "Imagine your own fiefdom out here. Bend the knee, and perhaps I'll reward you a secluded bit of these borderlands,",
      "Trans": {"SC":"试想在这片土地上, 拥有一片属于你的封地。俯首称臣吧, 我或可将边境这片僻静之地赏赐于你,","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3935841365",
      "Source": "...an outpost of your own to defend, and control.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"...一处由你亲自守卫并统领的专属哨站。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2749992248",
      "Source": "On this site, you will find the node my children use to teleport valuable supplies to our far-flung outposts.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在这片区域, 你会找到我的子民们将贵重物资送往…分布于各哨站的传送节点。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::774663783",
      "Source": "Since you called all the ARKs down to Earth with your Reseed Protocol, these borderland towns were overrun by aberrations from the one that crashed on our doorstep.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"自从你那“生态重建计划”将所有方舟召回地球, 这些边境城镇就被那艘坠毁的方舟所带来的畸变侵占了。","JA":""}, //适当砍掉一些
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3237375720",
      "Source": "Your ‘heroics’ caused the deaths of many of my people.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你那些所谓的“英勇壮举”害死了我无数的臣民。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1761873677",
      "Source": "Once there were many of these retreats scattered across the kingdom. This land was awarded to the first of my knights, who helped quell an early rebellion.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"曾几何时, 这样的静养之所遍布整个王国。这片土地, 是我赐予首位骑士的封赏 -- 正是他, 助力我平定了那场早期叛乱。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4248236433",
      "Source": "I had to close this sanctuary because of the chaos you unleashed.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"就因你造成的乱子, 不得不关掉这个庇护所。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1652574701",
      "Source": "Once I can guarantee their safety again, my adoring children will return to worship me for it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"只消我重新保障他们的安全, 我亲爱的子民们, 必将为此回归向我顶礼膜拜。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4010612490",
      "Source": "Here is the autonomous system of our kingdom, the courtyard where my people gather to discuss and solve our civic issues. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这里便是我们王国的自治核心, 我的子民们聚首在这个庭院里共商以及解决城内事务。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::806004120",
      "Source": "Their efforts free me to contemplate more existential threats.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他们的努力, 让我得以抽身去应对那些关乎存亡的重大威胁。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::773297688",
      "Source": "There to the east is how you should see me... I was the only one who could have kept my people alive across the ages, long after the end of the world at large.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::325769036",
      "Source": "I am the hero here, not you!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这里的英雄是我, 不是你!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::629763269",
      "Source": "Look north. That totem might be the last thing you ever see, if you continue your defiance.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3000806708",
      "Source": "Many have been forced to their knees before it, their pleas for mercy echoing across the caldera... ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"无数人都曾在它面前屈膝下跪, 求饶的哀鸣, 在火山口上空久久回荡...","JA":""}, //这个确实是南极的火山0.0
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::522985868",
      "Source": "I am quite generous to the deserving. This grotto once served as a retreat for the most well-regarded of my lords and ladies.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我对有功之辈向来慷慨。这处洞窟曾是我麾下最值得尊敬的领主与夫人们的静修的行宫。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::48003560",
      "Source": "Someone with your skills could enjoy such favors, were you only more compliant.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"以你这般身手, 本可坐拥这样的恩宠 -- 只需多那么几分顺从。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1795218229",
      "Source": "To your south is one of many monuments, erected by my grateful subjects.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的南面是我众多的纪念碑之一, 是由一群心怀感恩的臣民为我铸立的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3311007258",
      "Source": "You could learn a lot from them about humility and fidelity, if you cared about such virtues.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你若是有心修习谦逊与忠诚这类美德, 自能从他们身上学到诸多道理。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1311903359",
      "Source": "Like you, these mountains can be treacherous. I recommend treading carefully and trying not to overstep.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这山脉同你一般, 暗藏凶险。劝你步步谨慎, 切莫有分寸逾越。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::475837588",
      "Source": "Pride comes before a fall, and it’s such a long climb back up.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"坠入深渊之前人总会傲慢, 到时候想再爬回来, 路可就长了。","JA":""}, //这里是双关，用骄者必败不合适，少了一层意思
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3006983611",
      "Source": "From here, my children can watch over every living thing in the valley and dispatch enforcers to deal with any interlopers or fugitives.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在这里, 我的子民能监视谷中的一草一木, 并可随时派遣执法队去处置那些不速之客与亡命之徒。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3809986667",
      "Source": "Isn't it so much easier to work for me, rather than against me? I hope we have an understanding now.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"为我效力, 难道不比与我为敌要轻松得多吗? 希望你我此刻已达成共识。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::943272990",
      "Source": "I’m afraid you’ve made a nuisance of yourself. A few of my special children are on their way to convey my extreme disappointment.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"看来你已成了个不小的麻烦。我几位特别的子嗣正在赶来, 专程传达我的“失望透顶”。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::44667121",
      "Source": "You cannot escape my notice anywhere in this kingdom. I have eyes everywhere, and they see everything.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在这王国境内你于我面前无所遁形。我的眼线无处不在, 一切都尽收眼底。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1766329230",
      "Source": "See how nice it can be to do good works for our people?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"为我们这边的人做些善事, 不也挺好的?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3123527103",
      "Source": "You may just earn your way back into my good graces, if you can protect any other outposts you see in danger.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"若你能守护其他身陷险境的哨站, 或许你便能重获我的青睐。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
