    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2031947929",
      "Source": "Power House", //任务建筑
      "Trans": {"SC":"发电站","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2561498305",
      "Source": "Marksman's Hold", //任务名称
      "Trans": {"SC":"神射手要塞","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1409431796",
      "Source": "How dare you raid one of my outposts! My thralls will make you rue this decision.", //任务语音
      "Trans": {"SC":"竟敢袭击我的哨站! 我的血仆大军定会让你为此付出代价。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2161379127",
      "Source": "Fire Bowl", //任务建筑
      "Trans": {"SC":"火盆","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4003530556",
      "Source": "Platform", //任务建筑
      "Trans": {"SC":"平台","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4270134594",
      "Source": "Thrall Training Dummy", //任务建筑
      "Trans": {"SC":"血仆训练假人","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2141370144",
      "Source": "Thrall Campfire", //任务建筑
      "Trans": {"SC":"血仆篝火","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1493334388",
      "Source": "Small Box", //任务建筑
      "Trans": {"SC":"小箱子","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2333569598",
      "Source": "Fighting Pit", //任务建筑
      "Trans": {"SC":"格斗场","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1999885471",
      "Source": "Sword Rack", //任务建筑
      "Trans": {"SC":"剑架","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::963851472",
      "Source": "Marked for Death", //buffname
      "Trans": {"SC":"死亡标记","JA":"死亡標記"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //Missions\Bossfight\Modules\Fights\LostQueen\Attacks\ThrowScythe\Buff_ScytheTarget
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1623452676",
      "Source": "You must hide behind something before the Lost Queen kills you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你快去找个掩体躲起来, 不然可能会被失落王后秒杀掉的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2750585860",
      "Source": "Deactivate Feline Form",
      "Trans": {"SC":"解除猫猫形态","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3104746430",
      "Source": "Any building that opens into a cavern is worth investigating.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"但凡与洞穴相连的建筑都值得去探查一番。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::587520406",
      "Source": "Feel the heat in there? Here’s your chance to thaw out a bit!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"感觉到那里面的热气了吗? 这下能暖和一会儿了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3426174284",
      "Source": "Just look at that...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"看看那个...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3152711029",
      "Source": "Even though my time on that aberrant ARK was harrowing, the eerie beauty of its wild spaces could take my breath away.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"尽管我在那座畸变的方舟上度过的日子苦不堪言, 但它那原始之境透着诡异之美, 仍足以让我屏息。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4071488957",
      "Source": "This has to be the worst of the aberrant contamination from the crash. Definitely avoid any toxic purple pools.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这绝对是坠毁引发的异常污染中最严重的一处。千万要避开那些有毒的紫色池水。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::80869781",
      "Source": "Where's a charge pet when you need one?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"正需要光宠的时候它们都去哪儿了?","JA":""}, //目前没有语音, 具体需要根据语音来修改.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1358126118",
      "Source": "Strange to see aberrant flora and fauna from that ARK again, here on Earth. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"令人诧异的是, 竟然能在地球上再次见到那座方舟上的畸变动植物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::172397474",
      "Source": "Stuff’s especially hardy, considering it survived a crash from orbit. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"考虑到它们从轨道坠毁中都能活下来, 这些东西的生命力尤其顽强。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::912977244",
      "Source": "Seems like a great spot for a base! Put up some walls with lookout towers along those ridges, big gates across that opening in the rocks...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"看起来是个建基地的好地方! 沿着那些山脊筑起围墙和瞭望塔, 在岩石的那个缺口处架起一道大门...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::595027111",
      "Source": "Not bad at all.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"相当的不错。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1237410220",
      "Source": "Here’s a watchtower that’s seen better days. Guess the Lost King's hold over this region isn't as absolute as he'd have us believe.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这座瞭望塔早已风光不再。看来失落之王对这片区域的掌控, 并不像他想让我们相信的那样绝对。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::441635666",
      "Source": "Still, that looks to be one of the safer ways into his capitol.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不过, 这似乎仍是进入他的王都较为安全的途径之一。","JA":""}, //capitol不确定指的是哪里.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::263984401",
      "Source": "Ah -- this must be how the Lost King kept Arat Prime from freezing over: simple geothermic energy!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"啊 -- 看来失落之王就是靠这个让阿拉特·源域免于冰封的, 就是个简单的地热能!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::676361770",
      "Source": "I’ll bet there are thermal pipes all over the city...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我敢打赌, 这整座城市到处都有加热管道...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2356035772",
      "Source": "It's amazing how even in the coldest places, there are still hidden pockets of warmth and beauty... Flowers straining for the light.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"真神奇, 哪怕在最冷的地方, 也依然藏着片片温暖与美好...花朵奋力向着阳光生长。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2068653100",
      "Source": "This overlook is a perfect spot to take in most of the city from a safe distance. Try to make a mental map of the best routes in and out.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个观景点是个可以在安全距离远眺城市大部分区域的绝佳位置。试着在脑海中规划出最佳的进出路线。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1604776384",
      "Source": "You'll almost certainly need them later, when you go after the Codex in the palace!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你之后去宫殿寻找元码的时候, 几乎肯定会用到它们的!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1311778816",
      "Source": "Watch where you step...Those pools are filled with a volatile variant of Element an old friend of mine called ‘Edmundium’.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"小心脚下...那些池子里装满了一种不稳定的元素变体, 我的一位老朋友管它叫‘艾德蒙金属’。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2258249791",
      "Source": "Phew. That cave stinks of those shambling rotters Edmund left behind.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"呼, 这洞穴里一股子艾德蒙留下的那些蹒跚腐尸的臭味。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3779119685",
      "Source": "But... they ARE always searching for ways in. Think they might be onto something?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"但是...它们一直在找能进入的办法。你觉得, 它们会不会已经摸到什么门道了?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::676089898",
      "Source": "That should be enough sigils to get you access to the Codex in his palace!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些魔符应该足够让你进入他宫殿里找元码了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3246457799",
      "Source": "I’ll do everything I can, but you’re going to need all the help you can assemble for this assault.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我会尽我所能, 但这次进攻, 你得集结所有能召集到的帮手才行。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::804647425",
      "Source": "This is just what we needed, Survivor! Enough of these sigils will get you inside the Lost King's palace, and closer to his Codex.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这正是我们需要的, 生存者! 凑够这些魔符就能进入失落之王的宫殿, 离元码也更进一步了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3144280466",
      "Source": "I think you might’ve won this one over by helping an outpost. That's an interesting development...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我觉得可能因为这次哨站行动, 而赢得了他的好感。可真是个有意思的进展...","JA":""}, //怎么摧毁哨站也弹出这个, 所以我用一个比较模糊的翻译.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //Characters\Helena\Voice\WorldChatter\s_vo_helena_FirstEncounter_12_ThrallTamed
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2537452968",
      "Source": "Oh, Edmund. Only YOU could dream up something that bizarre.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"Oh, 艾德蒙...也只有你才想得出这么离奇的东西。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4016730577",
      "Source": "But if you did make it, it must have a use case...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"但既然真把它造出来了, 那它肯定有派上用场的地方...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3451612683",
      "Source": "A wingless dragon, like something out of Chinese folklore! Seeing this has to mean good luck.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一条没有翅膀的龙, 简直就像中国传说中的龙一样! 看见它准是个好兆头。","JA":""}, //见此吉兆, 必有好运
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::151719368",
      "Source": "Wow... isn’t it majestic? Imagine something so beautiful thriving in these icy wastes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"哇哦...是不是很壮丽? 想象一下, 这么美的东西竟然能在这片冰冷荒原里繁衍生息。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //Characters\Helena\Voice\WorldChatter\s_vo_helena_FirstEncounter_02_AngelFox
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3291231499",
      "Source": "Wonder if you could win its trust...? ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不知道你能不能赢得它的信任...?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::926343390",
      "Source": "Make sure you open that creature and look for any sigils it might’ve scarfed up. Never know what’ll help you get to the Codex!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一定要把那只生物剖开, 看看它有没有把什么魔符给吞下去了。说不定有哪样东西能帮你找到元码呢!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //Characters\Helena\Voice\Missions\s_vo_helena_DefenseOutpost_12_MinibossDefeated_Var3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::96983056",
      "Source": "Cut that carcass open like a piñata, and check it for sigils! Revenants devour anything in their path...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"快剖开尸体, 像砸彩罐一样, 仔细检查有没有魔符! 因为那些怨灵会把路上的一切都吞个精光...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //0.0这个piñata是什么? 我得查一下资料.
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2196302932",
      "Source": "Great work! Now see if it gobbled up anything valuable -- like the sigils that will get you into the palace!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"干得漂亮! 现在看看它们有没有吞下什么值钱的东西 -- 比如能让你进宫殿的那些魔符!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3208381687",
      "Source": "This outpost looks abandoned, but it might still have power. And that means it’s still defensible.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个哨站看起来已经废弃了, 但也许还有电。这就意味着它仍然具有防御的能力。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::983565298",
      "Source": "This is your chance to grab some booty, just do it fast and get out of there.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是你捞好处的好机会, 动作快点, 拿了就赶紧撤。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1338879765",
      "Source": "Scrounge up what you want, and get yourself a long way from here... pronto.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"快拾取你想要的东西, 然后离这里远远的...要快。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1081530031",
      "Source": "Feel around for keys, check the vault... Just make sure you’re long gone when the King’s backup gets here.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"摸索着找找钥匙, 再去翻翻宝库...国王的援兵赶来前, 必须撤得远远的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1592782317",
      "Source": "You don’t have much time for plunder, so snatch up what you can find and make your escape.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"没多少时间搜刮了, 能拿多少就拿多少, 然后赶紧后撤出去。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1928031123",
      "Source": "Better grab anything of value and clear out, before reinforcements arrive.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"最好把那些值钱的东西都顺走, 在援兵赶到之前迅速撤离。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2105229573",
      "Source": "Let them keep coming! You’ve planned for this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"尽管放他们过来! 一切都在你的计划当中。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //标记-用“你早有准备”这个翻译我感觉有点怪怪的, 因为我没有玩过这个任务所以我不太懂, 后续看需不需要修改.
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2528259500",
      "Source": "You do have a plan, right?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你确实有计划, 对吧?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4263247986",
      "Source": "Watch your back -- and your front too! More thralls are coming at you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当心身后 -- 前面也别大意! 更多血仆正朝你扑来。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3820985823",
      "Source": "That outpost must be important, if he’s willing to commit so much to defending it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"倘若他愿意投入这么多兵力来防守, 这处哨站肯定很重要!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2230201671",
      "Source": "How many of them are there? There must be something valuable in that outpost.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他们有多少人? 那座哨站里肯定藏着什么值钱的东西。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1208639480",
      "Source": "Really stirred up a nest of hornets here... Guess you’ll just have to keep swatting them down!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你这下可捅了马蜂窝了...看来只能继续把他们一个个打趴下了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::18133695",
      "Source": "More are on their way. Keep at their defenses! You've got this!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"更多麻烦还在赶来的路上。坚守防线! 你可以的!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3871615115",
      "Source": "They’re calling in reinforcements. Get ready!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他们在召集援军。做好战斗准备!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::776288000",
      "Source": "Heads up -- you have more thralls heading this way! ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当心 -- 又有更多的血仆正往这边赶来!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2691348903",
      "Source": "Look at all those cages and kennels. This outpost seems like a prison encampment. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"瞧瞧这些笼子和兽栏, 这处哨站简直就像个监狱营地。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2194183487",
      "Source": "Might feel good to set some of the Lost King’s captives free -- and reward yourself with some of his supplies!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"把失落之王的一些俘虏放出来, 想想都痛快 -- 顺便再用他的物资犒劳一下自己!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3273953309",
      "Source": "I see foundries, forges, furnaces... but no foot soldiers.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我看到铸造厂、锻炉、熔炉...却没见到一个步兵。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::209515616",
      "Source": "Expect them to defend their outpost from raiders with heavy armor and high explosives.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他们为了抵御袭击者, 估计会用重型装甲和高爆炸药来保卫这座哨站。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4130908850",
      "Source": "Better keep low around this outpost, Survivor. They’ve set snipers up high to take out intruders.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在这座哨站附近最好保持低调行事, 生存者。他们已在高处部署了狙击手来射杀入侵者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2857552226",
      "Source": "Any heist plans better include a way to defend yourself from a rain of projectiles.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"任何行动方案最好都考虑清楚如何应对枪林弹雨。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::145801977",
      "Source": "This place seems to be a training ground for his thralls. Assault this post, and you’re going to run into armored, well-trained enemies.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个地方似乎是那些血仆的训练基地。要是强攻这处据点, 你定会撞上全副武装且训练有素的敌人。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3459340422",
      "Source": "But they might just be guarding some high value treasure.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"但他们也可能只是在守卫某些价值连城的宝物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::153395368",
      "Source": "This must be a breeding center... Plenty of pens, feeding areas, even a landing pad for fliers!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这里一定是个繁育中心...到处都是围栏和饲养区, 甚至还有供飞行坐骑起降的平台!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1749638553",
      "Source": "If you’re planning to raid it for supplies, you should expect the thralls here to be mounted.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如果你打算来这里掠夺物资, 就得做好心理准备, 这里的血仆很可能是骑乘作战的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1381838557", //修补
      "Source": "If you're planning to raid it for supplies, you should expect the thralls here to be mounted.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如果你打算来这里掠夺物资, 就得做好心理准备, 这里的血仆很可能是骑乘作战的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3510957169", //标记-错误的修补: "0supplies" 印度发力了
      "Source": "If you're planning to raid it for 0supplies, you should expect thralls here to be mounted.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如果你打算来这里掠夺物资, 就得做好心理准备, 这里的血仆很可能是骑乘作战的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::960076909",
      "Source": "Focus, Survivor. You can’t lose now!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"集中精神, 生存者。你现在不可以输!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1620079520",
      "Source": "Hurry up, or you're not going to end up with anything to show for all of this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"要快, 不然折腾一通到头来你可能什么都捞不着。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3507760160",
      "Source": "You don’t want to run out of time and blow this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"别耽误太久, 不然这趟行动就泡汤了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3494572735",
      "Source": "Put him out of our misery.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"该和他做个了结了。","JA":""}, //得看游戏里的语音再具体做个改动.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //Characters\Helena\Voice\Bossfights\LostKing\s_vo_helena_LostKingFight_28_CrystalExplosion2_Var5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1740114573",
      "Source": "Finish him off!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"干掉他!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1596099099",
      "Source": "You’ve got him now!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"拿下他了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::368416330",
      "Source": "This is your moment!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"就是现在!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3956514527",
      "Source": "Now's your chance. Take it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"机会来了, 快上!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3922158089",
      "Source": "His pylons are failing. One more go-around should end this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他的能量塔正在失效。再绕一圈应该就能结束这一切。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2882627949",
      "Source": "He’s actually afraid of you. And he should be.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他其实在畏惧你。本该如此。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4281339578",
      "Source": "Hear the desperation in his voice? You’re winning.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"听出他声音里的绝望了吗? 我们要赢了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3934618553",
      "Source": "Might not feel like it, but you ARE making progress here.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"或许你现在还未察觉, 但你已经取得了很大的进展。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4291799729",
      "Source": "He can talk forever, I’ll give him that.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他确实能哔哔个不停, 这点我承认。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2029640830",
      "Source": "Despite all his bluster, his pylons are getting weaker with every regeneration.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"别看他嘴上虚张声势, 他的能量塔在每一次重新充能后都再变弱。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::386178103",
      "Source": "Don’t listen to him. You are making progress.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"别听他的。你推进得很有成效。","JA":""}, //标记-得需要上下文具体分析才好方便修改.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3936044744",
      "Source": "Focus on taking out his pylons again!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"集中火力, 再次拆掉他的能量塔!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2023065700",
      "Source": "He's using those Red Element crystals to power himself up... Let's use that against him!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他在靠那些腥红元素水晶给自己充能...我们就利用这一点来对付他!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::227177820",
      "Source": "If they explode near him, it should reverse the effect!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"只要将那些在他身边引爆, 就能让其效果逆转!","JA":""}, //这个将其 保留的话可能会书面化但是也表示清楚是上文的水晶.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2590539915",
      "Source": "Another pylon down. You’ve got this!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"又捣坏了一座能量塔。你能行的!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::838774375",
      "Source": "Keep going. Shut them all down!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"继续推进。把它们全都捣坏掉!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3740787497",
      "Source": "That’s the way. Break them all!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"就是这样。把它们全都打坏掉!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4224337145",
      "Source": "There you go! Don’t stop now.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这就对了! 现在别停下!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1216700494",
      "Source": "Great work. Now overload the rest!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"干得漂亮。现在让剩余的也都过载!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::845775840",
      "Source": "Disrupted another one.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"又干捣坏掉一个。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1363955632",
      "Source": "That pylon’s weakened enough for now.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那座能量塔现在已经削弱得差不多了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2631786554",
      "Source": "Yes -- that one’s starting to go!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"太好了 -- 那个要出问题了!","JA":""}, //不清楚具体什么情况用一个中性的翻译. 那边又可以指代塔也可以指代boss.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1895399369",
      "Source": "Good job damaging that one.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"干得好, 它快坏了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1156988565",
      "Source": "Another pylon almost overloaded.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"又一座能量塔快过载了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1956474012",
      "Source": "One down, three to go. At this rate, you’ll ground him in no time!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"干掉了一个, 还剩三个。照这进度, 你很快就能去收拾他!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //Characters\Helena\Voice\Bossfights\LostKing\s_vo_helena_LostKingFight_04_FirstPylonOverloaded
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3848698408",
      "Source": "The first pylon's almost shot, but you’ll need them all overloading at once.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"第一座能量塔就要过载了, 但你得让它们全部同时过载才行。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1198415769",
      "Source": "Neat trick, containing aberrant creatures with charged light-barriers. I’m almost impressed.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"手段挺巧, 用电荷光罩把畸变生物关在里面。差点就惊艳到我了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //Characters\Helena\Voice\Bossfights\Dungeon\s_vo_helena_BossDungeon_30_Lab_ChargeLightBarriersApproached
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3512241353",
      "Source": "All this effort, and Rockwell’s aberrant creatures are still plaguing his kingdom.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这么大费周章, 到头来罗克韦尔造出的畸变生物仍在祸害他的王国。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //Characters\Helena\Voice\Bossfights\Dungeon\s_vo_helena_BossDungeon_29_Lab_BalconyApproached
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3108140383",
      "Source": "Too bad Edmund’s moved on -- he might’ve been able to help us...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可惜艾德蒙已经走了 -- 要是他还在, 说不定能帮上我们...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::318470158",
      "Source": "That’s the tunnel to the Superluminal Relay, but you shouldn’t need to go out there physically.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那是通往超光速中继站的隧道, 不过你应该不需要亲自去那边。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //Characters\Helena\Voice\Bossfights\Dungeon\s_vo_helena_BossDungeon_22_Antechamber_WentLeft
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::327938510",
      "Source": "We should be able to get you here to Arat from the palace, as long as the 4D coordinates are still aligned.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们应该能从宫殿把你传送到阿拉特这里来 -- 前提是四维坐标还保持对齐。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::823821496",
      "Source": "We’ve got the whole override code! Now all we need is his master key.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们已经拿到完整的覆写代码了! 现在就差他的主密钥了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3995095544",
      "Source": "That won’t be on some random thrall. Your best bet is his administrative wing, over there...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"目标不会在普通的血仆身上。你最好去他的行政区域找找, 就在那边...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3993195660",
      "Source": "You bought us some time, but we still need the rest of his override code.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你给我们争取到了一点时间, 但我们还是需要他那套覆写代码的剩余部分。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2559839720",
      "Source": "Check everywhere, but you might need to be on foot to get in some spaces.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"四处都找找, 不过有些区域可能得步行才能进入。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::614064040", //L
      "Source": "What a cute little kit! Poor thing looks lonely... Maybe if you come in low and slow you won't spook it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"好可爱的小家伙! 它看着孤零零, 怪可怜的...也许你压低身子, 慢慢靠近, 就不会吓到它。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4235131100",
      "Source": "CRYO LIQUID",
      "Trans": {"SC":"冷冻液体","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2703678380",
      "Source": "Cryo Liquid",
      "Trans": {"SC":"冷冻液体","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
