      "Source": "Chance",
      "Trans": {"SC":"机率","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1795865723"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "138D98384B350A30CC45DDB1A12B6DE1",
      "Source": "Chance",
      "Trans": {"SC":"机率","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1795865723"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "B1CFD1644DA978EC646AFDAC4BED8CEE",
      "Source": "Chance",
      "Trans": {"SC":"机率","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1795865723"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "B2F783A6410E1E5BB14412A3CD9E8BE7",
      "Source": "Chance",
      "Trans": {"SC":"机率","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1795865723"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "1E62D33B4AB2E5414FEF6A8A409EE18B",
      "Source": "Chance",
      "Trans": {"SC":"机率","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1795865723"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3928130343", //L
      "Source": "Before you lies our Great Southern Bridge, symbol of our control over the valley and outer reaches to the south.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在你面前的是我们伟大的南方大桥, 它象征着我们对这片山谷以及更南方外围地区的掌控","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2435412624", //L
      "Source": "Through many eyes, I am watching your every move.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"透过无数双眼睛, 我正注视着你的一举一动。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4288186291", //H
      "Source": "That must be a projector for the forcefield dome holding back the Reseeding.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那一定是用来阻挡重新播种的穹顶立场发射装置。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3956922909", //H
      "Source": "If you can make it to the Codex, you can disable all of this and finally rid the world of Element.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如果你能到达元码所在的位置, 就能解除这一切, 最终让世界摆脱元素的困扰。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2600961921", //L
      "Source": "I'm sensing a revenant Dilophosaur in this incoming wave.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我能感到这波来袭里有一只怨灵双嵴龙。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3352249778", //L
      "Source": "It can spit acid from beyond the range of your defenses, so you’ll need to bring the fight to it yourself!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"它能在你的防御范围之外喷射酸液, 所以你得主动出击!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::711282548", //H
      "Source": "Careful... Something terrible had to have been done to that poor creature.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"要小心...一定有人对那可怜的家伙做了什么可怕的事。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1305818092", //H
      "Source": "It couldn’t have evolved in this environment.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"它不可能是在这种环境中进化而来的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::156042274", //H
      "Source": "Eugh. Better stop that bloated thing before it gets too close! It looks fit to burst.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"呃, 趁那胀嘟嘟的玩意儿还没靠太近之前干掉它! 它看着都快要炸开了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::51536913", //H
      "Source": "That bigger one is probably a lot stronger as well. But at least all that muscle’s slowing it down...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那个体型更大的家伙, 力气很可能也大得多, 不过好在那些肌肉反而拖慢了它...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1736673855", //L
      "Source": "You’ve taken your first thrall from me! I just hope you’re ready for the responsibility. Heavy hangs the crown...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你已从我这儿带走了第一个血仆! 只希望你做好这个准备。欲戴王冠, 必承其重...","JA":""}, //你从我这带走了你的第一个奴仆!
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1155409157",
      "Source": "Ghillie",
      "Trans": {"SC":"吉利服","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1319118831",
      "Source": "Execution Success", //buffname
      "Trans": {"SC":"处决成功","JA":"處决成功"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //Dinos\BossBat\Attacks\TailExecutionStrike\Buff_ExecutionSucess
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4173362990",
      "Source": "+25% Damage",
      "Trans": {"SC":"+25% 伤害","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::688059419",
      "Source": "Helena is trying to get through to Mei-Yin!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"海莲娜正在试着与美盈联系!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1977668256",
      "Source": "Take the time to heal up and prepare for combat",
      "Trans": {"SC":"抓紧时间疗伤并为战斗做准备","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //{
    //  "NamespaceHash": "Content::34273377", //没有本地化
    //  "Source": "Waiting...",
    //  "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
    //  "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    //},
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3663953024",
      "Source": "Ready to Ascend",
      "Trans": {"SC":"已做好飞升准备","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4093240031",
      "Source": "Terminal",
      "Trans": {"SC":"终端","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::350962353",
      "Source": "DANGER!", //buffname
      "Trans": {"SC":"危险!","JA":"危險!"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //Missions\Bossfight\Modules\Fights\LostQueen\Barrier\Buff_PlayerBarrierLC
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2790220756",
      "Source": "You are outside the Red Barrier!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你已身处血色屏障之外了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2640644638",
      "Source": "These training posts are an important part of my kingdom’s defenses.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些训练哨所是我王国防御体系的重要组成部分。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::276543600",
      "Source": "But if it’s a fight you want, my Master-Instructor and his Ossidon are about to give you a final lesson.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"但如果你执意要战, 我的统帅和他的奥西顿就要给你上上这最后一课了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1451844958", //H
      "Source": "The Codex has to be somewhere inside his palace... Let’s just hope this ‘Lost King’ hasn't realized why you’re here.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"元码肯定藏在这宫殿的某处...只希望失落之王没有意识到你此行的目的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1494631885",
      "Source": "Explore the Palace to find the Codex",
      "Trans": {"SC":"探索宫殿并找到元码","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1848897877",
      "Source": "Find the Codex",
      "Trans": {"SC":"找到元码","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3119085009", //H
      "Source": "Just stick to our plan, okay? Locate the Codex, transmit it to me, and then we’ll see about getting you out of that nightmare too.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"按我们的计划行事, 没问题吧? 找到元码后将它传输给我, 之后我会想办法把你从这个地方救出去。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4220780631", //L
      "Source": "What have we here? A wayward pet has finally found its way back to us. How could I ever again trust such a disobedient and ungrateful cur?  ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"看看是谁来了? 一只任性的宠物终于知道回来了。我怎么可能再信这样不听话又忘恩负义的崽种呢?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1081814650", //L
      "Source": "My doors are no longer open to you, alas. And I’m afraid the penalty for trespassing on royal grounds is quite severe.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我的大门不再为你敞开了, 而你擅闯王室领地, 将会受到严厉的惩罚。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2399926425", //H
      "Source": "Better stay alert for trouble, while I try to pick his locks...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"最好提防着突发状况, 我来试着解开他的锁...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::926806146", //H
      "Source": "Do what you can to stay alive, while I keep trying to get you inside...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"尽你所能活下去, 我继续想办法让你进去...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2781613807",
      "Source": "Buy Helena Time",
      "Trans": {"SC":"为海莲娜争取时间","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2116510046",
      "Source": "Defend yourself from the Lost while Helena unlocks the next door",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在海莲娜打开下一扇门时, 抵御那些失落军团的袭击","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1896727416", //H
      "Source": "You’re doing great! Just a few last stragglers...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你做的真好! 还剩最后这几只掉队的...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3291220557", //H
      "Source": "Nice work, Survivor! You bought me time to crack the front gates.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"干得漂亮, 生存者! 你为我争取到了宝贵的开门时间。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1837088082", //H
      "Source": "Well... what are you waiting for? Get in there before he can lock you out again!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"好啦...你还等什么? 趁他把你关在外面之前, 赶快进去!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2844279285", //L
      "Source": "Once again you have accomplished the impossible. Do you have someone on the inside helping you?  ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你又一次做到了不可能的事。是有内应在帮你吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::405257313", //L
      "Source": "While I look into that, I'm restricting all access but my own. My children will be there soon to show you out.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在我查清之前, 我会封锁除我之外的所有访问权限。我的子民们很快就会把你给轰出去。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::992880457", //H
      "Source": "For an all-powerful king, he sure seems worried about you getting to him.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"作为一位手握全权的王, 他似乎很担心你能接近他。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1663697093", //H
      "Source": "While I look for another way in, you’d better get ready for company.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当我在找另外入口时, 你最好做好招架的准备。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::262062161",
      "Source": "Whoever that is, they're... unconnected to the ARK network? Now that’s weird. Try not to seem hostile.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不管对方是谁, 他们...居然没有接入方舟网络? 这也太奇怪了。尽量别显得有敌意。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2529707268",
      "Source": "Decrypt the Lock",
      "Trans": {"SC":"解码密钥","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::125072090",
      "Source": "Find the Override Codes and Master Override Key",
      "Trans": {"SC":"寻找覆写代码和主覆写密钥","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1615808157",
      "Source": "Master Override Key:",
      "Trans": {"SC":"主覆写密钥:","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1785783745",
      "Source": "Code Fragments:",
      "Trans": {"SC":"代码片段:","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::633722241", //H
      "Source": "Part of an override code! See if you can find the rest of it -- and his master encryption key.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是一段覆写代码的片段! 看看你能不能找到剩下的部分 -- 以及它的主加密的密钥。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1285289594", //H
      "Source": "There’s more of the code! Keep looking for the rest.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"还有更多的代码! 继续寻找剩余的部分。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2939702179", //H
      "Source": "The way in’s too narrow for most of your tames, so you're on foot from here.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"对于大多数坐骑来说, 这个入口太狭窄了, 所以从这里开始你得步行前进了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1931613951", //H
      "Source": "Make sure to arm yourself before going in after that key.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"进去拿那个密钥之前, 一定要武装好自己。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3386202492", //H
      "Source": "You found the master encryption key! Now I can decrypt the override code...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"拿到主加密的密钥了! 现在我可以解密覆写代码了...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1904477020", //H
      "Source": "Open sesame! Let’s hope that’s the last lock I need to pick.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"芝麻开门! 但愿这是我要开的最后一把锁了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::385693229", //L
      "Source": "You do realize you can’t win, don’t you? You’re all alone, against an entire kingdom!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你该不会以为自己能赢吧? 你孤身一人, 怎能对抗举国之力?","JA":""}, //这样就通顺一些.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3154054075", //L
      "Source": "So be it. I'll be waiting for you in my Great Hall.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"就这样吧。我会在我的大殿里等你。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3354232874", //H
      "Source": "Ignore him, and head in under that stuck door.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"额别理他, 从那扇门进去。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2898793518", //H
      "Source": "Remember, our main goal here is getting to the Codex before he realizes that’s what we’re after.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"要记住, 我们的首要目标是抢在他反应过来之前拿到那份元码。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1234627719", //L
      "Source": "Why would you go out there, when you were just shy of my Great Hall? Where are you going?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"为什么还要往那边走? 你明明都快到我的大殿了。你要去哪里?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1021835949", //H
      "Source": "You’ve definitely got the King’s attention now! He’s called in more thralls.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这下已经底引起那位王的注意了, 他调来了更多的血仆。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1822115879", //H
      "Source": "I’m sorry Survivor, but there’s no time to catch your breath! ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我抱歉, 生存者, 但目前没有时间说这些了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1872872397", //H
      "Source": "nside to the left, you’ve got a straight shot to the Codex -- but you’ve got to hurry!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"往里走左转, 就能直达元码的存放处 -- 但你动作要快!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::874976597", //H-标记-修补官方原版有漏字了
      "Source": "Inside to the left, you’ve got a straight shot to the Codex -- but you’ve got to hurry!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"往里走左转, 就能直达元码的存放处 -- 但你动作要快!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2304935800", //L
      "Source": "You were never after me... You want my Codex! But why, unless... ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你本就不是冲我来的, 你想要的是元码! 但为什么, 难道...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2615080099", //L
      "Source": "That’s who’s been helping you? Tell your Homo Deus friend she can’t have it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"原来一直在帮你的人是她? 告诉你那神人朋友, 她别想拿到!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::819625086", //H
      "Source": "He seems to have an endless supply of soldiers to sic on you, doesn’t he?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他似乎有源源不断的士兵一波又一波围攻你。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2506783385",
      "Source": "Look out -- the gargoyles!", //H
      "Trans": {"SC":"要当心 -- 那些魔像!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1161625721",
      "Source": "Defeat the Guardians",
      "Trans": {"SC":"打败守护者","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2483481497",
      "Source": "Destroy all the Gargoyles to open the final door to the Codex",
      "Trans": {"SC":"摧毁所有魔像, 打开通往元码位置的最后一扇门","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4279430207",
      "Source": "Enemies:",
      "Trans": {"SC":"敌人:","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1577324485", //H
      "Source": "This is it... the Codex is somewhere on the other side of this door!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"就是这里了...元码就在这扇门的另一处!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2247222201",
      "Source": "Reach the Codex",
      "Trans": {"SC":"取得元码","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3512496016",
      "Source": "Bring all Survivors and Tames to the Codex, and prepare for the final battle!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"集合所以生存者与驯养生物到元码位置处以开启最终决战!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2853990092", //H
      "Source": "You just need to get to it before the Lost King does.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你需要抢在失落之王前赶到那里。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::562770514",
      "Source": "Preparing for the final battle",
      "Trans": {"SC":"准备最终决战","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3316527683", //L
      "Source": "I should kill you for invading our refuge like this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我真该杀了你, 竟敢这样闯入我们的庇护所。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::151500400", //L
      "Source": "The damage you have caused will take hundreds of years to repair.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你造成的破坏, 需要数百年才能修复。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2987359063", //L
      "Source": "But you remind me of someone from long ago, another true survivor...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可你让我想起了很久以前的某个人, 一个真正的生存者...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::19203119", //L
      "Source": "Rockwell told me that she would one day seek to destroy our colony.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"罗克韦尔他告诉我说, 有朝一日她会试图来摧毁我们的殖民地。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::203764737", //L
      "Source": "So I wonder... Through some dark manipulation of our technology, does she speak through you now?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"所以我在想...会不会是通过某种我们的黑暗操纵, 让她现在正在借你来发声?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1027062613", //L
      "Source": "Tell me... what was your plan if you made it this far? Assuming this was ever your own plan at all.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"告诉我...你若走到这里, 原本你的打算是什么? 假设这一切真的是你自己的计划。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1467643911", //h
      "Source": "Don't say anything! This has to be a trick.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"别说任何话! 这肯定是个圈套。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1216095264", //l
      "Source": "That force which stopped me from turning you... I was hoping you would bring her here with you...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那股阻止我把你同化的力量...我本希望你能把她一起带来...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2331070967", //l
      "Source": "That I might convince one of their kind to spare my people from the cleansing fire.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这样我或许能说服他们当中的一个, 让我的族人免遭这场净化之火的屠戮。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3715168100", //l
      "Source": "You see, we do not wish to join their world, and with it, suffer the inevitable decay and corruption of mankind.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你要知道, 我们不渴望加入他们的世界, 更不愿因此承受人类社会注定的腐朽与堕落。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3979605950", //l
      "Source": "All of the terrible sacrifices my people have made have been simply to live in peace, among our own.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我的族人所付出的一切牺牲, 不过是为了在自己的世界里和平的活下去。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3090596379", //l
      "Source": "Show yourself, puppet master!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"现身吧, 幕后主使!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3271366054", //l
      "Source": "No? She refuses to present herself after all? (chuckle)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不行? 她终究还是不肯露面吗? (轻笑)","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1974243022", //l
      "Source": "You are a disappointment.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你真令人失望","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2572042262", //L
      "Source": "Gigadesmodus, your master beckons!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"巨翼魔蝠, 你的主人在召唤!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3322497906",
      "Source": "The time for battle has arrived!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"战斗的时刻到了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3011232587",
      "Source": "Now I am going to kill you. Show me what you’ve got!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"现在, 我要杀了你。让我看看你有什么本事!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::153931286", //L
      "Source": "Try to at least make this amusing. We haven't had a real challenge in ages.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"至少让这事变得有趣起来吧。我们已经很久没遇到真正的挑战了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::218187740",
      "Source": "Defeat the Lost King",
      "Trans": {"SC":"打败失落之王","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::288968776",
      "Source": "Disable all four Pylons at once",
      "Trans": {"SC":"同时关停四座能量塔","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1156551333",
      "Source": "Powered",
      "Trans": {"SC":"供能","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::580029388",
      "Source": "Overloaded",
      "Trans": {"SC":"已过载","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3648534745", //H
      "Source": "You won’t stand a chance, as long as he's airborne. But if you can overload those pylons and force the Lost King to the ground...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"只要他还在空中, 你将毫无胜算。但如果你能让那些能量塔过载, 迫使失落之王落到地面的话...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::664551127",
      "Source": "Pylon",
      "Trans": {"SC":"能量塔","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2743540085", //L
      "Source": "It’s no use. My Sanguine Tek is self-repairing!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"白费力气。我的腥红泰克会自我修复的!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2403582298", //L
      "Source": "If I cannot stop you, there is still someone left... who can...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"即便我拦不住你, 后面还有...她可以...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1081738473", //L
      "Source": "My Queen! Hear me... The kingdom is yours. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我的王后! 听我说...王国是你的了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1599015360", //L
      "Source": "Protect the children! Protect the Lost!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"保护子民们! 保护失落之地!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2465198444", //L
      "Source": "You will not...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你绝对无法...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4221159273", //L
      "Source": "...survive her.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"...胜过她。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::408274967", //H
      "Source": "His... queen?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他的...王后?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2677285988", //H
      "Source": "I'm accessing what I can of the Codex to see what he's...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我正在尽量读取元码里能调用的部分, 看看他到底...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1269674882", //H
      "Source": "Oh no.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"哦不","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::307898327", //H
      "Source": "How could I have missed this?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我怎么没注意到这个?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1003272165", //L
      "Source": "Impressive for you to have traveled so very far, Li Meiyin...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"真令人感叹, 你竟然跋涉如此遥远, 李美盈...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1052809851", //L
      "Source": "...only to fall prostrate before my feet.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"...只为跪倒在我脚下。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2590224720", //Meiyin
      "Source": "Reveal yourself, devil, and we shall see who does the falling!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"现身吧, 魔鬼, 让我们看看究竟是谁会倒下!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3492298841", //L
      "Source": "I have seen your memories within the Codex.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我已在元码中窥见你的记忆。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::716171460", //L
      "Source": "You are a broken soul.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你是一颗破碎的灵魂。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1205268364", //L
      "Source": "You left behind those dearest to you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你亲手抛弃了自己最珍视的人。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2252744147", //L
      "Source": "One murdered...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一人遇害...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2018175323", //Diana
      "Source": "You'll come back for me, right babe?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你会回来找我的, 对吧, 宝贝?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3980968956", //Diana
      "Source": "Never let go. I -- I don't think I can face death again alone.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"别松手。我 -- 我觉得我再也没办法独自面对死亡了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1784324858", //Rockwell
      "Source": "Meiyin!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"美盈!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::142102320", //L
      "Source": "...and watched another vanish into nothingness.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"...又眼睁睁看着另一个人消失化为虚无。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1078761924", //H
      "Source": "Never forget, Meiyin... we’re all part of the Dream.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"永远别忘了, 美盈...我们都只是梦的一部分。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3892532502", //H
      "Source": "It's nothing more than that. And I'll always love you there.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这没什么大不了的。我会在那边永远爱着你。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::618534317", //L
      "Source": "And what of your allies? Left dormant within an endless hibernation, awaiting a savior who may never come.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那你的盟友呢? 他们被遗留在无尽的沉眠中, 陷入漫长的冬眠, 等待着一个也许永远不会到来的救世主。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3777771273", //Bob
      "Source": "Well, if we all got such a long wait ahead of us, might as well ride it out in these here glass coffins.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"唉, 要是得等上这么久, 那还不如就躺进这些玻璃棺材熬过去吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3244945118", //Bob
      "Source": "I could use some beauty sleep. Just hope Little Miss Prof’s right about this, uh, prophecy of hers.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我正好需要补个美容觉, 只希望那位 “教授小姐” 的预言...能灵验。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2075184763", //Bob
      "Source": "A thousand years, Helena, sheesh...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"千年啊, 海莲娜, 啧...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3341070474", //L
      "Source": "Now, here at the end of the world, it is just you and I, the last of our kind. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如今, 在这世间的尽头, 只剩你与我 -- 我们最后的同类","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1601764382",
      "Source": "Is this not meant to be?", //L
      "Trans": {"SC":"这不是命中注定吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2783622152", //Meiyin
      "Source": "Time has not been kind to you, Lost King.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"时光对你可不温柔, 失落之王。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1940137133", //L
      "Source": "Such is the price of eternity. But only a pittance for its many spoils.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这就是永生的代价。可与它带来的诸多裨益相比, 不过九牛一毛。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1562304145", //Meiyin
      "Source": "The true price was your soul, and those of your children.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"真正的代价, 是你的灵魂, 以及你子民们的灵魂。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1405020542", //Meiyin
      "Source": "You know what I'm here for. Give me the Codex, and I will leave you in eternal peace.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你清楚我为何而来。把元码交给我, 我便让你永享安宁。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2941527679", //L
      "Source": "To give you that would force my kind into starvation.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"若把它给了你, 我族便只能在饥饿中苟活。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2449033957", //L
      "Source": "Besides, only I know how to deploy the Codex to create life.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"更何况, 只有我知道如何驱使元码孕育生命。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1874831995", //L
      "Source": "Here is my offer: join us as my consort, and when the earth is finally cleansed...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我的条件是: 做我的王后, 待地球终将被净化...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1481759321", //L
      "Source": "...then we shall accomplish what you seek, and bring your beloved pair back into the world.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"...我们便替你达成所求, 把你挚爱的二人带回这世上。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::279857118", //Meiyin
      "Source": "I would never become one of your kind.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我绝不会成为你们那种东西。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::202428140", //Meiyin
      "Source": "Hand over the Codex now, or I will take it from you!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"现在交出元码, 否则别怪我不客气!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2740950474", //L
      "Source": "Hmm...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"哼哼...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2791131339", //L
      "Source": "Then let us see what terrible furies the great Meiyin is capable of.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那就让我见识见识, 伟大的美盈究竟能掀起怎样恐怖的怒焰。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2212236626", //L
      "Source": "All that rage... such power...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这滔天怒火...这般力量...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::308499353", //L
      "Source": "You would make a fine queen for my people, and thereby earn your reward.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你会成为我族一位出色的王后, 也会因此得到属于你的奖赏。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2542829056", //Meiyin
      "Source": "My soul and free will are not for sale.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我的灵魂与自由意志, 绝不出卖!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1870280410", //L
      "Source": "Everything in this world has a price, and the soul of man is but a token in the exchange.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"世间万物皆有价码, 而人的灵魂, 不过是交易中的一枚筹码。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2427249401", //L
      "Source": "A valiant effort, Meiyin! But set against the infinite, any mortal will break.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"勇气可嘉, 美盈! 可在无穷面前, 任何凡躯终将崩折。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3923859826", //L
      "Source": "Impossible...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不可能...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2073718462",
      "Source": "You -- you cannot be broken. But... only I can use the Codex.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你 -- 你还不能杀我。因为...只有我能用元码。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2329209352", //L
      "Source": "Kill me, Meiyin, and you kill them!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"杀了我, 美盈, 也等于你杀了他们!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4232494606", //Diana
      "Source": "You can do this, Mei.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你能做到的, 美盈。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2535187594", //H
      "Source": "You can wait out the long dark.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你能熬过这漫漫长夜。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3411236511", //Diana
      "Source": "A thousand years of darkness for another lifetime together...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"千年的黑暗, 只为换取一世相守...","JA":""}, //知道要千年的王后为了可以换戴安娜复活
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1934759579", //H
      "Source": "Hide yourself away, deep inside.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"藏好本心, 敛于深处","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::476738826", //H
      "Source": "You will need to stay so strong... as you always have been.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你要保持坚强...一如你向来的模样。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2946184484", //H&D
      "Source": "Unbreakable.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"坚不可摧","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4133621724", //L
      "Source": "Welcome to our family.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"欢迎加入我们的家族。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2450789694", //LQ
      "Source": "Trespassers, you should not have come here!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"擅闯者, 你不该踏足此地!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::188733763", //LQ
      "Source": "You will feed the Lost Children, and your strength will be added to theirs.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你们将喂养失落的子民们, 而你们的力量也将归入他们...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3078765337", //LQ
      "Source": "And to me, their Queen!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"也归入我 -- 他们的王后!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1092733578",
      "Source": "Defeat the Lost Queen",
      "Trans": {"SC":"击败失落王后","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2788326094",
      "Source": "Acquire Mei-Yin's Tek Spear",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获取美盈的泰克矛","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::415202999", //H
      "Source": "Meiyin... What have they done to you? Survivor, please -- I'm begging you, we have to help her!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"美盈...他们对你做了什么? 生存者求你了 -- 我求你, 我们一定要救她!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::248128223", //H
      "Source": "I can't leave Meiyin alone, not again. There must be some way to lower her defenses, and reach the person she was...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我不能再次丢下美盈一人了。一定有办法降低她的防御, 找回曾经的那个她...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3177628206", //H
      "Source": "Okay, that didn’t work. She wasn't even phased! Better to keep the crystals around for cover.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"好吧, 这招没用, 她甚至一点反应都没有! 最好是用周围的水晶作为掩护。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::856366165", //H
      "Source": "None of your weapons will do any good against her. Her Red Element shielding is too strong!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的这些武器对她根本没用。她的腥红元素护盾强度太高了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2533725164", //H
      "Source": "But hang on... I’m detecting an opposing power-source nearby...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"等一下...我感觉附近有个不对劲的能量反应...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3966930898", //H
      "Source": "Meiyin almost took down the Lost King with that Tek Spear a thousand years ago.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"美盈就是在千年前手持那柄泰克矛, 差一点就击败了失落之王。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2782990027", //H
      "Source": "Rockwell must’ve infected her weapon with Edmundium during his time here... so she might just be vulnerable to it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"罗克韦尔待在这里的这段时间, 肯定那艾德蒙金属污染了她的武器...这或许对她有奇效。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1460044496", //H
      "Source": "Go get that spear, Survivor!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"去拿那柄泰克矛, 生存者!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2386809621",
      "Source": "PickUp!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"拾取!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::345874204",
      "Source": "Destroy the tether before the Codex can heal the Lost Queen",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在元码还没治愈失落王后前切断它们之间的链接!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4143514177",
      "Source": "Teather", //错误版本-已失效
      "Trans": {"SC":"链接","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3955937877", //修补-该修补已生效
      "Source": "Tether",
      "Trans": {"SC":"链接","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2690095795",
      "Source": "Weaken the Lost Queen so Helena can free Mei-Yin",
      "Trans": {"SC":"削弱失落王后, 好让海莲娜解救美盈","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::363698018", //LQ
      "Source": "Bow before your Queen!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"臣服于你们的王后!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2530513938", //H
      "Source": "Don't bother trying to block or dodge that attack. Just try to take cover if she does it again.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"别要大费周折去格挡或闪避那记攻击了, 要是她再出手, 就赶紧找掩体躲一下。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::847262835", //H
      "Source": "Yes, that did it! Rockwell had one last trick up his sleeve, after all...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"对, 成功了! 罗克韦尔果然还藏了最后一手...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3682284674", //H
      "Source": "Remember who you really are.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"要记得你真正是谁。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2219961354", //LQ
      "Source": "Helena?  I am...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"海莲娜? 我是...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1587128976", //LQ
      "Source": "No, I am the Lost Queen!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不, 我是失落王后!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3891626887", //H
      "Source": "You need to hit her NOW. Before she can do whatever she's getting ready to do.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你得在就对她动手。在她准备好行动之前就先发制人。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3849714954",
      "Source": "Helena is trying to get through to Mei-Yin! Take the time to heal up and prepare for combat",
      "Trans": {"SC":"海莲娜正在试着与美盈联系! 先花些时间疗伤, 为接下来的战斗做准备","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::762601727", //H
      "Source": "Hang in there Meiyin... We'll find a way to reach you!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"坚持住, 美盈我们会想办法解救你的!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3397236974", //H
      "Source": "We have to save her, Survivor! We can't -- I can't -- leave her alone again.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们一定要救她, 生存者! 我们不能 -- 我不能 -- 再把她一个人丢下了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3299852990", //H
      "Source": "Meiyin... your name is Li Meiyin.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"美盈...你的名字是李美盈。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::852645768", //H
      "Source": "You were born just before the time of the Three Kingdoms.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你出生在三国来临之前。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::77691307", //H
      "Source": "Your parents were murdered by the Emperor, and you were raised in secret by your grandfather to be an unyielding warrior.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的父母被皇帝所害, 你的祖父将你秘密抚养长大, 把你磨练成一名不屈的战士。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1291291764", //LQ
      "Source": "So much pain...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"好痛...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3108115438", //LQ
      "Source": "I will not suffer such loss, not ever again!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我绝不会再承受这样的惨痛, 永远不会!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2262236287",
      "Source": "I'm sorry, Meiyin. I should've been there for you when you needed me.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"对不起, 美盈...在你最需要我的时候, 我却不在你身边。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2765717346", //
      "Source": "No... she's rebuilding herself with the Codex. Stop her!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不好...她正在用元码重塑自身。快阻止她!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::488688350", //H
      "Source": "This is all my fault... I have to make it right.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这一切都是我的错...我必须去弥补。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1537130124", //H
      "Source": "Your brother was Han.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的兄长叫韩","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::729682015", //H
      "Source": "He fought by your side in the Yellow Turban Rebellion.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"黄巾起义时, 他与你一起并肩作战。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3152572188", //H
      "Source": "He believed in you -- everyone did.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他相信你 -- 所有人都相信你。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::555585548", //H
      "Source": "You were a leader. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你曾是领袖。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1448270130", //LQ
      "Source": "Han...? ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"韩...?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::843538723", //LQ
      "Source": "No, that life is gone. STOP THIS!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不, 那段人生已经结束了, 不要说了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1267656379", //H
      "Source": "Look at that... She’s bleeding out all the energy she built up. Keep doing what you just did!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"看看那个...她积攒起来的能量都在一点点流失了。继续做你刚才做的事!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3109522722", //H
      "Source": "She took that defensive stance to try to get you to attack recklessly. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"她摆出防御姿态就是想诱你莽撞出手。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3855767505", //H
      "Source": "Don't fall for it, and keep your distance!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"别中计了, 拉开距离!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1413191090", //H
      "Source": "I left you once, Meiyin, but I won't this time.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我曾离开过你一次, 美盈, 但这次我不会了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2223766240", //H
      "Source": "You deeply loved a noblewoman, Xin Zhui.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你曾深爱着一位贵族女孩 -- 辛追。","JA":""}, //啊这..
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1819719604", //H
      "Source": "You were going to run away together, to escape judgement. But she betrayed you...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你们本要一同逃走, 逃避审判, 可她背叛了你...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2266132531", //H
      "Source": "and you vowed never to love again, until--",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你便发誓不再去爱, 直到 --","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3191732906", //LQ
      "Source": "I don’t love... I can’t love -- it’s a weakness. Get out of my head!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我无法去爱...我不能爱 -- 那是一种软弱。滚出我的脑海!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1231344367", //H
      "Source": "Meiyin is still in there, trying to get out. We can save her...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"美盈她还在里面, 试图挣脱, 我们能救她...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1162787714", //H
      "Source": "You vowed never to love again until you met me, Helena Walker, on the ARK.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你曾发誓永远不会爱上任何人, 直到你在方舟中遇到了我, 海莲娜·沃克","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3361088173", //H
      "Source": "We were opposites in so many ways, but we made each other whole.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们在很多方面都截然相反, 却能让彼此成为完整的自己","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::347332727", //H
      "Source": "You saved my life countless times...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你无数次救过我的命...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3573843345", //LQ
      "Source": "I did love you... but you left me behind... alone!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我确实爱过你...可...你却丢下了我...一个人!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2305418895", //H
      "Source": "I’ve been with you always, Meiyin.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我一直都在你身边, 美盈。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4241177566",
      "Source": "Keep your distance from those Red Element crystals. They're leaking something terrible.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"离那些腥红元素晶体远点, 它们在泄漏某种危险的东西。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2989471744",
      "Source": "Oh no -- the Codex restored her. I can't stand to see her suffer like this!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"哦不 -- 只要元码在重塑她, 我实在不忍心看她这样受苦!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4234694594",
      "Source": "If the Codex regenerates her, she'll only prolong her own suffering!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"只要元码仍在重塑她, 这痛苦就永无止境!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3604999212",
      "Source": "Break her connection to the Codex, so you can end this madness!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"切断她与元码的联系, 结束这场疯狂!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3879066233",
      "Source": "Wrong way -- I’ve located the Codex... It’s off to your right, and through a few rooms.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"走错方向了 -- 我已经定位到元码了...它在你右边, 穿过几个房间就到。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4096231195",
      "Source": "Trust me, you're not going to fend her off that easily... Just try to stay out of her way!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"相信我, 你没那么容易挡住她...尽量别跟她正面冲突!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3059944538",
      "Source": "She's getting stronger every time she draws blood. Try not to let her hit you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"她每次汲血都会变得更强。尽量别让她打中你。","JA":""}, //不知道具体是什么情况, 若后续知道什么情况可以根据后续情况修改。
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3424589021",
      "Source": "You can't let her heal herself, not while she's still turned!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你绝不能让她自愈, 尤其是在她还没转化的时候!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2973600442",
      "Source": "Press your advantage, while you still can! We have to break her curse!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"趁现在还能压制住她, 乘胜追击! 我们必须打破她的诅咒!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1570986214",
      "Source": "You need to be faster! Unless you stop her from regenerating her Lost self, you’ll never finish this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你得快! 要是不阻止她, 让她迷失自我地重塑, 这场战斗就永无休止了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2493609347",
      "Source": "Damn, you almost got through to her! You've got to put an end to this while you still have a chance!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"该死, 刚刚差点就说服她了! 趁还有机会, 赶紧结束这一切!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2526768750",
      "Source": "I know it seems cruel -- believe me -- but you HAVE TO get to her while she’s weakened.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我知道这看起来很残忍 -- 相信我 -- 但你必须趁她虚弱的时候抓紧接近她。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1872965364",
      "Source": "That was your chance! But there’ll be another one. Don’t give up!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"刚才那是你的机会! 不过还会有下一个的。别放弃!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2594353706",
      "Source": "I can't bear to see her like this... Please, Survivor, give it everything you've got!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我实在不忍心看她变成这副模样...求你了, 生存者, 一定要用尽你的全力!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1491059625",
      "Source": "Don’t let up now! We’re getting through to her!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"别松懈! 我们就快说服她了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::72007502", //h
      "Source": "The Lost Queen's defenses are weakening... Meiyin's fighting to get out, I know it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"失落王后的防御正逐渐瓦解...美盈肯定在拼命挣脱, 我敢肯定!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1278679079", //h
      "Source": "And then you met Diana Altaras -- a warrior as fierce as yourself.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"后来你遇见了戴安娜·阿尔塔拉斯 -- 一个与你一样骁勇的战士。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2499185263", //h
      "Source": "And you found love again...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你又一次找回了爱...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4023673661",
      "Source": "Diana...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"戴安娜...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::59219211", //LQ
      "Source": "But her fate was my fault... I let her die...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"但她的结局是我的错...我害死了她...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2129212257", //h
      "Source": "No, you saw that justice was done.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不, 你只是确保了正义得到了伸张。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::29890265", //h
      "Source": "Later, you decided to stay behind while your fellow survivors hibernated, and tried to find a way back to Diana and I.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"后来, 当你的同伴进入休眠, 你选择留下, 想找到回到我和戴安娜身边的路。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1893408219", //LQ
      "Source": "Why... why would I ever want to feel that pain again? To love is to lose...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"为什么...为什么我还要去经历一次那种痛? 爱就意味着失去...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
