    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3492042701",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability: For [Duration] seconds, ranged weapons become enhanced, causing {LeechAmount} damage leeched as life over the next [HealOverTimeDuration] seconds at the cost of {DamageReduction} reduced ranged damage.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能: 在[Duration]秒内, 远程武器得到强化, 造成的伤害中有{LeechAmount}会在接下来的[HealOverTimeDuration]秒内转化为生命恢复, 但代价是远程伤害降低{DamageReduction}","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
