      "Source": "Gain an active ability: Summon [Amount] spectral direwolves to fight at your side for [Duration] seconds.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能: 召唤[Amount]只幽灵恐狼在你身边战斗, 持续[Duration]秒","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
