      "Source": "Feline Form",
      "Trans": {"SC":"猫猫伪装术","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::956206451",
      "Source": "Gain an Active Ability: Transform into a cat. You appear as a wild cat to all players. Any damage dispels the effect.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能: 变身为一只猫。你在所有玩家眼中呈现为一只野猫。受到任何伤害都会解除该效果。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::478030376",
      "Source": "Thrall Puppeteer",
      "Trans": {"SC":"遥魂控躯","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::980300776",
      "Source": "Gain an Active Ability: <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Ranged Possession</>. Using this skill while aiming at a Thrall in line of sight will possess them.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能: <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">远程附身</>。瞄准视线内的血仆时使用该技能将附身他们","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1889025460",
      "Source": "Wisp of Industry",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灵工影匠","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2874891260",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability: Summon a <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">flying wisp</>. The flying wisp can be controlled at any time, limited to the space around you. While controlling the wisp, you can place down, pick up, and demolish structures from your hotbar. Cooldown applies if the Wisp is destroyed.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能: 召唤一只<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">飞行灵体</>。飞行灵体可随时控制, 范围限制在你周围的空间内。控制灵体时, 你可以从快捷栏中放置、拾取和拆除建筑。若灵体被摧毁, 则进入冷却","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4006141538",
      "Source": "Deep Refuge",
      "Trans": {"SC":"深海庇佑","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::139360696",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability: create a <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">bubble underwater</> that lasts for [Duration] seconds providing <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">unlimited oxygen</> and {Regen} stamina regen to you and all allies inside.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能: 制造一个<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">水下气泡</>, 持续[Duration]秒, 为你和内部所有盟友提供<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">无限氧气</>和{Regen}的耐力回复","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
