    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1788112779",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability:  For the next [Value1] seconds--you can access inventories, pick up dropped items, and toggle Structures that you can see within <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">30 meters</>.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能:  在接下来的 [Value1] 秒内, 你可以与视野范围 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">30米</> 内的目标进行以下交互: 访问其物品栏, 拾取掉落物品, 以及切换建筑状态。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2793770393",
      "Source": "When you craft ammunition, you have a {Chance} chance to produce twice as many.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你制作弹药时, 有 {Chance} 的几率产出双倍数量。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1125086305",
      "Source": "Your repair cost of Items and Structures is reduced by {CostReduction}.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"物品与建筑的维修成本降低{CostReduction}。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2072108985",
      "Source": "Reduce the weight of Structures in your inventory by {WeightMulti}.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"背包中的建筑类材料的重量减少{WeightMulti}。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4002434500",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability:  For the next [Value2] seconds, gain the ability to track any or all of the following, within <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">80 meters</>:\\n- Enemy Players and Tames\\n- Enemy Structures\\n- Resource nodes (any or all):\\n  - Crystal, Obsidian, Metal, Pearls, Silicate, Oil, Sulfur, Element",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能:  在接下来的  [Value2] 秒内, 获得追踪 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">80米</> 范围内的以下任意或全部目标的能力:\\n- 敌方玩家及驯服生物\\n- 敌方建筑\\n- 资源点 (可选): 水晶, 黑曜石, 金属, 含硅珍珠, 硅酸盐, 油, 硫磺, 元素","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2789733207",
      "Source": "When harvesting a Resouce node with a tool, you have a {Chance} chance to turn that node gold. Gold nodes have increased Health, and can be harvested for more Resources.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在使用工具采集资源时, 你有 {Chance}% 的几率将该资源变为金色资源, 金色资源拥有更高的耐久, 并且能开采出更多资源。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1608817451",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability:  For the next [Value1] seconds, your mount becomes spectral. While spectral, it cannot be targetted by wild Creatures, it ignores all Stamina costs, and you cannot be forcibly dismounted from it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能:  在接下来的 [Value1] 秒内, 你的坐骑将变为“幽魂形态”该状态期间不会消耗耐力也不会成为野生生物的目标, 且骑手不会被强制脱离骑乘。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3959171914",
      "Source": "Harvesting a Resource node grants {SpeedMulti} movement speed per stack for [Duration] seconds per stack, stacking up to 5 times.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"采集资源时可获得每层 {SpeedMulti} 的移速加成, 持续 [Duration] 秒, 最高可叠加至5层。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2308187460",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability:  For the next [Duration] minutes, the targeted ally shares your imprint bonus for Creatures you have raised.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能:  在接下来的 [Duration] 分钟内, 你选中的友军也可以对你留痕的生物触发留痕加成Buff效果。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1711192728",
      "Source": "Imprinting creatures you are raising is {!ImprintBonus} more effective.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当你对生物进行留痕时, 留痕的效果会额外提升 {!ImprintBonus}。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3618116784",
      "Source": "Creatures you tame gain a {ImprintBonus} imprint bonus for you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你驯服的生物将获得 {ImprintBonus} 的留痕奖励。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::318102231",
      "Source": "Whenever you kill a Creature with your mount, it has a {Chance}% chance to gain {Value1} increased damage for 20 seconds, stacking up to 3 times.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"每当你骑乘坐骑击杀生物时, 有 {Chance} 的几率获得 {Value1} 的伤害提升, 持续 20 秒, 最多可叠加3层。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3661046421",
      "Source": "Whenever your mount kills an enemy, it has a {Chance} chance to instantly restore 10% of its maximum Stamina.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"每当你的坐骑杀死敌人时, 有 {Chance} 的几率恢复耐力, 其数值是最大耐力的10%","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2087608100",
      "Source": "Your mounts gain {!XPMulti} increased Experience from kills.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的坐骑从击杀获得的经验提高{!XPMulti}。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4160621386",
      "Source": "Smoke Grenades you deploy last for {!DurMulti} longer. Throwing a Smoke Grenade activates this Skill, instantly breaking you out of any trap, and dropping aggro from Creatures while you remain in the smoke.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你投掷的烟雾弹持续时间将延长{!DurMulti}。投掷烟雾弹可以让你立即摆脱所有陷阱, 并且当你处于烟雾中时, 可以消除生物对你的仇恨。(三分钟冷却时间)","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::186321755",
      "Source": "Your metal Sword and Pike attacks have a {Chance} chance to cause bleeding, dealing 5% of the target's maximum Health as damage, over 10 seconds.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用金属剑或长矛攻击时有 {Chance} 的概率造成 10 秒内流失 5% 最大生命值的的流血效果。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3835925962",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability:  For the next [Value2] seconds, you gain {Value1} movement speed, and phase through wild and your own tamed Creatures.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能:  在接下来的 [Value2] 秒内, 获得一个 {Value1} 移速的加成, 并且可以穿透野生或你已驯服的生物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::518893409",
      "Source": "When you kill an enemy with a melee weapon, you gain {!SpeedMulti} movement speed for 5 seconds.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用近战武器击杀敌人后会获得一个持续 5 秒, {!SpeedMulti} 的移速加成。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1583578488",
      "Source": "Your natural Health regeneration is increased by {!RegenMulti}.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你自然恢复生命值的速度提升{!RegenMulti}。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1020052938",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability:  For the next [Value2] seconds, you reflect {Value1} of the (pre-mitigation) damage you take back to your attackers.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能:  在接下来的 [Value2] 秒内若受到攻击, 则会将计算减伤前 {Value1} 的伤害反弹给攻击者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3402348551",
      "Source": "You take {FallDmgMulti} reduced fall damage. When you suffer fall damage, you knockback enemies within 10 meters of you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你受到的坠落伤害降低 {FallDmgMulti}。当你承受坠落伤害时会击退自身范围 10 米内的敌人。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2364249250",
      "Source": "Our oldest statue commemorates my leadership of our people out of famine and austerity. We were at a turning point between certain death and life eternal.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们最古老的那座雕像是为了纪念我带领族人走出饥荒与困苦的那段岁月。彼时, 我们正处在生死攸关的转折点, 一边是注定覆灭的绝境, 另一边是永续长存的生路。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3726832719",
      "Source": "I chose life, and they love me for it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我选择了生路, 他们也正因此而爱戴我!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2658405941",
      "Source": "Oh no you don't. Our palace is closed to the general public, and locked by sigil-codes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"想都别想了, 王宫不对外开放, 还用魔符上了锁。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::212404980",
      "Source": "You will never again see the inside of it, so perish that thought now.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你这辈子也踏不进里面半步, 所以就死了这条心吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::461278086",
      "Source": "Palace Access Point",
      "Trans": {"SC":"宫殿入口","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2980931030",
      "Source": "Red Terminal",
      "Trans": {"SC":"红终端","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2666376330",
      "Source": "Add Sigils and Apex Trophies to access the Palace",
      "Trans": {"SC":"放入贡品以解锁宫殿权限","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1451316583",
      "Source": "Grounded", //BUFFNAME
      "Trans": {"SC":"缚地","JA":"縛地"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //Dinos\Neophyte\Buffs\Buff_Neophyte_Grounded
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4143069855",
      "Source": "Can't fly!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"无法飞行!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::415783096",
      "Source": "Aureliax Defense",
      "Trans": {"SC":"保护寒辉雪龙","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2262090751",
      "Source": "Gifting Time Remaning: {0} ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可赠与的剩余时间: {0} ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2096143334",
      "Source": "Hold {Reload} to Gift",
      "Trans": {"SC":"按下 {Reload} 以赠与","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //{
    //  "NamespaceHash": "Content::3203963959",
    //  "Source": "Claim",
    //  "Trans": {"SC":"认领","JA":""},
    //  "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    //},
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::515576668",
      "Source": "Defense Complete",
      "Trans": {"SC":"防御完成","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2236296621",
      "Source": "Hold {Crouch}",
      "Trans": {"SC":"按 {Crouch}","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1843908954",
      "Source": "Look what you can do when you listen to me.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"看你听我的不就对了吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2718158199",
      "Source": "Keep protecting my outposts, and I might find it in my heart to overlook your earlier defiance.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"继续守好我的哨站, 或许我会对你先前的忤逆既往不咎。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3081642494",
      "Source": "Collect the Key to unlock the Vault",
      "Trans": {"SC":"收集钥匙以解锁宝库","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3291918963",
      "Source": "Loot the Vault!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"搜刮宝库!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1509781135",
      "Source": "Boss Approaching!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"BOSS出现了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3654835224",
      "Source": "Skip Preparations",
      "Trans": {"SC":"跳过筹备阶段","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::990561942",
      "Source": "Pay attention to that revenant Yutyrannus! See how its roars freeze everything nearby?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"注意那只怨灵羽王龙! 看到它的咆哮让周遭万物都震慑住了吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::232255505",
      "Source": "Do what you can to destroy it and thaw out my outpost!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"尽你所能摧毁它, 解救我的哨站!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3240312157",
      "Source": "Plant Species X may not do the damage of an auto-turret, but they do their part to slow down invaders.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"X异种植物的杀伤力或许比不上自动炮塔, 但它们会尽其所能地去阻滞入侵者的步伐","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2804648081",
      "Source": "Don't over-do it with these, but don't under-do it either!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种不要种太多, 但也不能种少!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::896259034",
      "Source": "Hard to go wrong with good old auto-turrets... They carry on fighting for you, and shoot holes through all your problems.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"经典好用的自动炮塔永远不会让你失望... 它们会替你持续作战, 帮你扫清一切麻烦。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::109780425",
      "Source": "Tesla Coils need a lot of energy, but their volatile arcs can zap a bunch of targets at once...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"特斯拉电塔虽需消耗巨大能量, 但其跃动电弧能瞬间击中多个目标...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2325687086",
      "Source": "and supercharge your turrets to do even more damage!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"然后让炮塔火力全开, 造成更可观的伤害!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3700487369",
      "Source": "Surplus generators may seem wasteful, since they don't harm enemies or help allies.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"过剩的生成装置看似有些浪费, 毕竟它们既不能攻击敌人, 也没法支援友军","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1688527339",
      "Source": "But they will boost the outpost’s power supply, and that means more energy for defenses!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"但它们能提升哨站的供电量, 这意味着防御设施将获得更多能量!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3383464030",
      "Source": "Guess there’s a Plant Species Z now, altered to radiate an aura of healing pollen.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"看来现在又出了个Z异种植物, 经过改造后能释放出带有治愈功效的花粉。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2150815276",
      "Source": "Seems worth planting some to help you recuperate during the fight.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"种上一些应该会很有必要, 以备你在战斗间隙恢复状态。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2689689164",
      "Source": "The pollen from this modified Plant Species Y species acts like a powerful combat drug.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"种改良型的Y异种植物产生的花粉, 它的效果堪比强效的战斗药剂。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3119118904",
      "Source": "Near these, you’ll tear through the enemy in a berserker frenzy!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在附近, 你会进入犹如狂战士般状态横扫敌军!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2597463965",
      "Source": "More wreckage from the crashed ARK. Watch for telltale pools of glowing purple goo...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"多数的残骸来自于损毁方舟。留意那些发光的紫色黏液的池水...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2603888763",
      "Source": "Edmund's pet projects tend to be violent and unpredictable.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"艾德蒙的那些旁支实验往往都凶戾且充满变数。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1671766537",
      "Source": "Structure Slot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"建筑栏位","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1440705414",
      "Source": "Loot the Cache!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"搜刮补给资源!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::778775094",
      "Source": "Loot the Vault to collect your rewards",
      "Trans": {"SC":"交互宝库以领取奖励","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1021257457",
      "Source": "Event Completed!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"事件已完成!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2232490124",
      "Source": "Protect the Resource Cache",
      "Trans": {"SC":"保护资源补给点","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::257357361",
      "Source": "Prepare for the Attack!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"准备迎接敌人!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3472821385",
      "Source": "Lost Resource Cache",
      "Trans": {"SC":"失落资源补给点","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2588373923",
      "Source": "Resource Cache",
      "Trans": {"SC":"资源补给点","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1086115282",
      "Source": "Resource Cache (Gamma)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"资源补给点 (Gamma)","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2289140864",
      "Source": "Resource Cache (Beta)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"资源补给点 (Beta)","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::824087288",
      "Source": "Resource Cache (Alpha)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"资源补给点 (Alpha)","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::65350576",
      "Source": "Just look at the sorry state of this place! Whatever killed my children might be on its way back to you even now.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"看看这地方的惨状! 害死我子民们的东西, 说不定此刻正朝你这边赶回来。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2456241958",
      "Source": "Better fire up those replicators and ready your fortifications.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"赶快启动那些复制机, 加固你的防御工事。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::979969775",
      "Source": "Nice thinking! This decoy might draw their attention away from you, while keeping them in the firing line.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"好主意! 这个诱饵可能会把他们的注意力从你身上引开, 同时还能让它们处在火力范围之内。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3743982138",
      "Source": "Don’t let them wreck my property! There are things there more valuable than you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"别让它们毁了我的财物! 那里边的东西可比你要值钱的多。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3239557506",
      "Source": "Another of Rockwell’s bad ideas in the flesh. He never did have a problem with human experimentation.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"又一个罗克韦尔馊主意具象化的产物。用活人做实验这种事, 他从来不在乎。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::326469516",
      "Source": "Maybe best to put that poor thing out of its misery.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"也许最好让那些可怜的家伙从痛苦中解脱。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2627347188",
      "Source": "Make yourself useful, and dig in to protect my outpost! You have everything you need to do that.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"好好表现, 守好我的哨站点! 你手头的条件足够了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::307055533",
      "Source": "Just look at those falls... Absolutely spectacular.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"看看那些瀑布...太壮观了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3956587583",
      "Source": "Imagine the greenery that will fill this area, once their forcefield is opened to let the Reseed Protocol finish its job...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"想象一下, 一旦他们的力场打开, 让“生态重建计划”完成, 这片土地将会是一片郁郁葱葱的景象...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3242576777",
      "Source": "All of this looks like debris from the aberrant ARK -- one of the very few that didn’t make it down to Earth in one piece.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些东西看起来是那座畸变方舟的残骸 -- 极少数没有完整降落到地球的方舟之一。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2642105251",
      "Source": "What a tragic loss of life...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"何其的悲惨...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3767550721",
      "Source": "They've set a revenant Brontosaur on you -- one with skin tempered in volatile liquid Element!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他们放出了一只怨灵雷龙来对付你 -- 那家伙的外皮被不稳定元素液淬炼过!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2478049134",
      "Source": "Find the weak points in its armor before it tramples my entire outpost!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在它踏平我的整个哨站之前, 找到它的弱点!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::446891232",
      "Source": "Wave Incoming!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"本轮敌人已来袭!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1345080701",
