    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::785498030",
      "Source": "An advanced weapon with many attack modes. Has a 3-attack sequence, block mode, deflect mode, and can be thrown. Also has teleportation abilities: can return thrown spear, send user to thrown spear, or blink-dash to dodge incoming attacks. Requires Element for most abilities.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种具有多种攻击模式的高级武器。拥有三段攻击序列、普通格挡模式、舞矛格挡模式, 还可投掷。还具备传送能力: 可召回投掷出的长矛、将使用者传送到投掷出的长矛处, 或或施展瞬移冲刺躲避来袭攻击。其大部分能力需要消耗元素。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
