    },
    //————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2849036927",
      "Source": "Ah, you've found the Great Western Bridge. Built to access the highlands to our west, by a seditious lord desperate to regain my favor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"啊, 你找到了这座西境大桥, 它通往我们西部的高地。由昔日一位不忠的领主所建, 他迫切地想要重获我的青睐...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1537835778",
      "Source": "Alas, it was completed too late to save him.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可惜, 建成得太晚以至于救不了他。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3578495477",
      "Source": "These tenements shelter my humblest children, who owe their very existence to me.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些简陋的居所庇护着我最卑微的子民, 他们的生命皆因我而存续。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3474087712",
      "Source": "All I ask in return for granting them asylum is an occasional tithe of blood.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我给予他们庇护所, 所求的回报不过是偶尔的血税供奉。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::674086817",
      "Source": "Behold my Arat Prime, blood-red jewel of the Antarctic! Sole remaining bastion of post-Cataclysmic humanity on Earth.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"看我这阿拉特·源域, 南极里的血红色宝石! 灾变后地球上人类仅存的堡垒。","JA":""}, //他指这个失落之地是颗南极的血色宝石
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2154891477",
      "Source": "Observe the laws of my kingdom, and you are free to know its wonders.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"遵循我所立之法, 你便可以自由地领略这般奇景。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4090445758",
      "Source": "My children may not attack you on sight, but don't think that means you have free reign here.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我的子民或许不会一见到你就动手, 但你别以为你可以在这里为所欲为。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1247239617",
      "Source": "Follow our rules, and you won’t be harmed. Steal or vandalize, and they'll show no mercy.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"遵守我们的规矩, 你就不会受到伤害。胆敢偷窃破坏, 他们绝不会留情。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4034218863",
      "Source": "I warned you! Now my children will teach you not to disobey. Unless you can prove your worth against our revenant invaders...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我早就警告过的! 现在我的子民们会来教你什么叫做服从。除非你能去对抗那些怨灵以证明自己还有价值...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1393440878",
      "Source": "Don't worry Survivor, you've been infected by Red Element.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"生存者, 你被腥红能量元素感染了, 不过别担心。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3448471304",
      "Source": "But I kept you from being turned by firing an Engram pulse through the ARK Transmission Network.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在你被转化之前, 我通过方舟传送系统释放了印痕脉冲, 把你救了下来。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::679778298",
      "Source": "I'm using that same network to communicate with you from a planet far away... ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我也正在通过这套系统和你通信, 即使我身处一颗很遥远的星球。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1062011006",
      "Source": "...at least until the so-called Lost King figures out how I've accessed it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"...至少在那个叫失落之王的家伙弄明白我如何访问这个系统之前, 我们都还能这样通信。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1445710556",
      "Source": "My friends and I need your help, Survivor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我的朋友还有我, 都需要你的帮助, 生存者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2645721538",
      "Source": "And together, we can help you reach safety here with us.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"齐心协力, 我们一定可以帮助你抵达我们所在的安全之地。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::643997543",
      "Source": "Find a way in and locate the Codex, so you can transmit it across the galaxy to me here on Arat,",
      "Trans": {"SC":"找到并定位元码的位置, 然后把它跨越银河传输到我在阿拉特这里,","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2998448617",
      "Source": "...along with your own consciousness.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"...连同你自己的意识一起。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2813019614",
      "Source": "You can do this, Survivor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你一定能做到的, 生存者!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3859104531",
      "Source": "Hear me, my Thrall.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我的奴仆, 给我听好了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::242954087",
      "Source": "You may have fled blindly into the wastes, but we will find you and bring you back.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你也许盲目逃入了野外, 但我们早晚会找到你, 再把你给带回来。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2796084277",
      "Source": "Do not fear, you are no longer sustenance to us.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不过别怕, 你不再是我们的养料了。","JA":""}, //sustenance
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1473886749",
      "Source": "You have tasted of our lifeforce and begun your journey to become one of us.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"而你也已经尝到了我们强大的生命力量, 也将开启成为我们一部分的旅程。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1006672204",
      "Source": "One of The Lost.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"成为失落大军的一员。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::922706219",
      "Source": "And so, it is only a matter of time before we are reunited.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"所以, 我们相聚只是时间问题了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1634925388",
      "Source": "Watcher Suppression", //buffname
      "Trans": {"SC":"监视压制","JA":"監視壓制"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1238742174",
      "Source": "While under watcher suppression, you can not fly.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"处于监视压制状态下时的你无法飞行。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::194739721",
      "Source": "Common Name: Cryolophosaurus\r\nSpecies: Cryolophosaurus Glacialis\r\nTime: Early Jurassic\r\nDiet: Carnivore\r\nTemperament: Extremely Aggressive\r\n\r\nWild\r\nFor its small and seemingly innocent stature, Cryolophosaurus is one of the most dangerous creatures I've encountered on the ark. Cryo seems to possess a unique gular pouch that houses a potent freezing and tranquilizing agent. By intaking water or snow in its native habitat, Cryo can store this liquid and use it to \r\ndevastating effect; as tranquilizing spit, or a freezing gust of air. When subduing targets in this manner, Cryo seems to enter a hyper state displayed by vibrant flashing patterns and hyperventilating. This frenzied energy gives Cryo a significant boost in speed and power, which makes avoiding these debilitating attacks all the more crucial. Although they excel at tranquilizing targets, they themselves are not immune to the effects of torpor. While traditional methods will work but return weaker results, a well-armored survivor with shield in hand, is quite successful at giving a Cryo a taste of its' own cold \r\nmedicine.\r\n\r\nDomesticated\r\nTamed Cryolophosaurus are one of the most successful taming partners you could find, with torpor attacks that can cause even some of the strongest creatures to succumb to sleep. Its' freezing breath, while potent on enemies, also boasts a useful secondary benefit to allies. With a careful coating of this icy substance, allies will gain an icy coat of armor to help stave off damage. When hyper, Cryo can also assist in the chase by slowing down running targets with their chilling bites. While not quite able to stand as a powerhouse on its' own, Cryolophosaurus make for an excellent debilitating and status applying beast. As long as you're not afraid to get a little cold or sleepy...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 冰嵴龙\r\n拉丁学名: Cryolophosaurus Glacialis\r\n正式名称: 极地冰嵴龙\r\n时代: 早侏罗世\r\n食性: 肉食\r\n性情: 极度好战\r\n\r\nWild\r\nFor its small and seemingly innocent stature, Cryolophosaurus is one of the most dangerous creatures I've encountered on the ark. Cryo seems to possess a unique gular pouch that houses a potent freezing and tranquilizing agent. By intaking water or snow in its native habitat, Cryo can store this liquid and use it to \r\ndevastating effect; as tranquilizing spit, or a freezing gust of air. When subduing targets in this manner, Cryo seems to enter a hyper state displayed by vibrant flashing patterns and hyperventilating. This frenzied energy gives Cryo a significant boost in speed and power, which makes avoiding these debilitating attacks all the more crucial. Although they excel at tranquilizing targets, they themselves are not immune to the effects of torpor. While traditional methods will work but return weaker results, a well-armored survivor with shield in hand, is quite successful at giving a Cryo a taste of its' own cold \r\nmedicine.\r\n\r\nDomesticated\r\nTamed Cryolophosaurus are one of the most successful taming partners you could find, with torpor attacks that can cause even some of the strongest creatures to succumb to sleep. Its' freezing breath, while potent on enemies, also boasts a useful secondary benefit to allies. With a careful coating of this icy substance, allies will gain an icy coat of armor to help stave off damage. When hyper, Cryo can also assist in the chase by slowing down running targets with their chilling bites. While not quite able to stand as a powerhouse on its' own, Cryolophosaurus make for an excellent debilitating and status applying beast. As long as you're not afraid to get a little cold or sleepy...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
