      "Source": "Alpha Zombie Brains",
      "Trans": {"SC":"精英僵尸大脑","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1428408713",
      "Source": "I'm sorry, Meeka...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"抱歉, 咪卡...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1344610185",
      "Source": "I hear your voice first thing in the morning, and you sing me to sleep at night.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"清晨我第一个听到的就是你的声音, 夜晚你唱着歌哄我入睡。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::681040047",
      "Source": "Are you -- are you my mom?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你是 -- 你是我的妈妈么?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2839535600",
      "Source": "I'm sorry, Meeka. I'm not.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"很遗憾, 咪卡。我不是。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3309117000",
      "Source": "But I did know your mom -- a long, long time ago...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"但我的确认识你妈妈 -- 在很久很久之前...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::979693699",
      "Source": "Diana Altaras was so brave, and fierce.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"戴安娜·阿尔塔拉斯是如此的勇敢和坚毅。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2300358818",
      "Source": "But... you’ve been with me for as long as I can remember. Guiding me...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"但是...从我记事起你就一直陪伴着我。引导着我...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3116527111",
      "Source": "In a way, you are like a daughter to me... We share memories, thoughts and feelings.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"某种程度来说, 你就像是我的女儿...我们共享着记忆、思想和情感。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::968256328",
      "Source": "You and I are connected to the technology of the ARKs in such a special way.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你与我跟方舟技术之间有着如此特别的连接。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3026084071",
      "Source": "Wait... You’re Helena Walker -- one of those heroes Dad told me about, from back on Earth!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"等等...你是海莲娜·沃克 -- 爸爸告诉我的那些英雄之一, 从地球来的!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4015195739",
      "Source": "I don’t know that I was a hero. I just did what needed to be done.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我不清楚自己算不算英雄。我只是做了该做的事。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3809034772",
      "Source": "Sounds exactly like what a hero would say. You saved the world.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这听起来完全就是英雄会说的话。你拯救了世界。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::858903325",
      "Source": "And it took... everything. But I know you have that same strength within you, Meeka.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"而这牺牲的是...一切。但我知道你内心也拥有同样的力量, 咪卡。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::458544711",
      "Source": "That strength... So, if you're in my head, do you know how I feel?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那种力量...既然你在我的脑海里, 你就明白我的感受对吧?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3081507943",
      "Source": "Do you know what it’s like... to want someone back with you, more than anything?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你知道那种感觉吧...无比地希望某人能够回到你身边对吧?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3348931041",
      "Source": "I do. I loved someone once, very much...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我知道。我曾深爱过一个人...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4096250763",
      "Source": "What was her name?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"她叫什么名字?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2032774561",
      "Source": "See? You do know more than you think.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"对吧? 你了解的比你想象的要多得多。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4287164681",
      "Source": "To her friends, she was Meiyin. But to those who feared her, she was called --",
      "Trans": {"SC":"朋友们叫她美盈。但那些怕她的人, 则称她为 --","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::816914082",
      "Source": "The Beast Queen! My dad said she was one of the toughest survivors he ever knew.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"兽林女王! 我爸爸说她是他见过的最顽强的生存者之一。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3549096883",
      "Source": "What happened to her?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"她后来怎么样了?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::672732724",
      "Source": "I had to... leave her behind.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我不得不...把她留在了那里。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::160717614",
      "Source": "But Meiyin’s story continued, to the far side of the Earth, into frozen wastes shrouded in endless night...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"但美盈的故事远未结束, 她去了地球的另一端, 进入了被无尽黑夜笼罩的冰冻荒原...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //修补————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3073461297",
      "Source": "Where a small pocket of humanity managed to survive the long Cataclysm,",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在那里, 一小群人类在漫长的浩劫中幸存了下来,","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4144946798",
      "Source": "Where a small pocket of humanity managed to survive the long Cataclysm --",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在那里, 一小群人类在漫长的浩劫中幸存了下来 --","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2181408125",
      "Source": "Where a small pocket of humanity managed to survive the long Cataclysm...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在那里, 一小群人类在漫长的浩劫中幸存了下来...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    //修补————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3260546511",
      "Source": "Where a small pocket of humanity managed to survive the long Cataclysm, in a place called Arat Prime.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在那里, 一小群人类在漫长的浩劫中幸存了下来,\r\n在一个叫做阿拉特·源域的地方","JA":""}, //标记-中文重复了修复一下游戏的问题
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2981082591",
      "Source": "In a place called Arat Prime.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在一个叫做阿拉特·源域的地方。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3975828668",
      "Source": "Arat... Prime? Where the ARKs came from?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"阿拉特...源域? 方舟就是来自那里吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::361874547",
      "Source": "That’s right. Meiyin traveled there looking for a way back to me, and your mother Diana.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"说的没错。美盈去那里寻找某种方法想与我重逢, 也包括你母亲戴安娜。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3827439500",
      "Source": "But what she found instead --",
      "Trans": {"SC":"但她找到的却是 --","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4210676391",
      "Source": "What? What was it? Tell me!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"什么? 是什么啊? 告诉我!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3610291215",
      "Source": "There she found... the stuff of nightmares.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在那里她发现了...噩梦般的东西。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::138777939",
      "Source": "Cloning process complete.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"克隆完成","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1799787908",
      "Source": "Survivor, hear my words and awaken.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"生存者, 聆听我的话语并苏醒吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3271973721",
      "Source": "It’s been over a thousand years since we last spoke, and I’m communicating with you now from a distant planet...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"距我们上次交谈已经过了一千多年, 我现在正在一个遥远的星球与你沟通...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4125887679",
      "Source": "Because I need your help once more. Yes, you were the one I waited so long for.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"因为我需要你的再一次帮助。没错, 你就是我等了那么久的人。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4248247301",
      "Source": "You completed what I had started.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你完成了我未竟的事业。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2651568661",
      "Source": "And together, we restored life to an extinct world.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们共同让一个已经寂灭的世界重获生机。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2568967247",
      "Source": "But there’s still one place left on Earth where a form of Element still lingers...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"但地球上还有一个地方, 某种形态的元素仍然残留着...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1424082842",
      "Source": "...rendering it impenetrable to the cleansing energies of the Reseed Protocol.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"...导致“生态重建计划”的净化能量无法浸染其中。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2519701532",
      "Source": "This forlorn outpost, where you are now, was once a research colony called Arat Prime...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你现在所在的这个荒凉哨站, 曾经是叫做阿拉特·源域的科研基地...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2968872345",
      "Source": "...sister facility of Sanctuary, where the technology to store and transmit human consciousness was perfected.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"...是庇护所的姐妹设施, 在那里存储和传输人类意识的技术臻于完善。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2663598795",
      "Source": "There is stored the only remaining archive of humanity's collective minds and bodies.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那里储存着人类所共有的, 意识与身躯的唯一备份。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2766994664",
      "Source": "The Engram Codex.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"印痕元码","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2112829062",
      "Source": "I need you to recover and transmit the Codex -- our shared heritage -- so I can use it to restore balance to my new world.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我需要你去取回并传送元码 -- 我们共同的遗产 -- 这样我才能用它来恢复我所处新世界的平衡。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3714672905",
      "Source": "You should know that it won’t be easy, because in the thousand years After Reseeding, Arat Prime has become home to --",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你要清楚这并不容易, 因为在重新播种后的千年里, 阿拉特·源域已经成了 --","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3786062269",
      "Source": "Quick, he’s here. Brace yourself!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"快, 他来了。准备迎敌!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4102744826",
      "Source": "The Codex provides a feast fit for a king and his family. And I can’t deny myself a taste.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"元码提供的是一场只有国王和他的家族才配享用的盛宴。而我怎能拒绝品尝这样的诱惑。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2275109833",
      "Source": "Very sweet... You are truly a marvelous creation. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"真不错啊...你真是个了不起的造物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2360543317",
      "Source": "I wonder... You may yet better serve the family by joining us, rather than feeding us. Yes...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我在想...或许你能以加入的方式更好地为家族效力, 而非成为我们的食物。没错...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::471858041",
      "Source": "You will become one of our kind.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你马上就要融入我们了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2987836441",
      "Source": "Drink, and you will know nothing of death or pain ever again --",
      "Trans": {"SC":"喝下去, 你将从此远离死亡与痛苦 --","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1318501020",
      "Source": "Argh! What power is this...? Who else is in there with you?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"呃啊! 这是什么力量...? 你那边还有谁?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::620743368",
      "Source": "I could only stun him for a moment.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我只能让他晕眩一会儿。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1679189301",
      "Source": "What are you waiting for, Survivor? Get the hell out of there!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"还愣着干什么, 生存者? 赶紧逃出这个魔窟!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "5969D7294935805598FA8EAFEAC13A7C",
      "Source": "Ears",
      "Trans": {"SC":"耳朵","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2627000641"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "8DD8FFA641C59800F2B6C1A7B7AE3013",
      "Source": "Jaw",
      "Trans": {"SC":"下颌","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1260954110"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "BA5164ED4280EEB7B36B8DB928071AD2",
      "Source": "Mouth",
      "Trans": {"SC":"嘴巴","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1370907113"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "A9F19C3B49C1F35CF3AB38B8F38ECBDA",
      "Source": "Nose",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鼻子","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2527471935"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "94F124DD47E56EC13BA5F59D032120B8",
      "Source": "Brows",
      "Trans": {"SC":"眉毛","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"771538927"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "52EED6D7411941E7C5959597148C8642",
      "Source": "Scalp",
      "Trans": {"SC":"头皮","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"977785102"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "17FFB09F4DE7A6C08D23028AF78ADDFA",
      "Source": "General Morph",
      "Trans": {"SC":"整体塑形","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"3405318363"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1859810913",
      "Source": "Face 1",
      "Trans": {"SC":"脸型一","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2087704975",
      "Source": "Face 2",
      "Trans": {"SC":"脸型二","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3302211306",
      "Source": "Face 3",
      "Trans": {"SC":"脸型三","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "FB0D9A8E42CB1DFC51FA9BB3A242B6AB",
      "Source": "MORPHOLOGY",
      "Trans": {"SC":"形态特征","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1397401474"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "9DAC112C451C50E0CFD9938F8D49B1F0",
      "Source": "FACE",
      "Trans": {"SC":"脸部","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"826950357"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::773338356",
      "Source": "Main Menu Intro",
      "Trans": {"SC":"主菜单的开场","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2084552976",
      "Source": "Lost Colony",
      "Trans": {"SC":"失落之地","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::561504864",
      "Source": "LOST COLONY",
      "Trans": {"SC":"失落之地","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::22664315",
      "Source": "A desperate voice calls out to you from across the galaxy... long ago you helped her restored life to the extinct Earth, and now she needs your skills once more. She seeks the engram Codex, hidden in a lost kingdom at the end of the world: Arat Prime. Discover the dark secrets of this forlorn place as you master arcane skills, tame strange cryptofauna, cloaking yourself in powerful accursed gear. Survive its challenges & assemble an army of Thralls, as you seek to dethrone the Lost King and change the fate of the future!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一声绝望的呼喊自银河彼端向你传来...很久以前, 你曾帮助她让死寂的地球重获生机, 如今她再度需要你发挥专长。她追寻着印痕元码, 它被藏匿在世界尽头的失落之国 —— 阿拉特·源域。探索这片荒芜之地的黑暗隐秘, 掌握玄奇的技艺, 驯服奇幻的异兽, 用强大的咒缚装备武装自己。在重重挑战中生存, 集结血仆大军, 废黜失落之王, 改写未来的命运!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //失落之地地图介绍
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2893015148",
      "Source": "North Mountains",
      "Trans": {"SC":"北部山脉","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3322747193",
      "Source": "South Mountains",
      "Trans": {"SC":"南部山脉","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1124887593",
      "Source": "South East Mountains",
      "Trans": {"SC":"东南部山脉","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::974256325",
      "Source": "East Mountains",
