      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3108547681",
      "Source": "You deal more damage and take less damage when away from other Megaraptors.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"远离其他大盗龙时, 获得增伤与减伤效果。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4204997973",
      "Source": "Common Name: Megaraptor\r\nSpecies: Megaraptor Sceleratus\r\nTime: Late Cretaceous\r\nDiet: Carnivore\r\nTemperament: Solitary Aggressive\r\n\r\nWild\r\nTrust me, you don't want one of these creepy killers hunting you. Megaraptor picks off its victims one at a time, like the villain in an old-school slasher flick. And once you've been targeted, your stalker will scare away your friends and allies with its unnerving glare.\r\n\r\nYou won't see this monster coming until it's right on top of you. That's when megaraptor pounces, pinning you down and scattering everyone nearby to leave you defenseless. Talk about a jump scare! The final indignity is that your death will give the beast the strength to shrug off any attempt to avenge you. \r\n\r\nDomesticated\r\nBefore you can tame a Megaraptor, you'll have to earn its respect. Find and claim its grisly altar of carcasses, then keep the enraged owner at bay with fire. Just make sure you stay on a constant swivel, because this fiend will fight like hell for its trophies.\r\n\r\nManage to break one of these butchers, and you'll share all the meat from its many kills. You'll also gain an assassin eager to isolate and murder your enemies. But know that Megaraptor hunts alone. Uncomfortable around even its own kind, this army of one will lose its fighting edge around others.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 大盗龙\r\n拉丁学名: Megaraptor Sceleratus\r\n正式名称: 孤凶煞大盗龙\r\n时代: 晚白垩世\r\n食性: 肉食\r\n性情: 独居性好战\r\n\r\n\r\n野生\r\n相信我, 你绝不希望被这般阴邪的杀手纠缠。孤凶煞大盗龙就像那种俗套的老式恐怖片反派一样, 不将目标置之死地绝不罢休。一旦不幸被其选中, 这只潜行杀手将会用它不寒而栗的目光吓退你的同伴, 让你陷入孤立。\r\n在这头怪物逼近到你眼前之前, 你根本察觉不到它的到来。届时它已猛然发难将你扑倒在地, 并将周遭所有人都驱离, 让你彻底丧失反抗能力, 真可谓“猛然一吓”! 而令人讽刺的是, 一旦你不幸罹难, 死亡更会赋予这只杀神强大的力量以对抗任何复仇的尝试。\r\n\r\n\r\n家养\r\n若想驯化大盗龙, 必然要先令它尊重你。你需要设法找到它由尸山骨海构成的邪恶祭坛, 然后用火焰将凶暴的祭坛主人逼入绝境。但请务必小心, 它会拼死捍卫它的战利品。\r\n一旦你设法征服一只这样的屠夫, 除了共享一切狩猎成果, 你还能将一位刺客成功纳入麾下 -- 它会主动孤立并击杀你的敌人。但要注意, 向来偏好独行的大盗龙在与友军相处时会感到十分不适, 哪怕是同类。因此, 在群体的目光之下, 它的战斗力会大打折扣。","JA":""}, //大盗龙修补
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2550034649",
      "Source": "Common Name: Megaraptor\r\nSpecies: Megaraptor Sceleratus\r\nTime: Late Cretaceous\r\nDiet: Carnivore\r\nTemperament: Solitary Aggressive\r\n\r\nWild\r\nTrust me, you don't want one of these creepy killers hunting you. Megaraptor picks off its civtims one at a time, like the villain in an old-school slasher flick. And once you've been targeted, your stalker will scare away your friends and allies with its unnerving glare.\r\n\r\nYou won't see this monster coming until it's right on top of you. That's when megaraptor pounces, pinning you down and scattering everyone nearby to leave you defenseless. Talk about a jump scare! The final indignity is that your death will give the beast the strength to shrug off any attempt to avenge you. \r\n\r\nDomesticatedBefore you can tame a Megaraptor, you'll have to earn its respect. Find and claim its grisly altar of carcasses, then keep the enraged owner at bay with fire. Just make sure you stay on a constant swivel, because this fiend will fight like hell for its trophies.\r\n\r\nManage to break one of these butchers, and you'll share all the meat from its many kills. You'll also gain an assassin eager to isolate and murder your enemies. But know that Megaraptor hunts alone. Uncomfotable around even its own kind, this army of one will lose its fighting edge around others.",
      //错误内容大概率会失效.
      //错误: Uncomfotable 正确: Uncomfortable | 错误:civtims 正确: victims
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 大盗龙\r\n拉丁学名: Megaraptor Sceleratus\r\n正式名称: 孤凶煞大盗龙\r\n时代: 晚白垩世\r\n食性: 肉食\r\n性情: 独居性好战\r\n\r\n\r\n野生\r\n相信我, 你绝不希望被这般阴邪的杀手纠缠。孤凶煞大盗龙就像那种俗套的老式恐怖片反派一样, 不将目标置之死地绝不罢休。一旦不幸被其选中, 这只潜行杀手将会用它不寒而栗的目光吓退你的同伴, 让你陷入孤立。\r\n在这头怪物逼近到你眼前之前, 你根本察觉不到它的到来。届时它已猛然发难将你扑倒在地, 并将周遭所有人都驱离, 让你彻底丧失反抗能力, 真可谓“猛然一吓”! 而令人讽刺的是, 一旦你不幸罹难, 死亡更会赋予这只杀神强大的力量以对抗任何复仇的尝试。\r\n\r\n\r\n家养\r\n若想驯化大盗龙, 必然要先令它尊重你。你需要设法找到它由尸山骨海构成的邪恶祭坛, 然后用火焰将凶暴的祭坛主人逼入绝境。但请务必小心, 它会拼死捍卫它的战利品。\r\n一旦你设法征服一只这样的屠夫, 除了共享一切狩猎成果, 你还能将一位刺客成功纳入麾下 -- 它会主动孤立并击杀你的敌人。但要注意, 向来偏好独行的大盗龙在与友军相处时会感到十分不适, 哪怕是同类。因此, 在群体的目光之下, 它的战斗力会大打折扣。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //076A4085415DCF26D935C0B5D1DF222B
    },
