    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4188459045",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks.\r\n\r\nYou'll be the terror of the beach with swimwear inspired by the T-Rex itself.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来改变裤子的外观。\r\n\r\n穿上这件霸王龙泳装, 你将成为海滩上“霸气外露”的存在。穿上这件霸王龙泳装, 你将成为海滩上“霸气外露”的存在。","JA":""},
