      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of a small storage box to look more accessible. Store your floaters, sinkers, flies, and bait in its many compartments!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来改变储物箱的外观。把你的浮标、铅坠、假饵和鱼饵都放进这里吧!","JA":""},
