    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2440674087",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of a helmet or hat.\r\n\r\nFound deep within the belly of a great white beast, this hat is all that remains of the last brave soul that tried to slay the creature.",
      //船长帽
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来改变头盔或帽子的外观。\r\n\r\n这是在一头白色的深海巨兽腹中发现的帽子 -- 它是最后一位试图讨伐此兽的勇者所留下的唯一遗物。","JA":""},
