    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::761716232",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into a bikini bottom. \r\n\r\nYou'll be the terror of the beach with swimwear inspired by the T-Rex itself.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来使裤子变成比基尼的外观。\r\n\r\n穿上这件以霸王龙为灵感设计的泳装, 成为海滩最亮眼的存在。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2464545938",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into a bikini bottom. \r\n\r\nWith swimwear this fashionable, no one minds you floating in their pool.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来使裤子变成比基尼的外观。\r\n\r\n穿上这件“时髦”的泳装, 别人应该不会嫌弃你在泳池里漂着地吧.?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
