      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4198995926",
      "Source": "Drakelings store a percentage of experience while mounted. Can be used to boost another creature's experience, with higher value boosts also granting a Dragon Hoard Key.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当精灵龙栖身肩掌时会存一定比例的经验值。这些经验可用于提升其它生物的经验值, 若传授的经验越丰厚还会获得一枚龙之秘宝钥匙。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
