    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2689608362",
      "Source": "Common Name: Drakelings\r\nSpecies: Draco temporanima\r\nTime: Unknown\r\nDiet: Carnivore (Prefers Cooked)\r\nTemperament: Curious\r\n\r\nWild\r\nI must be adapting to my weird new life on these ARKs, because I wasn’t even surprised to run across a new type of dragon. Despite its smaller stature, this friendly little fella seems more like the four-legged guardian of the Island than its bipedal wyvern cousins.\r\n\r\nSince all four varieties of Drakeling seem to be able to interbreed, I’ve decided they must all belong to the same species. Each type seems attuned to its own climate, making it tempting for survivors to sort them by the seasons we remember on Earth.\r\n\r\nDomesticated\r\nDrakelings are drawn to our fires, and curious about people. Show one a bit of kindness and attention, and you’ll gain a powerful -- and portable -- new apprentice. These clever critters seem eager to learn, and to share their knowledge in turn. Let a Drakeling teach your other pets, and in return it will lead you to its hoarded treasure! \r\n\r\nThough all Drakelings can act like a reserve parachute, each seasonal variety also has its own powerful breath-attack and special gift. A spring Drakeling will invigorate you, while the summer variety will keep you moving. The autumnal breed empowers you and increases your harvest yields, while the wintery type insulates and cushions you from damage.\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      //Drakelings-待翻译
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3773852531",
      "Source": "Common Name: Bison\r\nSpecies: Bison matrislac\r\nTime: Early Pleistocene\r\nDiet: Herbivore\r\nTemperament: Territorial\r\n\r\nWild\r\nAfter dealing with the endless parade of mutants and freaks on the ARKs, it might feel like a pleasant surprise to run across some ordinary-looking buffalo! Just make sure to enjoy the local bison at a distance, if you’ve brought along anything as big as an allosaur -- they become aggressively territorial around larger predators.\r\n\r\nOnce provoked, you can expect these stubborn slabs of meat to fight until the bitter end. An agitated bison will throw that massive weight around to defend its herd even when overmatched. I watched one knock a rex senseless before tossing the dazed would-be predator off a cliff!\r\n\r\nDomesticated\r\nBreaking one of these overstuffed bovines is tougher than you might think... All that extra bulk makes bison especially tough to knock out. These loveable meatballs are worth taming, because they’ll fight for you as fiercely as their own herd. Your bison may not end fights quickly, but it will take a beating and tussle with just about any threat.\r\n\r\nA tame mama bison will prove to be a useful dairy animal for your tribe, as long as she’s nursing. That milk is extremely nutritious and actually pairs well with some of the more interesting recipes Survivors have concocted. Any nearby baby creature will want some, once they smell it… Heck, even baby wyverns treat it like their mother’s milk!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 野牛\r\n拉丁学名: Bison Matrislac\r\n正式名称: 富乳野牛\r\n时代: 早更新世\r\n食性: 植食\r\n性情: 强领地意识\r\n\r\n\r\n野生\r\n在方舟上见识过各种“牛鬼蛇神”之后, 遇到这般“平平无奇”的野牛反而令人耳目一新! 若你带领异特龙体型的生物同行时, 最好与之保持安全距离 -- 当察觉到大型的捕食者时, 它们会变得极具攻击性以此来捍卫领地。\r\n\r\n一旦被激怒, 这些桀骜不驯的“肉山”一定血战到底。即便面对体型远超自己的强敌, 它们也会挥动庞大躯体守护族群。我曾亲眼目睹一头暴怒的野牛将一头霸王龙撞地头晕目眩, 随后将这“恐龙之王”直接顶下悬崖!\r\n\r\n\r\n家养\r\n驯化这群膘肥体壮的野牛远比预想困难得多...它们那厚实的体型使它们极难被击晕, 但仍值得尝试去驯化它们, 因为它们会像捍卫自己族群那般为你死战到底。你的野牛或许无法快速终结战斗, 但它可凭自身强大的抗击打能力, 与任何来犯之敌缠斗到底。\r\n\r\n处于哺乳期的驯化母牛是一些部落里重要的乳源。其乳汁营养极其丰富, 与生存者调制的各种特殊炖汤食材搭配, 能产生不错的增益效果此外, 任何动物幼崽只要闻到乳香便无法抗拒, 哪怕是刚出生的双足飞龙也不介意其作为飞龙奶的替代!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2025555451",
      "Source": "Twin Imprint",
      //主动技能
