    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1048948801",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability:  For the next <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Duration] minutes</>, the targeted ally shares your imprint bonus for Creatures you have raised.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能:  在接下来的 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Duration]分钟</> 内, 你选中的盟友也可以对你留痕的生物触发留痕加成Buff效果。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3570032144",
      "Source": "Tracker",
      //主动技能
      "Trans": {"SC":"寻踪","JA":""},
      //寻踪
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3512998613",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability:  For the next <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Value2] seconds</>, gain the ability to track any or all of the following, within <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">80 meters</>:\\n- Enemy Players and Tames\\n- Enemy Structures\\n- Resource nodes (any or all):\\n  - Crystal, Obsidian, Metal, Pearls, Silicate, Oil, Sulfur, Element",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能:  在接下来的 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Value2]秒</> 内, 获得追踪 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">80米</> 范围内的以下任意或全部目标的能力:\\n- 敌方玩家及驯服生物\\n- 敌方建筑\\n- 资源点 (可选): 水晶, 黑曜石, 金属, 含硅珍珠, 硅酸盐, 油, 硫磺, 元素","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2766039574",
      "Source": "Telekinesis",
      //主动技能
      "Trans": {"SC":"念动力","JA":""},
      //官方翻译很棒!
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3420297531",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability:  For the next <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Value1] seconds</>--you can access inventories, pick up dropped items, and toggle Structures that you can see within <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">30 meters</>.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能:  在接下来的 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Value1]秒</> 内, 你可以与视野范围 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">30米</> 内的目标进行以下交互: 访问其物品栏, 拾取掉落物品, 以及切换建筑状态。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::307867035",
      "Source": "Spirit Rush",
      //主动技能
      "Trans": {"SC":"幽灵疾步","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::285453032",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability:  For the next <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Value2] seconds</>, you gain <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Value1}%</> movement speed, and phase through wild and your own tamed Creatures.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能:  在接下来的 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Value2]秒</> 内, 获得一个 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Value1}%</> 移速的加成, 并且可以穿透野生或你已驯服的生物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
