      //主动技能
      "Trans": {"SC":"反伤魔咒","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3414113978",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability:  For the next <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Value2] seconds</>, you reflect <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Value1}%</> of the (pre-mitigation) damage you take back to your attackers.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能:  在接下来的 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Value2]秒</> 内若受到攻击, 则会将计算减伤前 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Value1}%</> 的伤害反弹给攻击者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::367033536",
      "Source": "Spectral Mount",
      //主动技能
      "Trans": {"SC":"幽灵坐骑","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2605179590",
      "Source": "Gain an active ability:  For the next <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Value1] seconds</>, your mount becomes spectral. While spectral, it cannot be targetted by wild Creatures, it ignores all Stamina costs, and you cannot be forcibly dismounted from it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"获得一个主动技能:  在接下来的 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Value1]秒</> 内, 你的坐骑将变为“幽魂形态”该状态期间不会消耗耐力也不会成为野生生物的目标, 且骑手不会被强制脱离骑乘。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::566665972",
      "Source": "You cannot be targetted by wild Creatures, you ignore all Stamina costs, and your Rider cannot be forcibly dismounted.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"期间不会消耗耐力也不会成为野生生物攻击的目标, 且骑手不会被强制脱离骑乘。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
