    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3529075004",
      "Source": "Imprinting creatures you are raising is <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{!ImprintBonus}%</> more effective.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当你对生物进行留痕时, 留痕的效果会额外提升 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{!ImprintBonus}%</>。","JA":""},
