      "Source": "The Midas Touch",
      "Trans": {"SC":"点石成金","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2356010499",
      "Source": "When harvesting a Resouce node with a tool, you have a <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Chance}%</> chance to turn that node gold. Gold nodes have increased Health, and can be harvested for more Resources.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在使用工具采集资源时, 你有 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Chance}%</> 的几率将该资源变为金色资源, 金色资源拥有更高的耐久, 并且能开采出更多资源。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2379385011",
      "Source": "Speedy Harvester",
      "Trans": {"SC":"快速收割","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2821623146",
      "Source": "Harvesting a Resource node grants <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{SpeedMulti}%</> movement speed per stack for <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Duration]</> seconds per stack, stacking up to 5 times.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"采集资源时可获得每层 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{SpeedMulti}%</> 的移速加成, 持续 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">[Duration]</> 秒, 最高可叠加至5层。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::194847334",
      "Source": "Mounted Opportunist",
      "Trans": {"SC":"伺机奇袭","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::992505585",
      "Source": "Whenever your mount kills an enemy, it has a <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Chance}%</> chance to instantly restore 10% of its maximum Stamina.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"每当你的坐骑杀死敌人时, 有 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Chance}%</> 的几率恢复耐力, 其数值是最大耐力的10%","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4200944987",
      "Source": "Essence Eater",
      "Trans": {"SC":"噬魄","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1704921512",
      "Source": "Whenever you kill a Creature with your mount, it has a <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Chance}%</> chance to gain <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Value1}%</> increased damage for 20 seconds, stacking up to 3 times.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"每当你骑乘坐骑击杀生物时, 有 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Chance}%</> 的几率获得 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Value1}%</> 的伤害提升, 持续 20 秒, 最多可叠加3层。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2504246996",
      "Source": "Experienced Killer",
      "Trans": {"SC":"老牌猎手","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1765807470",
      "Source": "Your mounts gain <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{!XPMulti}%</> increased Experience from kills.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的坐骑从击杀获得的经验提高 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{!XPMulti}%</>。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1002872815",
      "Source": "Mass Production",
      "Trans": {"SC":"高效量产","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1647133141",
      "Source": "When you craft ammunition, you have a <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Chance}%</> chance to produce twice as many.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你制作弹药时, 有 <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">{Chance}%</> 的几率产出双倍数量。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
