    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::StopForIncompatibleModsMessage_Text",
      "Source": "You have activated mods that are not compatible with the current game version and require updating by the mod author. \nFor any mods with the \"Incompatible\" label, they must either be updated to a version compatible with the current game version or be disabled in order to continue.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你启用了不符合当前游戏版本的模组, 需要模组作者进行更新。\n\n带有(不兼容)标签的模组, 需要更新或是停用该模组才能继续游戏。","JA":""},
