    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3585829136",
      "Source": "A delicious piece of birthday cake, recovered from a theiving dodo! Sweet revenge!\r\n\r\nUse inside the inventory of or while aiming at a tamed dino for it to receive a 10% experience boost!\r\n\r\nCan also be consumed by humans.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一块从贪吃的渡渡鸟那里夺回的美味生日蛋糕 -- 甜蜜的复仇!\r\n\r\n在物品栏中使用, 或靠近并对准一只已驯服的恐龙使用, 使其获得10%的额外经验加成!\r\n\r\n也可供人类使食用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
