    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3325821580",
      "Source": "Our missing crew called this duck-billed glider a 'maewing'.\nThey genetically engineered it to be a wet nurse and surrogate parent for all kinds of baby animals.\nBabies supposedly find their milk irresistible.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //飞鼠
      //C999DCF7403808AA7245509EA70DB0CE
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4193505463",
      "Source": "That critter might seem kinda cute at arm's length, but you shouldn't let it near your head.\nI think it might be an ideovore -- like a vampire, but for free will.\nCreepy little noggin-goblin...\nWait, you could call it a 'noglin'!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //小不点
      //DD64918E4D9B9B3F955062BA70CAC483
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::474553315",
      "Source": "The crew saw one of those creatures swimming in the interstellar medium, and named it astrodelphis -- 'space dolphin'.\nSomeone aboard figured out how to tame and ride them -- guess they must've had a lot of time on their hands.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //海豚
      //FC6C41A345EFED32DCD692BC8AED9787
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3477896967",
      "Source": "Crew manuals call those roaming meks 'stryders'.\nI understand they were meant as robotic workhorses, for cleaning up toxins and harvesting resources.\nWorkhorses...\nImagine climbing up one of those and riding it around!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //跨步
      //C2FA4DAC47324E360D16E08E9F34C95C
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3187998093",
      "Source": "Now that is one formidable looking predator.\nI think it's some kind of chimera -- part cat, part spiny tropical fish, all trouble.\nIt seems to have unusually good camouflaging abilities, too.\nWhat would you name something like that?\nHow about...'shadowmane'?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //狮子
      //19670AF149A84E15808FE88D1B462BA9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1271058547",
      "Source": "That looks to be the stuff that Rockwell's been using to augment and aggro all his weird creatures. \n\nMaybe you can use it against him... You know, fight fire with fire? Bet he won't expect you to use his precious mutagen to beef up your own critters. \n\nCan't wait to see the look on his, uh, faces when you sic those muties on him! Just be careful handling that stuff in the meantime, yeah?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //诱变剂
      //C3F0A55F47B97B057F4B129DE4A71BF5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::736288641",
      "Source": "Crew members used this hi-tek crop plot to garden all over the ship.\nSeems like you could use one to raise harvestable plants just about anywhere!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //泰克耕地
      //BB6628404D365ACD5138FBB75CD25C5D
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2446790159",
      "Source": "Watch where you point that Federation phase pistol, unless it's set to heal or stun.\nYou could put an eye out with that thing.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //相枪
      //4FA86D2648CD81ECC30DF4AD3C6E0DD6
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1293455860",
      "Source": "That Federation-issue tek bow makes its own projectiles and shoots 'em with an EM railgun!\nI'd think that baby would put a hole through just about anything.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //泰克弓
      //62B67D60475AE6BE09B842A4CA3EF843
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2006031405",
      "Source": "Not sure if crew members used this for transport, recreation, or both.\nSeems like you could get around the ring pretty quick on one of these.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //悬浮板
      //684FA48145756F5F5AA58F9AF60FB2D7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3503883637",
      "Source": "That there's a Federation exo-mek, a kind of utility work suit for the crew to pilot inside and outside this starship.\nGood for repairs, heavy lifting, EVAs -- plus they could take a beating!\nI can see how these could really come in handy, especially given how fragile you humans are.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //外骨骼机甲
      //5D30D0ED48D49E61D7B7AEA48EDCEEA1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2111128930",
      "Source": "If you can get past its tentacular looks, this mutant hybrid seems useful as a foodsource...\nYou can grow it from seeds, but it provides edible meat.\nAnother of Rockwell's genetic modification experiments, I guess.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //种子
      //3DAC84274006152C55337E848D3D3157
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1113727115",
      "Source": "Must Have Chitin to Start Taming Cosmo",
      "Trans": {"SC":"需要有甲壳素才能开始驯服宇跳蛛","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
