    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::668401808",
      "Source": "Lives",
      "Trans": {"SC":"生命","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3700055747",
      "Source": "The essence of a perished \r\ntamed Cat. Can be resurrected \r\nin the waters of an Oasisaur. \r\nAlternatively, can be consumed \r\nby a survivor to be resurrected \r\nusing one of its lives.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一只死去的被驯养的猫.\r\n可以在绿洲龙的泉水中复活.\r\n或者, 生存者可以使用它消耗\r\n剩余生命次数来复活猫.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2967510091",
      "Source": "The essence of a perished tamed Cat. Can be resurrected in the waters of an Oasisaur. Alternatively, can be consumed by a survivor to be resurrected using one of its lives.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一只死去的被驯养的猫.\r\n可以在绿洲龙的泉水中复活.\r\n或者, 生存者可以使用它消耗\r\n剩余生命次数来复活猫.","JA":""},
      //可能多余的
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3937404796",
      "Source": "Common Name: Cat\r\nSpecies: Felis catus\r\nTime: Holocene\r\nDiet: Carnivore\r\nTemperament: Cat\r\n\r\nWild\r\nWhy am I not surprised that common house cats survived the end of the world? Feral cats have always been reasonably good at avoiding wild predators… Maybe it’s more of a wonder they haven’t managed to wreck the ecosystem here, given their taste for the feathered dinosaur descendants of my day.\r\n\r\nCats are unpredictable little goblins. Some attack anyone who invades their personal space, some run and hide, and a few are actually friendly. But the really mean cats will cling onto you while trying to scratch your eyes out. You’ll need to slap those off your face while you still have one.\r\n\r\nDomesticated\r\nThese fuzzy little fiends are fickle friends, but I’d bet you could win one over with a bit of meat or fish and some stroking of its malicious little ego. Not sure why you’d want to do that, exactly… Maybe they’d help keep thieving vermin from your camp? Or you could try drying out their spit-up hairballs for insulation…",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 猫\r\n拉丁学名: Felis catus\r\n正式名称: 家猫\r\n时代: 全新世\r\n食性: 肉食\r\n性情: 猫\r\n\r\n野生\r\n为什么我不会惊讶家猫竟然在末日中幸存了下来? 野猫总是能很好的避开捕食者...但更令人惊讶的是它们竟然没破坏这里的生态系统, 要知道在我那个年代, 这些家伙对带羽毛的恐龙后裔可是情有独钟呢。\r\n\r\n猫真是只令人难以琢磨的小妖精。有些猫会攻击侵犯它们的领地的人, 有些则会逃跑躲藏起来, 还有少数几只还算友好。但那些真正卑鄙的猫会抓挠你的眼睛。趁眼睛还没瞎的时候, 把它们从你身上拍下来。\r\n\r\n家养\r\n这些毛茸茸的小家伙可是些反复无常的朋友, 不过我敢说, 你只要给它们一点鱼或肉, 再迎合它那傲娇的性格, 就能赢得它的好感。不过, 真不明白你为什么要这么做, 也许是因为它们能防止偷窃的小贼靠近你的营地? 亦或是可以烘干它们吐出来的毛球作为保暖材料...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
