    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1220347672",
      "Source": "New-Armor Meiyin Li 'ARK: The Animated Series' Costume Skin",
      "Trans": {"SC":"新盔甲-李美盈 方舟: 动画套装","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2645014215",
      "Source": "This will override your shirt, pants, glove, and boot skins, acting as a full-body costume to make you look like New-Armor Meiyin Li in 'ARK: The Animated Series'! Should always be set on Torso Armor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个皮肤来覆盖其它外观, 充当全身套装, 可装扮成 '方舟：动画' 里的穿新盔甲的李美盈一样! 该皮肤装备在躯干或胸甲上。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1731631716",
      "Source": "Common Name: Deinotherium\r\nSpecies: Deinotherium Colossus\r\nTime: Late Miocene\r\nDiet: Herbivore\r\nTemperament: Territorial\r\n\r\nWild \r\nColossus felt like an appropriate name for such a massive variant of the already large elephant. Deinotherium dwarf their Mammoth cousins, and demonstrate terrifying strength and speed. You do not want to upset one of these! When angered, Deinotherium instead take an aggressive stance which results in a charge if the foe lingers for longer than welcome. In their hierachical based herds, aggrivated Deinotheriums will rally eachother with powerful roars. If you want to pick a fight with a herd, you should be ready.\r\n\r\nDomesticated\r\nDeinotherium are no easy feat to tame. During the aggressive posture they exhibit, Deinotherium will show various signals to indicate whether they're bluffing in their attack or just want that tasty beer they smell! Once tamed, these terrible bests will handily tear down opposing structures and forces, as well as providing some powerful moral boosting calls!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 恐象\r\n拉丁学名: Deinotherium Colossus\r\n正式名称: 巨兽恐象\r\n时代: 中新世晚期\r\n食性: 植食\r\n性情: 强领地意识\r\n\r\n野生\r\n用“巨兽”来命名这种体型远超普通大象的恐象再合适不过。它们的庞大身躯令其表亲猛犸都相形见绌, 更兼具骇人的力量与速度 -- 你绝对不想惹恼它们! 一旦被激怒, 恐象会立刻摆出攻击姿态, 若对手未及时退避, 它们便会发起冲锋。在其等级森严的族群中, 愤怒的恐象还会以震耳欲聋的咆哮相互呼应。若你执意挑战整个恐象群, 最好做好万全准备!\r\n\r\n家养\r\n驯服恐象绝非易事! 当它们摆出攻击姿态时, 会通过多种信号表示自己究竟是虚张声势, 还是单纯被空气中飘散的啤酒香气勾走了注意力。一旦成功驯服, 这些巨兽可轻松地将敌方建筑与部队碾碎, 同时它们还能为友军发出强有力且鼓舞士气的吼声!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
