    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::117000279",
      "Source": "Attach this to the bed of your BattleRig to gain access to a long-range cannon turret that deals high damage in an area, and ignores a portion of armor from anything it hits directly. Requires Advanced Sniper Bullets to fire.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"将该配件加装到战车的后车厢, 就能使用一门狙击加农炮, 它能对目标区域内造成高额伤害, 并且在直接命中目标时可无视部分护甲。需要制式狙击步枪子弹才能发射。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
