      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1197381893",
      "Source": "Prove your worth as a slave gladiator by surviving lethal challenges and racing at full speed in a makeshift vehicle.Face the colossal monster that has been stalking you to claim your freedom.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在致命的挑战中存活下来, 并驾驶临时拼凑的车辆全速疾驰, 证明你作为奴隶角斗士的价值。直面那一直暗中跟踪你的狰狞巨兽, 去赢得你的自由。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
