    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3610842569",
      "Source": "Helena, Mei Yin... Don’t do this. You need me!\r\nNo. Nooo!\r\nI’m sorry... Please, don’t leave me like this...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"海莲娜, 美盈...不要这样。你们需要我!\r\n\r\nNo. Nooo!\r\n\r\n我很抱歉...别就这样丢下我...","JA":""},
      //这里的Please, 我不知道该如何表达翻译才符合中文语境.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3479811021",
      "Source": "Primitive! Savage! How dare you? You are nothing! I am a god! How dare you?\r\nHate you! HATE YOU! I HATE YOU! Where have you banished me? What is this place? What is this feeling? Everything. Yes, everything. The earth and the sky. Every stone and every crevasse. I feel it all. What is this place? What am I?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"原始! 野蛮! 你怎么敢的? 你是蝼蚁! 我是神! 怎么敢的你?\r\n\r\n恨你! “恨你!” “我恨你!” 你把我赶到哪儿了? 这是什么地方? 这是什么感觉? 万事万物。是的, 万事万物。大地和天空。每一块石头和每一道裂隙。我都能感受得到。\r\n\r\n这是什么地方? 我是什么?","JA":""},
      //这里的Hate you! HATE YOU! I HATE YOU! 用大写表示嘶吼/加大音量的意思.中文可以加引号或者感叹号来体现; 也有用“我 恨 你!”来表示, 但用这里明显不合适;
      //You are nothing! 也可以翻译成你算什么东西!
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3917900637",
      "Source": "I am beginning to understand. It was hard to comprehend, for my eyes are still newly opened.\r\n\r\nI did not used to see as I see now, nor did I speak as I speak now. When I speak, it is not to a man. They are lesser beings. \r\n\r\nWhen I speak, I speak to this place, speak to the ARK, and it speaks back to me. It tells me secrets, things that I never could have understood as I was before.It whispers to me of something greater, a plane ever higher than the one I walk now. We can reach it, the two of us. The ARK and I. Together.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我开始明白了。这很难理解, 因为我的双眼刚刚看清。\r\n\r\n我以前看到的和现在不一样, 说话的方式也不一样。当我开口的时候, 对象也并非人类。他们是低等的存在。\r\n\r\n我是对着这个地方说, 对着方舟说, 而它也会回应我。它把秘密告诉了我, 那些我以前绝不可能理解的事情。它告诉了我有一个更加伟大的东西, 一个比我现在所处层面更高的维度。我们能够到达, 我们两个, 方舟和我 -- 一起。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::544737117",
      "Source": "There are many more mods for you to enjoy. \r\nBrowse mods by their categories, popularity, creation date and more.",
