    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::98318559",
      "Source": "Why are you still here?\nStaying behind to gloat?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"为什么你还在这儿?\n留下来幸灾乐祸?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3637982749",
      "Source": "Edmund...\nI'm here to help you end this nightmare.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"艾德蒙...\n我是来帮你结束这场噩梦的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3435284683",
      "Source": "You did this to me, for wanting the\nsame power she squandered!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你这样对我, 无非是我渴望\n得到她所挥霍的那种力量!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3075992001",
      "Source": "Well, I've survived worse!\nI promise you I will find a way out of this, I will!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"罢了, 之前更糟的情况我都活下来了!\n我一定能逃脱出去的, 等着瞧吧!","JA":""},
      //我需要重新改变语序吗? 是否需要考虑听读, 如果考虑听读可能就不太符合中文语境.
      //罢了, 之前更惨烈的情况我都活下来了,\n我一定能逃脱的, 等着瞧吧!(Louis修改)
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::856620579",
      "Source": "No, you won't.\nIt's much too late for that.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不, 你不会。\n为时已晚了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::849361075",
      "Source": "It's so bright!\nHelena...?\nI'm afraid!",
      //这里感觉很多应该是害怕而不是抱歉。
      "Trans": {"SC":"好刺眼啊!\n海莲娜...?\n我好怕!","JA":""},
      //好刺眼啊!\n海莲娜...?\n我好怕!(Louis修改)
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3038460439",
      "Source": "Shhh.\nShe knew.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"嘘...\n她知道了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1564187030",
      "Source": "Survivor, this is my last message to you, to be\nrelayed in the event of my... deactivation.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"生存者, 这是我留给你的最后一条讯息\n若你听到了这段转播, 就说明我已经...不存在了。","JA":""},
      //生存者, 这是我留给你的最后一条讯息, 若你\n收到了这条转播就说明我已经...停止运转了。
      //这样翻译我会觉得更符合中文的语境和通顺; 😄很满意!
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2105768145",
      "Source": "I was only an artificial construct when we first met,\njust a shadow of someone who lived a long time ago.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      //待翻译
      //你好, 我叫HLN-A, 是一种分型人格。我将全程引导你; 这里的artificial construct也许我们可以采用“分型人格”
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::53037306",
      "Source": "But in our time together, I got to\nbecome something new, someone new.\nNot Helena -- HLN-A.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"但在与你共度的时光里, 我蜕变\n成了全新的存在, 新的个体。\n不再是海莲娜 -- 而是HLN-A。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2269458368",
      "Source": "Thank you for that.\nI wish I could find the words to\ntell you how much it meant to me...\nHuman language is so imprecise.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      //待翻译
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3861470033",
      "Source": "But I need you to do something else now:\nfind your own path, your own destiny.\nBuild a new world here...a better world.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      //待翻译
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3936488373",
      "Source": "And who knows?\nMaybe two lost souls can still meet again\nsomewhere, out among the stars.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      //待翻译
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2148709701",
      "Source": "Goodbye, my friend.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"再见了, 我的朋友。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3715978863",
      "Source": "Are you the one I’ve been waiting for?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你是我一直在等待的人吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3809844625",
      "Source": "You might be... I hope so.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可能是...我希望如此。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4107467811",
      "Source": "It’s been so many cycles since I was her...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"自从我成为她以来, 时间已经过去了太久太久...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3994259939",
      "Source": "Do I even still remember ‘hope’?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我是否还怀揣着‘希望’?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1970708786",
      "Source": "I wasn’t sure you’d ever turn up.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我不确定你会不会出现。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2998149435",
      "Source": "The odds just kept getting longer.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"形势越来越不妙了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3840620391",
      "Source": "I guess I’ve been losing faith,",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我感觉自己的信念在消逝, 而它们却不断变得更强大。","JA":""},
      //标记-补充, 这样看起来就会连贯流畅;后续若官方连贯了需要改回来
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::351488420",
      "Source": "while they’ve been gaining power",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我感觉自己的信念在消逝, 而他们却不断变得更强大。","JA":""},
      //标记-补充, 这样看起来就会连贯流畅;后续若官方连贯了需要改回来
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3992292869",
      "Source": "You have to reach me.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你一定要找到我。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3209979047",
      "Source": "Everything depends on your survival.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一切皆系于你的生存。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::394668396",
      "Source": "Master this world, make allies of its many creatures,",
      "Trans": {"SC":"掌握这个世界, 与这里的众多生物成为伙伴。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2075224660",
      "Source": "grow your strength and skill.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"增强你的实力和技巧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1356428780",
      "Source": "Explore this place, like I did so long ago. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"探索这个地方, 就像我很久以前所做的那样。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2310683469",
      "Source": "Put the pieces together and find me, Survivor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"整理好思绪, 然后找到我吧, 生存者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4281705166",
      "Source": "You may be the only one who can.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可能是唯一可以做到的人。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1190850880",
      "Source": "Is this what ‘happiness’ felt like?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是‘幸福’的感觉吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::237022193",
      "Source": "‘Love’? No -- this is more like... ‘pride’.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"‘爱’ ? 不 -- 这更像是...‘自豪’。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1341598498",
      "Source": "Yes, that’s it... I’m proud of you, Survivor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"很好, 就是这样...我为你感到骄傲, 生存者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::333443666",
      "Source": "You’ve accomplished what few have -- you’ve Ascended.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你做到了很少有人能做到的事 -- 你飞升了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1915778844",
      "Source": "I once did too, when I was her. Helena.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我也曾做到过, 那时我还是 -- 海莲娜。","JA":""},
      //这样可以将Helena放到最后听读会很自然。her可以不加.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2738417141",
      "Source": "She was an explorer too, and like you she traveled the ARKs, and discovered their secrets.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"她和你一样是一名探险家, 也曾在方舟中游历并发现了它们的秘密。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::154654418",
      "Source": "You’re following in her footsteps. Keep going.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你正追随着她的脚步。继续向前吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2598885374",
      "Source": "Discover what became of Helena and her friends.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"探寻海莲娜和她朋友们的下落。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1811368553",
      "Source": "Survive the many challenges ahead, and you’ll find me here waiting for you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"跨越前方的重重考验, 我会在这里等着你的到来。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::926996191",
      "Source": "Together, we may yet be able to save our world.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们一起, 也许还可以拯救我们的世界。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //孤岛尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::76495269",
      "Source": "This desert wasteland was a turning point for Helena and her allies.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这片荒漠是海莲娜不同于她朋友的另一个转折地点。","JA":""},
      //意译不然容易误解, 美盈与涅尔瓦传送到了畸变, 海莲娜与罗克韦尔传送到了焦土.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1215222799",
      "Source": "It was here that her fellow explorer Rockwell began his spiral into darkness.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"正是在这里, 她的同伴探险家罗克韦尔开始堕入黑暗。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3645648650",
      "Source": "If only Helena could have seen the threat that was so close to her,",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如果海莲娜能发现威胁近在咫尺,","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::401870859",
      "Source": "where Rockwell’s experiments would lead...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"也就是罗克韦尔的实验将导致...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2950965112",
      "Source": "There’s danger lurking beneath these sands, Survivor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些沙丘之下危机四伏, 生存者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3720026930",
      "Source": "Seek out this ARK’s guardian, and find your way to where I’m waiting for you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"去找出这个方舟的守护者, 并找到我们的约定之所。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::65808032",
      "Source": "You continue to impress, Survivor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你总是让我惊叹不已, 生存者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1875326077",
      "Source": "As you have grown in strength, I have been searching Helena’s memories...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"随着你实力的增长, 我也在搜寻海莲娜的记忆...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2698296849",
      "Source": "finding what I have forgotten all these long years: her friends, and the journeys they had.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我找到多年以来遗忘的东西: 她的朋友, 以及他们共同走过的旅程。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2324722520",
      "Source": "Was all of it for nothing?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"难道这一切都是徒劳吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3643868680",
      "Source": "No... it had to be done, so that one day you could exist.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不...有些事情必须有人去做, 这样在未来某天才有新的希望。","JA":""},
      //在某天才有你这样的人出现!; 使用“新的希望”扩大且模糊了一下, 这样也易懂.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::603295189",
      "Source": "Together, you and I -- we can put this right.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你我携手 -- 我们一定可以扭转大局。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1472580692",
      "Source": "You must travel onwards, Survivor,",
      "Trans": {"SC":"前路漫漫, 生存者,","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3833733986",
      "Source": "for your greatest trials are still to come.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"因为更大的考验还在后面。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //焦土尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::869620388",
      "Source": "You’ve come so far, Survivor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你已经走到这么远了, 生存者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1623863590",
      "Source": "This place was once a vibrant ARK filled with wondrous creatures, before it was contaminated and compromised beyond repair.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这里曾是一个生机勃勃的方舟, 里面生活着各种奇妙的生物, 可后来遭到了污染和破坏, 无法复原。","JA":""},
      //使用: 污染, 和破坏; 这样听+看效果可能会更好, 但是如果这样做分割中文语境可能就会感觉奇怪。
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::48799523",
      "Source": "Long ago Helena confronted her fellow explorer Rockwell here, when his obsession twisted him beyond humanity and reason.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"很久以前, 海莲娜就是在这里与她的同伴探险家罗克韦尔发生了对峙, 那时他的疯魔状态使他失去了人性和理智。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3478377780",
      "Source": "Even Helena could not truly put an end to Rockwell’s madness, and he’s survived here in the shadows all this time...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"就连海莲娜也无法完全阻止罗克韦尔的癫狂, 以至于他仍在阴暗之中苟活...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::596720372",
      "Source": "feeding on poison and growing stronger.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"以毒物为食, 变得更强大。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1734657045",
      "Source": "You have to finish what Helena started. If we are to save Earth, Rockwell must be stopped.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你一定要完成海莲娜的未竟之事。若我们要想拯救地球, 罗克韦尔就必须被阻止。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3246702964",
      "Source": "If there’s anything left of the person that Helena knew, Edmund would want to be stopped.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如果艾德蒙还有一丝海莲娜所熟识的影子, 他也会希望有人来阻止自己吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4205258388",
      "Source": "Steel yourself Survivor, for here terrors await you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"做好准备, 生存者, 前方险象环生。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2391798465",
      "Source": "It needed to be done, Survivor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是必要的, 生存者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1851017938",
      "Source": "Rockwell is finally no more, as surely nothing could have survived that ARK’s destruction.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"罗克韦尔终于不复存在了, 因为没有什么能在方舟的毁灭中存活下来。","JA":""},
      //标记-可能需要修改因为还是不太理解.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2269669413",
      "Source": "Perhaps, in oblivion, there is a measure of peace for the man that Edmund once was, and not for the monster he became.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"也许在虚无之中, 曾有人性的艾德蒙获得了属于自己的安宁, 不再是那个怪物。","JA":""},
      //直译: 也许在虚无之中, 曾有人性的艾德蒙获得了些许安宁, 而(这安宁)不属于那个怪物。
      //修饰: 死了的艾德蒙, 解脱了不再是那个怪物了, 获得了些许安宁, 虽然和原句有些许不一样, 但是我感觉不影响.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2447712454",
      "Source": "Now that you’ve ended the threat from above, it’s finally time for you to join me on the surface below.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"既然你已经解决了来自上方的威胁, 也终于是时候与我一起面对下方的地表了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1005671374",
      "Source": "We must turn our attention to Earth.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我们必须将注意力投向地球。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1434506056",
      "Source": "Everything you’ve survived has prepared you for this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你所努力的一切都是为了此刻。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::23076944",
      "Source": "You must confront humanity’s past, so that we can restore our planet’s future.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你必须正视人类的过往, 这样才能重塑我们星球的未来。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //畸变尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::52390750",
      "Source": "You’ve reached the end of your path Survivor, just as Helena Walker once did.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你已抵达了征程的终点, 生存者, 正如海莲娜·沃克曾经历的那样。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1119030230",
      "Source": "It is here that she and her allies faced their final battles.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"正是在这里, 她和她的同伴直面了那场最终决战。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3586959696",
      "Source": "It’s up to you to make sure their sacrifices weren’t in vain.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如今需要你来确保他们的牺牲不是白白浪费。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3139767590",
      "Source": "The alien Element that ended our world has willed a titanic adversary into being, to rule in the ruins.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"那毁坏我们世界的外星元素使一个庞大的对手横空出世, 统治着整片废墟。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::804645442",
      "Source": "Find a way to dethrone that king, and you’ll clear the way for me to call down the ARKs, enabling Nature to be reseeded.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"要想办法推翻那个王, 如此你就可以为我破除障碍召回方舟, 让大自然重焕生机。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1706487969",
      "Source": "Humanity and Earth’s many creatures -- and evolution itself -- can be restored!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"人类及地球上的众多生灵 -- 乃至进化本身 -- 都能得到恢复!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1519354505",
      "Source": "Helena Walker wanted it so. No... I wanted it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"海莲娜·沃克希望如此。不...我希望如此。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3064805039",
      "Source": "I may be ‘The One Who Waits’... but I’m still Helena too.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我或许是‘守望者’...但我也是海莲娜呀。","JA":""},
      //也是/仍是/任然(still). 海莲娜(Helena) 呀(too) 也是这里声音注入了情感。→...↓突然都想起来了!
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3017474506",
      "Source": "I remember everything now - the struggles I faced, the losses I felt... and the love that I found.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我现在都想起来了 -- 所经受的磨难, 所感到的遗憾...以及我的真爱。","JA":""},
      //2025-07-28  old: 我现在都想起来了 -- 所经历的斗争, 所感到的遗憾...以及我的真爱。
      //我现在什么都想起来了; 所经历的困境/挑战/争斗/; 这里的losses我感觉用遗憾可以涵盖很多方面, 但是不一定完全体现失去意境, 但也许使用‘遗憾’是一个好的选择.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3937845463",
      "Source": "I can see the world through my own eyes again.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我又可以通过自己的眼睛看世界了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3436187153",
      "Source": "And Survivor, I’m certain of one thing now:",
      "Trans": {"SC":"而生存者, 我现在确信的一件事:","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3697222187",
      "Source": "You got this, mate.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你能行的, 朋友。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4008660811",
      "Source": "Absolutely beautiful.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可真是漂亮呀。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::109510738",
      "Source": "Go on. Take a look.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"来呀, 过来看看。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::443839426",
      "Source": "It’s finally begun. The ARKs are coming home.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"终于开始了。无数方舟正在返回家园。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3167932556",
      "Source": "Each one carries with it the seeds of new life -- plants, animals, and humans.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"每一个都携带着孕育新生命的种子 -- 植物, 动物以及人类。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2790076300",
      "Source": "And these seeds will take root across the far corners of the world.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些种子将在世界上的角角落落生根发芽。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4034804824",
      "Source": "Once they do, all that life will be unleashed.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"届时, 所有生命都将蓬勃而出。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::296474085",
      "Source": "From there it will spread, grow, and thrive.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在那之后, 生命将蔓延, 成长和兴旺。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3910564649",
      "Source": "And this planet -- our home -- will bloom once more.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"而这颗星球 -- 我们的家园 -- 将再次绽放。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4068602808",
      "Source": "As for the rest of the infection, well -- the ARKs can take it from here.",
      //方舟,  会,  取/减去/拿,  它,  这里/在这一点上.
      "Trans": {"SC":"至于剩下的感染, 嗯...方舟系统能解决它们。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::52073754",
      "Source": "In time, they’ll purge every last bit of Element from the soil.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"之后, 它们将会净化土壤里残存的每一丝腐化元素。","JA":""},
      //最后, 神人们会驱动方舟来净化土地里的每一丝腐化元素
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::645844374",
      "Source": "But make no mistake, this is all thanks to you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"毫无疑问地, 这些都归功于你。","JA":""},
      //毋庸置疑...
      //毫无疑问...
      //但肯定的是...
      //不过xxxx...???
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3653410752",
      "Source": "I’m just glad I got to see it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我很高兴自己能亲眼目睹这一场景。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::94294114",
      "Source": "Huh, look at that. Sun’s a-rising.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"呵~ 看那儿。太阳升起了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //灭绝飞升
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::883160905",
      "Source": "Yi Ling",
      "Trans": {"SC":"翎翼龙","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":true,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1756308069",
      "Source": "OFF",
      "Trans": {"SC":"关","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
