    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4033455826",
      "Source": "As a man or woman stranded naked, freezing & starving on a mysterious island, you must hunt, harvest, craft items, grow crops, and build shelters to survive. Use skill and cunning to kill, tame, breed, and ride dinosaurs & primeval creatures. Master your environment and explore the hidden depths to uncover ARK's secrets!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你孤身一人苏醒在空旷的海岸边, 身无寸缕, 饥寒交迫。面前的这座岛屿环境原始, 危机四伏, 你必须尽快学会狩猎采集资源、制作物品、种植庄稼以及建造建栖身之处, 从而让自己更好地生存下去。同时, 你也可以运用技巧和智慧去击杀或驯养、繁育、骑乘那些生活在这片岛屿上的史前巨兽。活下来并主宰这里的环境, 最终揭开方舟的谜底!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1873623764",
      "Source": "THE ISLAND:\r\nAs a man or woman stranded naked, freezing & starving on a mysterious island, you must hunt, harvest, craft items, grow crops, and build shelters to survive. Use skill and cunning to kill, tame, breed, and ride dinosaurs & primeval creatures. Master your environment and explore the hidden depths to uncover ARK's secrets!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你孤身一人苏醒在空旷的海岸边, 身无寸缕, 饥寒交迫。面前的这座岛屿环境原始, 危机四伏, 你必须尽快学会狩猎采集资源、制作物品、种植庄稼以及建造建栖身之处, 从而让自己更好地生存下去。同时, 你也可以运用技巧和智慧去击杀或驯养、繁育、骑乘那些生活在这片岛屿上的史前巨兽。活下来并主宰这里的环境, 最终揭开方舟的谜底!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3085151063",
      "Source": "The Center is a massive new map for survivors to explore, nearly double the size of the playable geography of the Island landscape making it about 70 sq. kilometers. The Center complements the current ARK biomes with a rich, hand-drawn Tolkien-esque aesthetic. Filled with stunning lighting effects, lava rivers, giant picturesque mountains, misty floating islands, ancient underground ice caves, and more!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是一张有着巨大可探索面积的新地图, 其可探索地域的面积之广, 几乎是孤岛的两倍, 约70平方公里。中心岛以其丰富多彩, 充满手绘 \"托尔金美学\" 的元素, 为方舟现有生态系统增添了美学的深度。这里充满了令人叹为观止的光影效果, 蜿蜒流淌的熔岩河流, 风景如画的巨大山脉, 云遮雾绕的浮空岛屿, 古老深幽的地下冰洞, 等多种美景!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3639834756",
      "Source": "THE CENTER:\r\nThe Center is a massive new map for survivors to explore, nearly double the size of the playable geography of the Island landscape making it about 70 sq. kilometers. The Center complements the current ARK biomes with a rich, hand-drawn Tolkien-esque aesthetic. Filled with stunning lighting effects, lava rivers, giant picturesque mountains, misty floating islands, ancient underground ice caves, and more!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是一张有着巨大可探索面积的新地图, 其可探索地域的面积之广, 几乎是孤岛的两倍, 约70平方公里。中心岛以其丰富多彩, 充满手绘 \"托尔金美学\" 的元素, 为方舟现有生态系统增添了美学的深度。这里充满了令人叹为观止的光影效果, 蜿蜒流淌的熔岩河流, 风景如画的巨大山脉, 云遮雾绕的浮空岛屿, 古老深幽的地下冰洞, 等多种美景!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2103755951",
      "Source": "Put your survival skills to the test as you find yourself stranded naked, dehydrated & starving in a vast desert. Even the most seasoned ARK survivors must quickly find water, hunt for food, harvest, craft items, and build shelter to have any chance for survival. Use skills honed on ARK's Island to kill, tame, breed, and ride the fantastical new creatures that have evolved to survive the Desert's ultra harsh conditions, including... DRAGONS!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"周遭的一切都将会是考验你的生存技巧, 你身无寸缕地被困在一片广袤的沙漠之中, 又饥又渴, 即便是最老练的生存者, 想要存活下来就必须迅速找到水源寻得食物、采集资源、制作物品并且搭建栖身之所。用从遥远的孤岛上磨炼出的技能来击杀或驯养、繁育、骑乘这些在沙漠超严苛条件下进化求存的神秘新生物, 其中包括...飞龙!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2857050577",
      "Source": "SCORCHED EARTH:\r\nPut your survival skills to the test as you find yourself stranded naked, dehydrated & starving in a vast desert. Even the most seasoned ARK survivors must quickly find water, hunt for food, harvest, craft items, and build shelter to have any chance for survival. Use skills honed on ARK's Island to kill, tame, breed, and ride the fantastical new creatures that have evolved to survive the Desert's ultra harsh conditions, including... DRAGONS!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"周遭的一切都将会是考验你的生存技巧, 你身无寸缕地被困在一片广袤的沙漠之中, 又饥又渴, 即便是最老练的生存者, 想要存活下来就必须迅速找到水源寻得食物、采集资源、制作物品并且搭建栖身之所。用从遥远的孤岛上磨炼出的技能来击杀或驯养、繁育、骑乘这些在沙漠超严苛条件下进化求存的神秘新生物, 其中包括...飞龙!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1732919087",
      "Source": "Journey through an expansive 144 sq. kilometer fantasty highland, where common and all-new biomes are combined to bring the ultimate survivor experience. Whether tackling the extreme cold atop the highest mountains, harvesting resources from an active volcano, or just searching for that perfect base location, Ragnarok plays host to explorers and base builders alike. But survivors beware, Ragnarok houses such creatures as Polar Bears, Ice Wyverns, and a mystical creature many have yet to tame in the ARK universe.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"踏上这144平方公里广袤天地的旅程, 这里融合了多个生物群, 为你的旅程带来一场极致的体验。无论是在山峰抵御寒冷, 在火山中采集资源, 还是寻找完美的建家位置, 仙境都是探险者和建造爱好者的大本营。不过要切记, 北极熊以及寒冰飞龙都居住此地, 甚至有许多在方舟宇宙中尚未被驯服的神秘生物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4272949926",
      "Source": "RAGNAROK:\r\nJourney through an expansive 144 sq. kilometer fantasty highland, where common and all-new biomes are combined to bring the ultimate survivor experience. Whether tackling the extreme cold atop the highest mountains, harvesting resources from an active volcano, or just searching for that perfect base location, Ragnarok plays host to explorers and base builders alike. But survivors beware, Ragnarok houses such creatures as Polar Bears, Ice Wyverns, and a mystical creature many have yet to tame in the ARK universe.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"踏上这144平方公里广袤天地的旅程, 这里融合了多个生物群, 为你的旅程带来一场极致的体验。无论是在山峰抵御寒冷, 在火山中采集资源, 还是寻找完美的建家位置, 仙境都是探险者和建造爱好者的大本营。不过要切记, 北极熊以及寒冰飞龙都居住此地, 甚至有许多在方舟宇宙中尚未被驯服的神秘生物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2010010883",
      "Source": "Explore new heights and hidden depths; whether it’s creating your foundations in the White Cliffs or unearthing the secrets of the Aberration Trench, Valguero offers a new experience in the ARK universe. With new biomes, challenging dungeon bosses, and mysterious ruins to discover, there’s always something exciting — and dangerous — on Valguero.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"来探索这里的角角落落吧。无论是在白色峭壁中建立你的基地, 或是发掘异变海沟中的秘密, 瓦尔盖罗给方舟世界带来了全新的体验。这里拥有新的生态圈、富有挑战性的最终BOSS以及神秘的废墟等待着你的探索。瓦尔盖罗, 一个充满着刺激和危险的神奇世界。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::628308952",
      "Source": "VALGUERO:\r\nExplore new heights and hidden depths; whether it’s creating your foundations in the White Cliffs or unearthing the secrets of the Aberration Trench, Valguero offers a new experience in the ARK universe. With new biomes, challenging dungeon bosses, and mysterious ruins to discover, there’s always something exciting — and dangerous — on Valguero.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"来探索这里的角角落落吧。无论是在白色峭壁中建立你的基地, 或是发掘异变海沟中的秘密, 瓦尔盖罗给方舟世界带来了全新的体验。这里拥有新的生态圈、富有挑战性的最终BOSS以及神秘的废墟等待着你的探索。瓦尔盖罗, 一个充满着刺激和危险的神奇世界。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3513156799",
      "Source": "Waking up on Aberration, a derelict, malfunctioning ARK with an elaborate underground biome system, survivors face exotic new challenges unlike anything before: extreme radioactive sunlight and environmental hazards, ziplines, wingsuits, climbing gear, cave dwellings, charge-batteries, and far more, along with a stable of extraordinary new creatures await within the mysterious depths. But beware the 'Nameless': unrelenting, Element-infused humanoids which have evolved into vicious light-hating monstrosities! On Aberration, survivors will uncover the ultimate secrets of the ARKs, and discover what the future holds in store for those strong and clever enough to survive!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是一个因故障而被废弃的方舟。在畸变的地下世界中醒来, 在这里面临异乎寻常的挑战: 极端日照辐射和环境灾害、滑索、滑翔翼、登山镐、穴居生物、蓄电池等等。神秘的深渊里还有各种非凡的新物种等待人们的发现。但是要特别小心 “无名怪” , 这是一种被元素腐蚀且畏光的类人生物! 在畸变的世界中, 只有最坚强聪明的生存者才能发现方舟的终极秘密!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::5209468",
      "Source": "ABERRATION:\r\nWaking up on Aberration, a derelict, malfunctioning ARK with an elaborate underground biome system, survivors face exotic new challenges unlike anything before: extreme radioactive sunlight and environmental hazards, ziplines, wingsuits, climbing gear, cave dwellings, charge-batteries, and far more, along with a stable of extraordinary new creatures await within the mysterious depths. But beware the 'Nameless': unrelenting, Element-infused humanoids which have evolved into vicious light-hating monstrosities! On Aberration, survivors will uncover the ultimate secrets of the ARKs, and discover what the future holds in store for those strong and clever enough to survive!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是一个因故障而被废弃的方舟。在畸变的地下世界中醒来, 在这里面临异乎寻常的挑战: 极端日照辐射和环境灾害、滑索、滑翔翼、登山镐、穴居生物、蓄电池等等。神秘的深渊里还有各种非凡的新物种等待人们的发现。但是要特别小心 “无名怪” , 这是一种被元素腐蚀且畏光的类人生物! 在畸变的世界中, 只有最坚强聪明的生存者才能发现方舟的终极秘密!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1246458858",
      "Source": "Finish your journey through the worlds of ARK in Extinction, where the story began and ends: on Earth itself! An Element-infested, ravaged planet filled with fantastical creatures both organic & technological, Earth holds both the secrets of the past and the keys to its salvation. As a veteran Survivor who has conquered all previous obstacles, your ultimate challenge awaits: can you defeat the gigantic roaming Titans which dominate the planet, and complete the ARK cycle to save Earth's future?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你们将回到地球, 在这\"破灭\"的世界中见证非凡, 因为这里是一切方舟故事的起源和终焉! 地球, 现在是一颗元素泛滥、饱受蹂躏、遍布科技生物和奇异有机体的星球。作为身经百战的精英生存者, 面前摆着一个终极挑战: 你们是否有能力击败肆虐地球的巨型泰坦, 完成方舟循环, 最终拯救地球的未来?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1338204075",
      "Source": "EXTINCTION\r\nFinish your journey through the worlds of ARK in Extinction, where the story began and ends: on Earth itself! An Element-infested, ravaged planet filled with fantastical creatures both organic & technological, Earth holds both the secrets of the past and the keys to its salvation. As a veteran Survivor who has conquered all previous obstacles, your ultimate challenge awaits: can you defeat the gigantic roaming Titans which dominate the planet, and complete the ARK cycle to save Earth's future?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你们将回到地球, 在这\"破灭\"的世界中见证非凡, 因为这里是一切方舟故事的起源和终焉! 地球, 现在是一颗元素泛滥、饱受蹂躏、遍布科技生物和奇异有机体的星球。作为身经百战的精英生存者, 面前摆着一个终极挑战: 你们是否有能力击败肆虐地球的巨型泰坦, 完成方舟循环, 最终拯救地球的未来?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2089050258",
      "Source": "Continue your quest for ultimate survival and unlock a whole new chapter in the saga of ARK: Survival Evolved! Waking up inside a virtual simulation, with a strangely familiar robotic companion, you must overcome rigorous missions to survive across multiple exotic worlds unlike anything you've seen before!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"继续你对终极生存的追求之路, 并在 \"方舟:生存飞升\" 开启一个全新的篇章! 你在一个虚拟模拟中醒来, 身边是一位奇怪而熟悉的机械伙伴。你必须完成严苛的任务, 以求在数个前所未见的异域世界中生存, 这些地方与你以往所见完全不同!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::933755097",
      "Source": "GENESIS: PART 1\r\nContinue your quest for ultimate survival and unlock a whole new chapter in the saga of ARK: Survival Evolved! Waking up inside a virtual simulation, with a strangely familiar robotic companion, you must overcome rigorous missions to survive across multiple exotic worlds unlike anything you've seen before!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"继续你对终极生存的追求之路, 并在 \"方舟:生存飞升\" 开启一个全新的篇章! 你在一个虚拟模拟中醒来, 身边是一位奇怪而熟悉的机械伙伴。你必须完成严苛的任务, 以求在数个前所未见的异域世界中生存, 这些地方与你以往所见完全不同!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2304267519",
      "Source": "Complete the eons-spanning story of ARK: Survival Evolved! Everything that your tribe has built, tamed, and fought for has led to this final challenge. With your faithful artificial companion HLN-A by your side, you’ve emerged from the Genesis simulation to find yourself aboard a gigantic starship being overtaken by a familiar threat from the distant past. Humanity’s future is in your hands, Survivor -- one last time!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"完成这场 \"方舟生存:飞升\" 中跨时代的故事! 一直以来你所建立的部落, 所驯服的生物和为之奋斗的一切都是为了这一最终挑战。在你忠实的伙伴HLN-A的陪伴下, 你成功从创世模拟中走了出来, 发现自己身处一艘巨大的宇宙飞船上, 一个来自遥远的过去的你所熟悉的威胁正在降临。人类的未来掌握在你手中, 生存者! 最后一战!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3953188457",
      "Source": "GENESIS: PART 2\r\nComplete the eons-spanning story of ARK: Survival Evolved! Everything that your tribe has built, tamed, and fought for has led to this final challenge. With your faithful artificial companion HLN-A by your side, you’ve emerged from the Genesis simulation to find yourself aboard a gigantic starship being overtaken by a familiar threat from the distant past. Humanity’s future is in your hands, Survivor -- one last time!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"完成这场 \"方舟生存:飞升\" 中跨时代的故事! 一直以来你所建立的部落, 所驯服的生物和为之奋斗的一切都是为了这一最终挑战。在你忠实的伙伴HLN-A的陪伴下, 你成功从创世模拟中走了出来, 发现自己身处一艘巨大的宇宙飞船上, 一个来自遥远的过去的你所熟悉的威胁正在降临。人类的未来掌握在你手中, 生存者! 最后一战!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::511930998",
      "Source": "This ARK has been dynamically generated, for a unique, custom experience!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这座方舟是随机生成的, 可为你提供一种独一无二, 定制化的体验!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3144997537",
      "Source": "PROCEDURAL ARK:\r\nThis ARK has been dynamically generated, for a unique, custom experience!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"随机生成方舟: \r\n这座方舟是随机生成的, 可为你提供一种独一无二, 定制化的体验!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2423112757",
      "Source": "This is a user-created ARK!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是一座由用户创建的方舟!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2627230169",
      "Source": "CUSTOM ARK:\r\nThis is a user-created ARK!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"自定义方舟:\r\n这是一座由用户创建的方舟!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::326932360",
      "Source": "A community classic ARK map returns, updated for the Official Server networks! Crystal Isles is 150 square kilometers of awe-inspiring biomes… Build bases high in forest canopy and floating islands, and tame your own Tropeognathus to ride into aerial combat!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一张深受广大玩家喜爱的经典的方舟地图在官方服务器回归了! 水晶岛占地150平方公里, 有着令人敬畏的生物群落...在森林的树冠上和浮动的岛屿上建立基地, 并驯服属于你自己的全新脊颌翼龙 -- 骑着它在空中进行战斗!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2047086560",
      "Source": "CRYSTAL ISLES:\r\nA community classic ARK map returns, updated for the Official Server networks! Crystal Isles is 150 square kilometers of awe-inspiring biomes… Build bases high in forest canopy and floating islands, and tame your own Tropeognathus to ride into aerial combat!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一张深受广大玩家喜爱的经典的方舟地图在官方服务器回归了! 水晶岛占地150平方公里, 有着令人敬畏的生物群落...在森林的树冠上和浮动的岛屿上建立基地, 并驯服属于你自己的全新脊颌翼龙 -- 骑着它在空中进行战斗!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::225923269",
      "Source": "Explore the soaring heights and hidden depths of Lost Island, featuring three powerful new creatures for you to tame. Discover jungle valleys fed by giant waterfalls, build a treehouse high in the forest canopies, get down and dirty in vast mangrove swamps, dive deep underwater, brave treacherous snowy peaks, or spelunk uncharted cave systems in search of treasure... whichever way you go, wild adventure awaits!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"探索迷失岛霄汉的高空以及深邃的低谷吧! 三种强大的全新的生物可供你驯服! 快来发现由巨大瀑布滋养的丛林山谷, 在高大的森林树冠上建造树屋, 在红树林沼泽里跌打翻滚, 在清凉的水下深潜, 勇敢地挑战险峻的雪峰, 又或是在未知的洞穴中寻宝...总会有一款适合你!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3948051391",
      "Source": "LOST ISLAND:\r\nExplore the soaring heights and hidden depths of Lost Island, featuring three powerful new creatures for you to tame. Discover jungle valleys fed by giant waterfalls, build a treehouse high in the forest canopies, get down and dirty in vast mangrove swamps, dive deep underwater, brave treacherous snowy peaks, or spelunk uncharted cave systems in search of treasure... whichever way you go, wild adventure awaits!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"探索迷失岛霄汉的高空以及深邃的低谷吧! 三种强大的全新的生物可供你驯服! 快来发现由巨大瀑布滋养的丛林山谷, 在高大的森林树冠上建造树屋, 在红树林沼泽里跌打翻滚, 在清凉的水下深潜, 勇敢地挑战险峻的雪峰, 又或是在未知的洞穴中寻宝...总会有一款适合你!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2895813347",
      "Source": "Explore a magical Norse-inspired world, and travel to the legendary planes of Asgard, Jotunheim, and Vanaheim. Fjordur features four powerful new creatures for you to tame, including Andrewsarchus, Desmodus, Fjordhawk, and even Fenrir itself! Journey across over 75 square kilometers of new biomes, and face new challenges as you discover over 200 Runes to increase your Survivor's power!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一起来方舟探索这寒冷又严峻的北欧群岛吧! 前往阿斯加德, 约顿海姆和瓦纳海姆等平行世界! 此次的全新地图维京有着四种全新的生物供你收集! 通过发现200多处符文来增加生存者的力量! 更囊括了超过75平方公里的新生物群落, 新的挑战, 以及不可错过的景致与探险!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2118878490",
      "Source": "FJORDUR:\r\nExplore a magical Norse-inspired world, and travel to the legendary planes of Asgard, Jotunheim, and Vanaheim. Fjordur features four powerful new creatures for you to tame, including Andrewsarchus, Desmodus, Fjordhawk, and even Fenrir itself! Journey across over 75 square kilometers of new biomes, and face new challenges as you discover over 200 Runes to increase your Survivor's power!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一起来方舟探索这寒冷又严峻的北欧群岛吧! 前往阿斯加德, 约顿海姆和瓦纳海姆等平行世界! 此次的全新地图维京有着四种全新的生物供你收集! 通过发现200多处符文来增加生存者的力量! 更囊括了超过75平方公里的新生物群落, 新的挑战, 以及不可错过的景致与探险!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3106634666",
      "Source": "Enter a mysterious simulation of a fantastical “Club” inspired by the worlds of ARK and beyond. As you put up your feet and hang-out, you can dive into a variety of ever-growing mini-games and missions, earning prizes, items and dinos that you can take back \"home\" with you!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"进入一个充满奇妙色彩的仿真俱乐部, 这奇妙的 \"俱乐部\" 灵感来自方舟和其它世界。您可以沉浸在愉悦的氛围中放松身心, 享受悠闲时光的同时, 您也可以通过投身一系列精彩纷呈的小游戏和任务, 不断挑战自我, 积累积分, 赢取丰厚的奖励、珍稀物资以及恐龙伙伴, 并且你可以带着它们跟你 \"回家\" !","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3260994849",
      "Source": "CLUB ARK:\r\nEnter a mysterious simulation of a fantastical “Club” inspired by the worlds of ARK and beyond. As you put up your feet and hang-out, you can dive into a variety of ever-growing mini-games and missions, earning prizes, items and dinos that you can take back \"home\" with you!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"进入一个充满奇妙色彩的仿真俱乐部, 这奇妙的 \"俱乐部\" 灵感来自方舟和其它世界。您可以沉浸在愉悦的氛围中放松身心, 享受悠闲时光的同时, 您也可以通过投身一系列精彩纷呈的小游戏和任务, 不断挑战自我, 积累积分, 赢取丰厚的奖励、珍稀物资以及恐龙伙伴, 并且你可以带着它们跟你 \"回家\" !","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::904789816",
      "Source": "Discover Astraeos, a colossal ARK map steeped in Greek mythology. Explore 260km² of stunning landscapes, from ancient ruins and majestic marble cliffs to blossoming cherry groves. Face powerful new enemies and tame the Maeguana, a unique, Maewing-like creature found only on Astraeos!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一起来探索星耀这张以希腊神话为主题的大型方舟地图吧! 踏上这片260km²的土地, 将这壮丽景观尽收眼底, 从斑驳的古老遗迹, 到巍峨的大理石断崖, 再到樱花盛放的秘境森林。这里有着许多新内容等着你来挑战, 还有一只星耀地图独有且外形酷似鸭嘴飞鼠的神秘生物“风行蜥”正等待着你来驯服!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //新地图说明
    },
