      "Source": "A saddle for your Archelon. Provides Oxygen to nearby survivors, and can seat 4 additional passengers!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"为你的古巨龟配备一副鞍座。可额外容纳4名乘客, 并且可为附近的玩家提供氧气。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //古巨龟
    },
