    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2207289024",
      "Source": "ARK: The Survival of the Fittest pits up to 60 combatants against each other in a fast-paced, action-packed struggle for survival, where players are ultimately pushed into an epic final showdown leading their Dinosaur Armies into battle.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"方舟: 适者生存 将高达60名生存者投入的一个快节奏、紧张刺激的生存搏斗, 玩家们将率领他们的恐龙军团最终迎来一场史诗级的对决。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //主页界面
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2293782543",
      "Source": "Create or join your single-player or non-dedicated server with customized gameplay settings and rules tailored to your liking.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"创建单机模式或非专业主机服务器, 根据你的喜好来定制游戏设置和规则吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //主页界面
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::271119015",
      "Source": "Browse, download, and manage mods available via CurseForge. Mod creators have the ability to use the full power of Unreal Engine 5, to create essentially anything: new creatures, items, gameplay modes & features, and maps.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"浏览、下载并管理通过 CurseForge 提供的模组。模组创作者可以充分发挥 虚幻5引擎 的强大功能, 创造出全新的生物、物品、游戏模式与特色, 以及各种富有创意的地图。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //主页界面
    },
