      "NamespaceHash": "Content::919069205",
      "Source": "Apply Love Bug Hearts to this, and then use when sitting on a chair or bench (or Pelagornis!) to catch some lovely fish.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"将小爱虫之心用作饵料, 坐在椅子或长凳上 (或伪齿鸟上!) 然后开始抓一些可爱的鱼吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //爱心鱼竿描述
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::480458445",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of a shirt into an ugly holiday sweater. \r\n\r\nYou know you've always wanted to cuddle with a Rex.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来改变上衣的外观, 使其变成难看的节日毛衣。\r\n\r\n我知道我是想抱一下暴龙的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2879549064",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of a helmet or hat into a decorative heart headband.\\n\\nNon-human creatures adamantly refuse to wear this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来改变头盔或帽子的外观, 使其变成装饰性的心形发箍。\\n\\n非人类的生物是不愿意佩戴的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2217437177",
      "Source": "This will override all other skins, acting as a full-body costume. Should always be set on Torso Armor.  Show everyone you can be as charismatic as the original Mouse.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个皮肤来覆盖其它外观, 充当全身套装。该皮肤装备在躯干或胸甲上。\r\n\r\n向大家展示你也可以像最初时的米老鼠一样有魅力。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
