    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3450667123",
      "Source": "This will override your shirt, pants, glove, and boot skins, acting as a full-body costume to make you look like Alasie in 'ARK: The Animated Series'!\"My dad says every day is a gift.\" Should always be set on Torso Armor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个皮肤来覆盖其它外观, 充当全身套装, 可装扮成 '方舟：动画' 里的阿拉茜一样! \"我爸爸说,每一天都是一份礼物.\" 该皮肤装备在躯干或胸甲上。","JA":""},
