      "Source": "Raptor Claus Letter [ITEM TYPE]",
      "Trans": {"SC":"许愿信件 [ITEM TYPE]","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //圣诞节活动
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::672289731",
      "Source": "Ask Raptor Claus for a holiday gift! Make sure you're tucked away in bed near a Holiday Tree when he arrives with your <RichColor Color=\"0,1,1,1\">[ITEM TYPE]</>. The nicer you are, the better the reward! Though the naughty may not like what they get...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"向圣诞老人需要许愿一份礼物! 当圣诞老人带着你的<RichColor Color=\"0,1,2,2\">[ITEM TYPE]</>礼物到来时, 请确保你已经躺在圣诞树旁的床上。你表现的越好, 得到的奖励就会越好! 不过, 淘气的人可能不会喜欢他们得到的东西...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //圣诞节活动
    },
