    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::722293213",
      "Source": "Get ready for Wild West trains, steampunk airships, post-apocalyptic battle-cars and more in Bob's Tall Tales! Discover new story adventure content, new creatures, structures, items, and cosmetics across the ARKs – all brought to life by big-hero Bob (Karl Urban) and Meeka (Auli'i Cravalho)!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"准备好迎接“鲍勃的传奇故事”中的西部荒野火车、蒸汽朋克飞艇、末日战车等多种元素! 探险全新的故事冒险内容、新的生物、建筑、物品以及各种装饰品 – 所有的这些都是由大英雄鲍勃 (卡尔·厄本) 以及 咪卡 (奥丽伊·卡瓦洛) 给我们带来生动的呈现!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2269733824",
      "Source": "Harvest Bonus: +{1}%",
      "Trans": {"SC":"收获加成: +{1}%","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
