      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4192244224",
      "Source": "UNACCEPT WAGERS",
      "Trans": {"SC":"不接受赌注","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //牌桌
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::149315438",
      "Source": "A highly competitive tournament version of Poker.\r\nPlayers sit down and wager any Items they want in a long-form tournament-style game. All players must agree to wagered Items before the game begins. Blinds increase as the game goes on, and play continues until one player wins all the chips. The winning player keeps all the wagered Items.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"高度竞争性的扑克锦标赛版本。\r\n\r\n玩家们参加一场形式类似长期锦标赛的游戏, 并可以下注他们希望的任何物品。在游戏开始之前, 所有玩家必须对所下注的物品达成一致。随着游戏的进行, 盲注将逐步提升, 并且游戏将持续进行直到一名玩家赢得全部筹码。赢得游戏的玩家将保留所有被下注的物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::130291518",
      "Source": "A more casual version of Poker where players may come and go.\r\nPlayers may only buy-in with the table's pre-selected Item type. Each copy of that Item \"purchases\" chips from the table, which can be used to play. Blinds never increase, and players may come and go as they wish. When a player leaves the table, they exchange their chips for the table's pre-determined Item.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"较为休闲的扑克牌玩法, 玩家可以随意加入或离开。\r\n\r\n玩家只能使用桌上预选的物品类型进行买入。每个该物品的副本 \"购买\" 来自桌上的筹码, 这些筹码可以用来游戏。盲注不会增加, 玩家可以根据自己的意愿随意加入或离开。当玩家离开桌子时, 他们可以用自己的筹码交换桌上预先确定的物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
