    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1749251190",
      "Source": "   The left window contains your Items that can be skinned.\r\n   The right window contains your custom Cosmetics.\r\n\r\n   Selecting on an Item will filter your Cosmetics to only show the Cosmetics that can skin that Item.\r\n   Selecting on a Cosmetic will filter your Items to only show the Items that can be skinned by that Cosmetic.\r\n\r\n   Drag a Cosmetic onto an Item to skin that Item.\r\n\r\n   You can also filter either list using the dropdown menus at the bottom of their window.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"   左侧窗口包含允许装饰的物品。\r\n   右侧窗口包含你的个性化皮肤。\r\n\r\n   点击一个物品或一个个性装饰皮肤后, 将会根据选择进行筛选显示对应的皮肤或物品。\r\n\r\n   将一个个性装饰拖到一个物品上。\r\n\r\n   你还可以使用窗口底部的下拉菜单进行筛选。\r\n\r\n\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //个性装饰
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1120616753",
      "Source": "CUSTOM COSMETICS",
      "Trans": {"SC":"个性装饰","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //个性装饰
    },
