      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  你在那边画什么呢?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2739841243",
      "Source": "Meeka:  (groan)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  (不耐烦)","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1252089108",
      "Source": "Bob:  Hey, that’s not bad! And this is you over here, with this dumdum?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  嘿, 不赖嘛! 这就是你, 跟那个小蠢货吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::914863193",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Don’t be mean to Honker! And no, I don’t want to talk about HIM.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  别对 \"小喇叭\" 那么刻薄! 还有, 我不想谈起「他」。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3563011291",
      "Source": "Bob:  He’s your dad, Meeka.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  他是你爸爸, 咪卡。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3882885799",
      "Source": "Bob:  Now I may not know a lot, and I made plenty of my own mistakes back in my day, but I do know one thing.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  虽然我可能懂得也不多, 而且我自己在过去也可能也犯了不少错, 但是我无比确切地明白一件事。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::573863496",
      "Source": "Bob:  Family’s gotta stick together.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  一家人就要团结一心。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3411324966",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Well, why don’t YOU go tell him to not be such a... stinky dino-poo?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  哦, 那「你」为什么不去告诉他, 不要像个‘臭烘烘的恐龙便便’一样讨厌呢?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::37181434",
      "Source": "Bob:  That’s just not how it works, Meeka. Look, maybe ol’ Uncle Bob here can shed some light on the situation.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  事情不是你想的那样的, 咪卡。你看, 也许你的鲍勃叔叔可以给你解释一下情况。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2424706615",
      "Source": "Bob:  About why the big man... thinks the way he does.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  关于为什么这个大块头...会那样子考虑。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2646778611",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Wait -- you knew my dad before all this? So were you also on the, uh -- what’d he call them… the ‘ARKs’?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  等等 -- 你在这之前就已经认识我爸爸了? 所以你也曾在那个, 呃 -- 怎么说的来着...‘方舟’上面?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::761333300",
      "Source": "Bob:  Yeah, those.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  对, 是这样的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::667312190",
      "Source": "Bob:  Say… have I ever told you the story about how your dad and I saved everyone together?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  说起来...我有跟你讲过我和你爸爸是如何一同拯救所有人的故事吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::562750087",
      "Source": "Meeka:  You were there? YOU were one of the heroes?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  你当时也在场? 「你」也是那些英雄之一?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3262475431",
      "Source": "Bob:  Well, yeah... sure. In fact, you might say that I was the most important part of the whole story.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  额, 对...当然。事实上, 你甚至可以说我就是整个故事中最重要的一环。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1199923794",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Oookay.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  呵呵呵好的吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2422493423",
      "Source": "Bob:  Go ask Santiago yourself, if you don’t believe me.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  要是不相信我, 那你自己去问问圣地亚哥。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::11449582",
      "Source": "Meeka:  No! I want you to tell me... ‘Unka Bob’.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  不嘛! 我就要你讲给我听...‘鲍勃蜀黍’。","JA":""},
      //Unka小孩子的一种发音, 放到中文语境用了蜀黍代替了叔叔.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1968676041",
      "Source": "Bob:  All right then. Let’s start at the very beginning, on a faraway tropical island, surrounded by sparkling blue water.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  那好吧, 让我们从故事的最开头讲起, 在一个遥远的热带小岛上, 四周都是波光粼粼的蓝色海水。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::715599555",
      "Source": "Bob:  That island was the first time I ever saw big, dumb lizards like Honker here.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  在那座岛上我第一次见到又大, 又像 \"小喇叭\" 那样蠢的生物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3158061692",
      "Source": "Bob:  And it was the first place I ran into her...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  而且那也是我第一次遇见她的地方...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::252873138",
      "Source": "Meeka:  So after that Island, where’d you go next? Oh, I bet it was somewhere exciting!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  所以在离开那个岛之后, 你又去了哪儿? 呼~ 我敢打赌它一定是个令人兴奋的地方!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4276701030",
      "Source": "Bob:  (groan) Before we keep going, I was thinking maybe you wanna let your dad know where you ran off to?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  (叹息) 在我们继续之前, 我在想, 你是不是应该让你爸爸知道你要跑到哪里去?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3943857503",
      "Source": "Meeka:  I don’t want to think about him at all!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  我一点也不想提起他!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2888374817",
      "Source": "Meeka:  I want to hear more stories... 'Unka Bob'! ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  我想要听更多的故事...‘鲍勃蜀黍’! ","JA":""},
      //Unka小孩子的一种发音, 放到中文语境用了蜀黍代替了叔叔.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::822547702",
      "Source": "Bob:  Okay! Okay... How ‘bout a story with spurs and six shooters, and all that?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  好吧! 好吧...那么讲一个关于牛仔和神枪手的故事怎么样, 或者诸如此类的?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::888728956",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Yeah! That sounds wild.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  耶! 这听起来真刺激。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2095528722",
      "Source": "Bob:  Darlin’, you don’t know the half of it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  小宝贝, 你了解的只是冰山一角。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4292376455",
      "Source": "Bob:  But whatever the danger, Bob still managed to show the wild ‘n’ wooly wastelands who was boss.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  但无论有多危险, 你鲍勃叔叔仍然会想尽办法让这片不毛之地明白, 究竟谁才是主宰。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::298412341",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Whoa! Now we're talkin'!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  哇哦! 这才对嘛!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::232020445",
      "Source": "Bob:  Place was hotter’n heck, and all that danged dust had a way of workin’ its way up yer, uh -- nose.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  那地方比地狱还热, 而且那该死的尘土总有办法钻进你的, 呃 -- 鼻腔。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2595649711",
      "Source": "Bob:  Point is, I was gonna have to get lean & mean if I was fixin’ to tame anything in that forsaken desert!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  关键是, 如果我想驯服那片废土沙漠中的任何东西, 我就得变得精壮且强悍!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-序幕2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::295421052",
      "Source": "Bob:  Where was I? Oh yeah...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  说到哪来着? Oh对...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2471572460",
      "Source": "Bob:  Suddenly I found myself smack in the middle of this... scorching hot desert.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  忽然我发现自己正处于这个...酷热的沙漠之中。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1610555006",
      "Source": "Bob:  No time to worry over how I ended up there or why. All I knew was I had to run for cover.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  当时我已经无暇顾及是怎么到这来的了。唯一的念头就是赶紧找个地方避一避。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4170375692",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Umm, wasn’t it too hot to be running around?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  嗯.. 可东奔西跑不是太热了吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1121570100",
      "Source": "Bob:  Am I telling this story, or are you?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  是我在讲这个故事, 还是你在讲?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2898755318",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Sorry. Keep going!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  抱歉啦。你继续!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2166662602",
      "Source": "Bob:  Anyway, yeah -- it was too hot to run around like that. And I burnt myself out quick.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  确实是的, 那样到处跑实在是太热了。我很快就把自己累垮了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::586923205",
      "Source": "Bob:  I knew I was a goner, unless I could scrounge up something to drink, and pronto...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  我感觉自己快死了, 除非我能找到喝的东西, 而且要快...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1321368452",
      "Source": "Bob:  Now, before you judge me on this next part, you got to understand it was a life-or-death situation.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  在我讲后面的故事前, 先别急着打趣你鲍勃叔叔, 因为那时真的是生死攸关。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1871525552",
      "Source": "Bob:  ‘Cause when I thought I saw a big whiskey jug sloshing around on six legs, I sorta lost what was left of my pride.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  当我看到一个长着六条腿的大号威士忌酒壶在晃动时, 我几乎抛弃了那所谓的脸面。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::803451709",
      "Source": "Bob:  And I, uh -- well, there’s no good way to say this -- I took a drink from it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  然后我, 呃 -- 好吧, 没有更好听的说法了 -- 我抓着它就喝了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4089755169",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Ew, gross! (giggle)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  哕, 好恶心! (嘿嘿笑)","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::190898507",
      "Source": "Bob:  Made that jug-bug jump a mile, not that I blame it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  我这么一来, 那个壶虫吓得飘飞出去老远了, 这也不怪它被吓成那样。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3788117420",
      "Source": "Bob:  Who’d have guessed something that big could even fly anyway?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  谁会想到这么大的玩意居然还能飞呢?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::930950490",
      "Source": "Bob:  ‘Least I knew where to find water now.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  至少我现在知道在哪里可以找到水了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2628921729",
      "Source": "Bob:  After I had my fill of drinking from bug behinds, I decided to try for one of the camel-lizards I saw waddling around that sandpit.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  在从虫子的屁股补充水分后, 我决定试着去捕捉在那沙坑里摇摇摆摆长的像骆驼一样的动物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3587033059",
      "Source": "Bob:  Was probably an easier way to break the dumb beasts than smacking ‘em upside the head and force-feeding ‘em...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  也许有更简单的方法来驯服这些愚蠢的野兽, 而不是敲它们的脑袋并强行给它们喂吃的...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3169615996",
      "Source": "Bob:  ...but that’s what worked for me back on The Island.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  ...然而这是我在那座岛上时, 最有效的方法。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3843963562",
      "Source": "Bob:  Anyways, I guess I finally hit one on its noggin enough times for it to think we were pals.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  总之, 我想它的脑袋应该已经被我敲了好多次, 以至于它认为我们已经是朋友了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::215241014",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Awww…",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Awww...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::482139915",
      "Source": "Bob:  Reckon I’ll spare you knowing how I figured out a way of drinking from those smelly humps.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  我想还是不要告诉你, 我是怎么从那发臭的驼峰里取水的吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1698343725",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Ugh, nasty!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  呃啊, 恶心!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3060961111",
      "Source": "Bob:  Without warning, a sandstorm kicked up. I’m talking howling wind, lightning.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  突然间, 毫无预兆地刮起了一场沙尘暴。我说的是那种狂风呼啸又电闪雷鸣的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2996693214",
      "Source": "Bob:  Had me going in circles, trying like heck to find a place to hide.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  这让我晕头转向, 我拼命地想找个地方躲起来。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::384190712",
      "Source": "Bob:  Thought I was done for when Humpty dropped dead on me...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  当 “胖皮皮” 突然倒在我身旁的时候, 我以为自己要完蛋了...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3648962111",
      "Source": "Bob:  ...until I spotted a cave that looked like the Promised Land.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  ...直到我发现了一个看起来像 “应许之地” 一样的洞穴。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2357058086",
      "Source": "Meeka:  (sigh) Poor Humpty.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  (叹气) 可怜的 “胖皮皮”。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2622373807",
      "Source": "Bob:  I tripped over a bunch of eggs lying around inside, and thought I’d hit the jackpot.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  我被散落在里边的一些蛋给绊倒了, 然后心想我中大奖了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1161012909",
      "Source": "Bob:  And that’s when Momma -- an honest-to-gosh dragon -- turned up.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  就在那时 -- 它们的妈妈出现了-- 一条真正的龙。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::19157303",
      "Source": "Meeka:  (gasp) Oh no!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  (惊讶) Oh 不!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3453255110",
      "Source": "Bob:  She was none too happy about me scrambling up her babies.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  她对我惊扰了她的孩子们一点也不感到高兴。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1343801664",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Betcha barely got out of that one without becomin’ her breakfast.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  我敢打赌逃离成为她早餐的命运一定很艰难。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::317536790",
      "Source": "Meeka:  No scrambled Bob on the menu that day!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  好在那天的菜单上没有鲍勃这道菜!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3450325500",
      "Source": "Bob:  Right about when I’d almost given up hope, I spotted Little Miss Professor again...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  就在我几乎要放弃希望的时候, 我又看到了那位年轻的教授小姐...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::858344037",
      "Source": "Bob:  Somehow she’d wound up in that dustpatch with me, which probably meant that the Doc was around someplace too.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  不知怎么的, 她也和我一样被困在了那个尘土飞扬的地方, 这意味着博士也很有可能也在附近某个地方。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1566906008",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Bet she was glad to see you!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  她看到你一定很高兴!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1776813442",
      "Source": "Bob:  Of course, yeah. But now I had someone else to look after, which can be -- you know... exhausting.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  是的, 当然。但现在我还得照顾另一个人, 你知道的 -- 这可能会是...令人精疲力尽的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1154032586",
      "Source": "Bob:  But before I could come up with a plan to save us, this crazy desert witch showed up with... a dragon!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  但在我想出一个拯救我们的办法之前, 这个奇怪的沙漠巫女出现了, 还带着...一条飞龙!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2945448167",
      "Source": "Bob:  That dragon-witch sure seemed glad I came along when I did...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  那骑飞龙的巫女好像对我的出现感到非常高兴...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-6
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3515384117",
      "Source": "Bob:  Turned out her town needed a new sheriff, on account of the giant bugs that kept attacking the place.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  原来她的小镇因为不断遭受巨型虫子的袭击, 现在急需一位新的治安官。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-6
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1347324524",
      "Source": "Meeka:  What’s a ‘sheriff’?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  什么是 ‘治安官’?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-6
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4111697220",
      "Source": "Bob:  Someone who’d protect regular townsfolk, whether it was from rustlers, bandits, or -- in this case -- bug-monsters.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  所谓的治安官就是, 保护小镇免受偷牛贼、土匪的侵扰, 以及像这次一样 -- 抵御巨型虫子的袭击, 维护小镇安宁的人。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-6
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::796674273",
      "Source": "Bob:  I didn’t have much of a choice, so I let the Witch pin a star on me and set me up with a trusty six-shooter.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  我别无选择, 所以当时就让巫女给我别上一枚星章, 并配了一把靠谱的左轮枪。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-6
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2672333666",
      "Source": "Bob:  Now that I was the law in that forsaken outpost, I could see I was gonna have to do a bit of pest control.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  既然都成了那个荒凉前哨的治安官, 看来我这次得来个除害行动了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3992177868",
      "Source": "Bob:  So I called out the biggest bug, and told him they’d best skedaddle before sundown, lest I commence to stepping on ‘em.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  所以我叫出了那个最大的虫子, 并告诉它最好在日落前赶紧离开, 否则我就不客气了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2181789325",
      "Source": "Bob:  Now that I had the whole gang’s attention, I backed up a few paces and told the gangleader to slap leather.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  既然我吸引了它们的注意, 于是我便后退了几步, 告诉它们的头儿 -- 准备拔枪。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3422949753",
      "Source": "Meeka:  To do what...?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  是要做什么呀...?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1504519051",
      "Source": "Bob:  Figure of speech, darlin’. Means we were about to have us a good, old-fashioned shootout!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  这只是一种比喻说法, 小宝贝。意味着我们即将进行一场经典的老式枪战对决!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2294938389",
      "Source": "Bob:  Big Bug Bandit reached for his pistol, but I had the quicker draw.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  大虫子强盗伸手准备去拔它的枪, 但我比它更快。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3136412820",
      "Source": "Bob:  A couple of his compadres tried to take revenge. Wasn’t much of a fair fight.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  它的几个同伙试图报仇。但这真的是螳臂挡枪。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3172496610",
      "Source": "Bob:  None of ‘em so much as got a bead on me before I’d dropped all four of 'em in the dust with their pal.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  在我将它们四个连同它们的同伙一起打倒之前, 它们甚至都没一个能够瞄准我的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3117194885",
      "Source": "Bob:  The rest of ‘em scampered off, so I yelled to the ladies that it was safe to come out.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  其余的家伙都落荒而逃了, 所以我向女士们大喊, 现在可以安心出来了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1110675774",
      "Source": "Bob:  That’s when ol’ Doc Rockwell showed up again.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  就在那时, 罗克韦尔博士再次出现了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1168101736",
      "Source": "Bob:  After I stopped the bugs from ransacking that whistlestop, I guess I thought maybe...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  在我阻止了那些虫子袭击小镇之后, 我想也许...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::467244632",
      "Source": "Bob:  ...I’d found a place worth building up into something.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  ...我找到了一个值得投入建设的地方。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2776702648",
      "Source": "Bob:  That’s when the Witch piped up, to tell us it why it wasn’t worth getting attached to no place there.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  可就在那时, 巫女突然开口, 说那地方不值得我们留恋。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1554472921",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Oh no, why?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Oh 不, 为什么?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1405198490",
      "Source": "Bob:  Said she and her friends had a regular boomtown going across the desert, that got blown to heck by...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  她说她和她的朋友们在沙漠对面曾有一个繁荣的新兴城镇, 但是已经沦为废墟了...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::457784444",
      "Source": "Bob:  ...something in the sky.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  ...被天上的某种东西摧毁的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2085936030",
      "Source": "Bob:  She offered to fly us to see the ruins for ourselves. Not sure why I let the Professor and the Doc talk me into that.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  她提出带我们飞过去亲眼看看那些废墟。我也不确定为什么就让教授和博士说服我同意了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::188534300",
      "Source": "Bob:  After seeing them ruins up close for myself, we decided it probably was time for us to mosey along.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  在亲眼见识过那些废墟后, 我们决定是时候继续我们的旅程了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::980503557",
      "Source": "Bob:  We were saying our goodbyes when that thing dropped in.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  就我们正要离开时, 那东西突然降临了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4238526740",
      "Source": "Bob:  The Witch called it a ‘manti-corn’ -- or maybe a manti-clops?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  巫女称它为 “狮身星尾兽” -- 或者可能是 狮身尖尾兽?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3931637495",
      "Source": "Bob:  Anyway, whatever you wanna call it, it caused a real ruckus.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  管它呢, 随便叫什么都一样, 反正它都已经造成了很大的骚动。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3941246054",
      "Source": "Bob:  I like to think we made it sorry for messing with us.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  我觉得我们得让它知道, 跟我们作对, 它是惹错对象了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::750004312",
      "Source": "Bob:  But I must've been knocked upside the head during our tussle, 'cause I don't remember the next part so good.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  然而我想一定是在打斗的过程中我被击中了头部, 因为后面的事情我记不太清了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1287725477",
      "Source": "Bob:  Somehow I was tumbling through the sky again, heading elsewhere in a hurry...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  不知怎么的, 我再次冲破天际, 急速前往另一个地方...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1121973655",
      "Source": "Bob:  So there I was -- whizzing through the sky -- when this sparkly lady flies right up alongside me...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  就在那时 -- 我嗖地一下飞过天空 -- 此时这位闪闪发光的女士正好飞到我旁边...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1530568634",
      "Source": "Bob:  And she tells me, “Bob, you’re the greatest guy ever! You have to stay alive, so you can save everyone!\"",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  然后她跟我说, “鲍勃, 你是有史以来最棒的! 你需要活下去, 这样你才能拯救每一个人!”","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2026917310",
      "Source": "Meeka:  How were you supposed to save a whole world, all by yourself?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  那你是怎么拯救全世界的呢? 只靠你一个人?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1732496414",
      "Source": "Bob:  Well now, I did have a little help from my friends.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  好吧, 确实我得到了朋友们的些许帮助。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4201271185",
      "Source": "Bob:  Little Miss Professor here... and the Doc.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  这位年轻的教授小姐...还有博士。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3851837135",
      "Source": "Bob:  But maybe that’s a story for another time. I mean you got to have some chores to get back to--",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  这故事就讲到这吧。我的意思是, 你得回去做点家务了--","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2108400207",
      "Source": "Meeka:  I already did them, I swear!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  我早就做完了, 我发誓!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2226128547",
      "Source": "Bob:  Great. Guess I’ll just, uh -- keep retelling these true tales about Bob’s amazing adventures...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  很好, 我想我又得, 呃 -- 继续讲述关于鲍勃奇妙的冒险经历了...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4222831706",
      "Source": "Bob:  (sigh)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  (叹气) ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2712213419",
      "Source": "Bob:  So that’s how I went from squeezing water from a cactus to fighting a manti-whatzit in a ghost town.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  所以我就是这样子一步步地从挤仙人掌取水, 再到废墟跟一只狮身什么鬼的搏斗。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::350326794",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Wicked...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  酷毙了~","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3221851775",
      "Source": "Bob:  Just goes to show -- you gotta stay ready for the unexpected...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  这正好说明 -- 你得随时准备应对意外情况...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4164041452",
      "Source": "Bob:  ...and you'll always need to stick by the folks who have your back.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  ...而且你总是需要跟你的支持者们站在同一战线。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2527688201",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Didn't you say you “tamed them wastes all by your lonesome?”",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  你不是说 “不费吹灰之力就独自驯服它们” 吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2943967934",
      "Source": "Bob:  Well, I had SOME help.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  好吧, 我是得到过「一些」帮助。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::243973060",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Oh yeah. You still haven't told me where you met, you know... him.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  哦, 对了。你还没告诉我你们是在哪里遇见的呢, 你知道...我说的是他。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1157656235",
      "Source": "Bob:  Aw... wouldn’t you rather hear that story from the big guy himself?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  啊...难道你就不想从大块头本人那边听他讲这个故事吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3095414657",
      "Source": "Meeka:  No way! Unlike you, he’s got NO sense of humor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  才不要呢! 哪像你呀, 他一点幽默感都没有。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::739137105",
      "Source": "Bob:  (groan)... You just sit tight while your Unka Bob thinks about how to tell the next part without giving nightmares.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  (无奈)...你先座好, 你的鲍勃蜀黍在思考怎么讲下一段故事才不会做噩梦。","JA":""},
      //Unka小孩子的一种发音, 放到中文语境用了蜀黍代替了叔叔.
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3926582213",
      "Source": "Meeka:  But I like scary stories!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  但是我喜欢听恐怖故事!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3199827534",
      "Source": "Bob:  Hey now, I was talking about it giving ME nightmares.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  嘿, 我是说它可能会让「我」做噩梦。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4098098843",
      "Source": "Bob:  See, this is the point in our story where things get dark… real dark.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  看, 这就是让故事变得黑暗的地方...相当黑暗。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::742006523",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Awesome!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  好棒!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-废土-尾声2
    },
