    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::310388277",
      "Source": "Clean off the Leeches with a sickle while the Shastasaurus socializes with your Ichthyosaurus!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在沙斯塔龙与你的鱼龙交际时, 使用镰刀清除它身上的水蛭!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4104233735",
      "Source": "Common Name: Ceratosaurus \nSpecies: Ceratosaurus Punctura \nTime: Late Jurassic \nDiet: Carnivore \nTermperament: Extremely Aggressive \n\nWhile I'm surprised I haven't encountered them sooner, I'd rather them just vanish all-together. Ceratosaurus is as rughtless as they are quick. While not the most damaging carnivores you'll encounter, they are certainly some of the most persistent. I've seen these creatures even exhibit a sort of ... stalking behavior unlike anything else I've seen on The Island. While they may not make themselves known to you immediately, they certainly know where YOU are! \n\nThe spines on Ceratosaurus have a very unique and powerful trait: Venom! This hemotoxin has the bizarre reaction with blood, making it incredibly nutritious to carnivores. The more intense the venom infection, the more beneficial the blood becomes. I've witnessed tribes that have managed to tame these beasts use it to great effect against larger threats, and even The Islands guardians! Perhaps this desire to devour envenomed prey can be used against them...?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 角鼻龙\r\n拉丁学名: Ceratosaurus Punctura\r\n正式名称: 穿刺角鼻龙\r\n时代: 晚侏罗世\r\n食性: 肉食\r\n性情: 极度好战\r\n\r\n\r\n虽然今天才知道这种动物的存在确实令人讶异, 但我更真切希望它们全部绝迹。凶暴而迅猛的穿刺角鼻龙 (Ceratosaurus punctura) 未必是最具破坏性的肉食动物, 但一定是其中最难缠的。\r\n我注意到这些动物甚至表现出某种独特的潜行能力...这与我所知的任何孤岛物种都不同。也就是说多数时候它们不会在明处立即现身, 但相信我, 就在某些你不曾察觉的暗处, 它们早已对你洞若观火!\r\n在角鼻龙的密集尖刺中具有一种独特而强力的特性: 毒液! 这种溶血毒素可与血液产生一种微妙的反应, 能使食肉动物被难以理解地滋养。毒液作用越强烈, 血液增益效果就越强。\r\n我曾亲眼目睹成功驯化这些野兽的部落将它们投入威胁更大的战场, 甚至用于击溃孤岛的守护者。也许这种企图吞噬受毒害猎物的欲望能够反制它们...?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2777881703",
      "Source": "Common Name: Xiphactinus \r\nSpecies: Xiphactinus Velox \r\nTime: Late Cretaceous \r\nDiet: Carnivore \r\nTemperament: Frenzied \r\n\r\nWild \r\nXiphactinus Velox is a frighteningly fast creature, lurking in The Islands' oceans. Most often appearing in groups, Xiphactinus can quickly overwhelm its' victims. They have been observed to grab smaller prety in their terrifying jaws and thrash wildly to deplete their engergy. When subdued, they will proceed to swallow the prey whole, something I have witnessed befall many unfortunate survivors. Beware Xiphactinus that have recently fed, as they will become frenzied from the clouds of blood they've created. For targets too large to be swallowed by its horrific maw, Xiphactinus will briefly grab their target and proceed to tear off a chunk of flesh, causing the target to begin bleeding out. On several occassions, I've noticed Xiphactinus will attack other ocean species such as Megalodon, and even larger threats such as Mosasaur! Be glad that you're not their only target!\r\n\r\nTamed\r\nXiphactinus make for excellent mounts for exploring the ARK's vast ocean environments. Their powerful jaws can be utilized to grab smaller prey, while leaving a nasty bleeding wound on larger opponents. With good manueverability and a violent nature, any tribes partaking in sea-warfare will be sure to have a shoal of these \"Dire Tuna\".",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 剑射鱼\r\n拉丁学名: Xiphactinus Velox\r\n正式名称: 迅猛剑射鱼\r\n时代: 晚白垩世\r\n食性: 肉食\r\n性情: 狂热\r\n\r\n\r\n穿梭孤岛各大海域的迅猛剑射鱼 (Xiphactinus velox) 是一种速度惊人的鱼类。剑射鱼在绝大多数时候都是集群出现, 并且迅速击溃其受害者。人们观察到它们用强劲的颌骨死锁较小的猎物, 并快速猛烈地噬咬以消耗其体力, 随后便是整个吞下。我曾目睹多数不幸的生存者因此葬身鱼口。\r\n一定留意最近进食的剑射鱼, 它们会因自己杀戮而营造的腥云血雾逐渐狂热! 即使是大到不能整个吞下的目标, 也会被剑射鱼猛烈撕扯下大块血肉, 出血不止。值得高兴的是, 你不是它们无差别攻击的唯一目标。有几次我注意到剑射鱼还会攻击其它海洋物种, 例如巨齿鲨, 甚至更大的沧龙也不能免遭殃及!\r\n剑射鱼是探索方舟广袤海域的不二之选, 强大的颌骨可以锁死较小的猎物, 创伤较大的目标并使其血涌不止。生性凶暴且机动性强, 这使得任何海权部落都有一群 “迅猛金枪鱼” 蓄势待发。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
