    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2927623371",
      "Source": "Running Speed: ",
      //角鼻龙
      "Trans": {"SC":"奔跑速度: ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4255304429",
      "Source": "Species: Ignis leoforma\r\nTime: Unknown\r\nDiet: Carnivore\r\nTemperament: Aggressive\r\n\r\nWild\r\nIs Pyromane a cat that controls fire, or living fire that can make itself look like a cat? It does seem to have more in common with the Phoenix from that desert ARK than any lion. An author named Clarke said sufficiently advanced technology would be indistinguishable from magic… I’d say that whatever engineered this creature was plenty advanced.\r\n\r\n\r\nAn unruffled Pyromane will stay at a low burn and shrink its profile. But when provoked, that small cat can suddenly flare itself up into a lion-sized inferno. It seems to drink in any nearby fire, using that power to cauterize its own wounds and power up its arsenal of incendiary attacks.\r\n\r\nDomesticated\r\nI've only seen one tame Pyromane so far. Its rider seemed unbothered by the beast’s flames, and beyond that immune to heat in general while mounted. She claimed it could even carry her safely across a lava field. That Survivor said she spent ages trying to win her cat over, before noticing it seemed more sluggish in the rain.\r\n\r\n\r\nIn its smaller form, her pet doubled as a shoulder-mounted, feline flamethrower. And back at their campsite, she showed me how her pet could fuel a forge and dry meat into jerky. I can definitely see why such an improbable but versatile creature might have been engineered, even if I don’t understand how.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 炽炎猫\r\n拉丁学名: Ignis leoforma\r\n正式名称: 狮形炽炎猫\r\n时代: 未知\r\n食性: 肉食\r\n性情: 好战\r\n\r\n\r\n野生\r\n狮形炽炎猫究竟是一种能够控制火焰的猫, 还是一团拟态成猫的生命之火? 因为相比较已知的狮子, 它似乎与方舟荒漠中栖息的凤凰共享着更多特征。一位名叫克拉克 (Clarke) 的作家曾言: 足够进步的科技与魔法没有明确的界限...因此我不得不承认, 不管是什么东西, 这种生物的造物主一定掌握着十分先进水平。\r\n尽管常态稳定的炽炎猫时刻保持着较低的燃值以及娇小的身形, 而一旦将这只小猫激怒, 你会突然感受到它爆发出狮子般的怒焰。它平日饮火解渴, 受伤时能够借助火焰的能量缓解伤痛, 并为其侵略性的火库进行充能。\r\n\r\n\r\n家养\r\n我迄今为止只见过一只驯化的炽炎猫, 它的骑手似乎不受其炽炎的影响, 可以安然无恙地骑乘其上。她甚至称自己曾骑乘炽炎猫安然穿越熔岩区域。而她还说自己曾花费大量精力取信于“猫”, 直到她发现炽炎猫在雨中会十分懈怠。\r\n而当转变为娇小形态时, 炽炎猫在她的肩上还可以兼任火焰喷射器一职。到达他们的营地之后, 她还向我展示了她的宠物为熔炉填充燃料, 并将肉迅速制成肉干。我完全理解为什么会有这样一种令人无与伦比且全才全能的生物被制造出来, 尽管我根本不明白其中的原理。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2441929722",
      "Source": "Species: Shastasaurus carmentellum\r\nTime: Late Triassic\r\nDiet: Carnivore\r\nTemperament: Curious\r\n\r\nWild\r\nThis odd variant of Shastasaurus seems as curious about humans as its distant relative Ichthyosaur. It sure got my attention when one of these sea monsters swam up to have a look at me! Luckily, its bulk turns out to be worse than its bite.\r\n\r\n\r\nShastasaurus has weaponized the ultrasonic chirps it uses for echolocation. It can focus those sounds into a tight cone that disorients prey, or widen the effect to blast apart a school of fish in a concussive wave.\r\n\r\nDomesticated\r\nTaming a Shastasaurus was one of the most rewarding experiences of my life. I brought along some Ichthyosaur pals to entertain their larger cousin while I used a sickle to clear away some of its troublesome parasites. From then on, I had a gigantic escort in deep water.\r\n\r\n\r\nSome tribes manage to kit out their finny friend with a periscope, torpedo bays, and even a cargo hold… Those Shastasaurs end up looking like something from the old kids’ cartoon with cavemen who turned dinos into cars and submarines!\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 沙斯塔鱼龙\r\n拉丁学名: Shastasaurus carmentellum\r\n正式名称: 歌武沙斯塔鱼龙\r\n时代: 晚三叠世\r\n食性: 肉食\r\n性情: 好奇\r\n\r\n野生\r\n这种奇特的沙斯塔龙变种似乎和它的远亲鱼龙一样对人类充满好奇。\r\n当这群海怪中的一只朝我上浮, 并看向我时, 它便引起了我的注意! 幸好, 它硕大的体形远比它的噬咬更吓人。\r\n沙斯塔鱼龙已经能够将用于回声定位的超声波噪音用作武器, 当它们将声音聚焦为紧密的锥形便能使猎物丧失方向感, 而将其效果扩大为震荡波, 则可以震散鱼群。\r\n\r\n家养\r\n驯化一头沙斯塔鱼龙是我这一生收益最高的经历之一。我只是带着一支鱼龙小队来取悦它们的巨型远亲, 同时还使用镰刀刮去了令他瘙痒的寄生虫。之后, 一支庞大的深水舰队便从属我的调遣了。\r\n一些部落设法为这些大鳍的家伙装配有潜望镜、鱼雷舱, 甚至还有货舱...最后, 整只沙斯塔鱼龙看上去就像是被改造成了一艘潜艇...就像过去少年漫画中, 那些把恐龙改造成交通工具的穴居人一样!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
