    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1238637003",
      "Source": "Deinosuchus",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恐鳄","JA":"恐鱷"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":true,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1839555793",
      "Source": "Common Name: Deinosuchus\r\nSpecies: Deinosuchus Sanguineus \r\nTime: Late Cretaceous \r\nDiet: Carnivore \r\nTemperament: Aggressive \r\n\r\nI believed Sarcosuchus was the largest crocodilian on The Island, until I encountered Deinosuchus. Massive and bulky, this specimen seems to actually be a mix of its' namesake, and a similar species known as Purussaurus. \r\n\r\nDeionosuchus sport huge and powerful jaws, wich they utilize to break the bones of their prey, and halt their escape. Attempting to escape while suffering the effects of their bite can lead to your demise. This coupled with their incredibly tough hide can make disposing of Deinosuchus a difficult and dangerous task.\r\n\r\nWhen tamed, Deinosuchus can make quick work of many creatures, both land and water. Most creatures seem to lack the intelligence to halt their movement when suffering the desctructive effects of a Deinosuchus bite, and this ultimately costs them their life. Any tribe in control of a  Deinosuchus packs a dangerous punch... or in this case... bite!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 恐鳄\r\n拉丁学名: Deinosuchus Sanguineus\r\n正式名称: 饮血恐鳄\r\n时代: 晚白垩世\r\n食性: 肉食\r\n性情: 好战\r\n\r\n我曾以为肌鳄是孤岛上最大的鳄类, 直至我遇见了恐鳄。这只样本庞大且笨重, 它看起来实际是由恐鳄的同名属跟另一种较为相似的鳄类 -- 普鲁斯鳄, 混合而成的产物。\r\n恐鳄拥有强壮而巨大的双颚, 可轻易粉碎猎物的骨骼并防止它们逃脱。在遭受它们的咬击后试图逃跑可能会加速你的死亡。再加上它们坚韧的鳞甲, 使得处理恐鳄变得相当棘手。\r\n一旦被驯服, 恐鳄能够迅速应对众多陆地或水生的动物。大多数动物似乎缺乏在遭受恐鳄毁灭性咬合时停止移动的理智, 这成为葬送它们的关键。任何成功掌握恐鳄军团的部落, 就掌握着一股致命的势力...或者说, 威慑力!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2988383844",
