    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3227748336",
      "Source": "Hop on a equus, and get ready for a train heist! You're the charismatic villain in this mission--so get ready to hop on the train, take control, and ride it back to your hideout.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"骑上马, 准备好抢火车! 你是这次任务中最具魅力的反派角色 -- 所以准备好跳上火车, 控制局面, 然后把它开回你的藏身之处。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4141060648",
      "Source": "The ovis have escaped their pens! Use your trusty lasso from the back of an equus, wrangle up the lost ovis, and return them to their pens. But make sure to avoid the wild rams that want the ovis for themselves.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"羊群逃出围栏了! 用庞马鞍的可靠套索, 把逃跑的母羊捆起来, 并把它们放回围栏里。野生公羊想把母羊据为己有, 一定要小心野生公羊的冲撞。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3599828028",
      "Source": "Some varmint planted a bunch of Dodos with dynamite! Shoot them out of their holes to get points (but don't get blown up). Achatina will heal you, but shooting poop will lose points.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"有些坏人放了一堆带有炸药的渡渡鸟! 把他们从洞里射出来以获得积分 (但不要被炸死)。玛瑙螺可以治愈你, 射击便便堆会让你掉分。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
