      //生物特性
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2800976125",
      "Source": " seconds after dismounting\r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":" 秒的持续时间\r\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //生物特性
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::954830095",
      "Source": "- Outgoing damage against Creatures with DragWeight ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"- 拖拽重量为 ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //生物特性
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::26741040",
      "Source": "\r\n- Outgoing damage against Creatures with DragWeight ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"\r\n- 拖拽重量为 ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //生物特性
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1388511409",
      "Source": " or lower is decreased by ",
      "Trans": {"SC":" 或是低于该数值的生物, 对该生物造成的伤害减少 ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //生物特性
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2596642509",
      "Source": " or higher is increased by ",
      "Trans": {"SC":" 或是高于该数值的生物, 对该生物造成的伤害增加 ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //生物特性
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3517352710",
      "Source": "- Torpor drain rate increased by ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"- 眩晕值消退比正常情况快 ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //生物特性
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1604040513",
      "Source": "Species: Yi Ling\r\nTime: Late Jurassic\r\nDiet: Omnivore\r\nTemperament: Aloof\r\n\r\nWild\r\nThis feathered fella is so much bigger than the Yi species I knew in my day! Despite its aberrant size, Yi ling is still somehow light enough to cling to walls and it can even glide short distances. It’s light on its feet as well, able to dodge attacks on the run.\r\nI’m glad Yi seems to prefer prey smaller than itself, because it can eject a spray of barbed feathers at an unhappy target before darting in to rip them back out. Its unique firepower may expose Yi in the short term, but its protective plumage regrows fast.\r\n\r\n\r\nDomesticated\r\nA tamed Yi makes for an excellent -- if precarious -- hunting mount. Some tribes use them as caravan scouts, others to torment enemy forces.\r\nI’ve seen Yi scarf up the weird mushrooms, congealed gas balls, and nameless creatures scurrying around down here. Who knows what effect a diet like that would have on its feathery weaponry? Watch what your Yi eats, and you just might learn to sharpen its fighting skills!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 翎翼龙\r\n拉丁学名: Yi Ling\r\n正式名称: 翎翼龙\r\n时代: 侏罗纪晚期\r\n食性: 杂食\r\n性情: 漠视\r\n\r\n\r\n野生\r\n这个长着羽毛的家伙明显比我在自己的时代了解的翼属物种都要大得多! 尽管翎翼龙体型异常地大, 但它仍然相当轻盈, 能够抓紧岩壁表面, 甚至还可以短距离滑翔。它的双脚也非常轻盈, 能够在奔跑中躲避敌袭。\r\n值得庆幸的是, 翎翼龙似乎更喜欢小于自身的猎物, 因为它可以向任何它不满意的目标喷射一簇倒钩状的翎羽, 随后冲上去拽出翎羽。虽然这种独特的攻击方式会在短期内将翎翼龙暴露, 但是这些保护性的羽毛很快就会再生。\r\n\r\n\r\n家养\r\n一只驯化的翎翼龙可以成为优秀, 但定位并不单一的狩猎坐骑。有些部落用于探险侦查, 还有一些则用于袭扰敌军。\r\n我见过的翎翼龙食谱涵盖了怪异菌类、凝固的球形气体以及那些杀之不绝的无名生物。目前尚不清楚这些独特的饮食组成会对其武器性质的翎羽有何影响, 不过, 观察你的翎翼龙吃什么可能有利于提高它们的战斗技巧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2873894402",
      "Source": "Species: Cosmophasis luxtextor\r\nTime: Neogene\r\nDiet: Carnivore\r\nTemperament: Skittish\r\n\r\nWild\r\nI’ve found just the friend to get you through these low places, but you’re going to need to keep an open mind. Though I guess anyone that’s made it this far shouldn’t be afraid of an itsy bitsy jumping spider. Not to mention that there's more to this shy little charmer than meets the eyes (all eight of ‘em)…\r\nWith all the horrors crawling around down here, it’s easy to see why any spider might be a bit jumpy. And why it might have needed a clever new trick of its own to keep the shadows at bay.\r\nCosmophasis seems to know when predators can be chased away by its glowing webbing.That same danger-sense tells the spider to turn out the light when something comes seeking it.\r\n\r\nDomesticated\r\nIt’s never easy to win someone over who’s had to hide their light away in dark times. But once you do, you’ll have a “ride or die” angel on your shoulder. Gain this spider’s trust, and Cosmophasis will help you out of sticky situations and put its life in your hands for the toughest fights ahead. And I mean that literally!\r\nYour fuzzy new friend can gobble up the webbing of larger spiders to recycle as ammunition. Then you can use it as a handheld web-shooter to slow down incoming enemies, snatch up items from the ground, and swing around like a spider-themed superhero! \r\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 宇跳蛛\r\n拉丁学名: Cosmophasis Luxtextor\r\n正式名称: 织光宇跳蛛\r\n时代: 新近纪\r\n食性: 肉食\r\n性情: 易受惊\r\n\r\n\r\n野生\r\n我发现了一只能够帮你度过低谷期的小伙伴, 但你得保持开放的心态。不过我想, 任何走到这一步的人应该都不会因为一只小巧玲珑的跳蛛而感到害怕。更不用说, 这个害羞的小可爱看起来还不简单(它有八只眼睛呢)...\r\n在这片爬满恐怖事物的地方, 很容易能够理解为什么任意一只蜘蛛都会有些神经兮兮的, 以及为什么它或许需要一个机敏的新技巧来驱散阴影。\r\n织光宇跳蛛似乎知道什么时候可以用它会发光的网来驱赶捕食者。与之相似的威胁感知则告诉小蜘蛛一旦有什么东西追寻它时需要关掉灯光。\r\n\r\n\r\n家养\r\n想要拉拢在黑暗之际隐藏光芒的对象并不容易, 可一旦你做到了, 你将拥有一个“生死与共”的守护天使。在你最需要帮助的时候织光宇跳蛛会帮助你脱离困境, 甚至在最艰难的战斗中愿意将生命托付于你, 我说的可是真的!\r\n这个毛茸茸的小家伙能够吞食大型蜘蛛的蛛丝作为弹药以循环利用。你可以将它作为一个手持的蛛网发射器为追击而来的敌人减速以及向地面抓取物品, 还可以利用它像一个蜘蛛主题的超级英雄一样四处摆荡!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3586986707",
      "Source": "Common name:\r\nRoll Rat\r\nSpecies: Heterocephalus Magnus\r\nTime: Holocene\r\nDiet: Herbivore\r\nTemperament: Passive\r\n\r\nWild\r\nBearing a strong resemblance to its relative, the naked mole rat, Heterocephalus magnus is a gentle giant that digs for plants and fungi with its imposing front teeth. While foraging, it often uncovers precious resources inadvertently, but survivors should claim them with caution, as this triggers an aggressive response.\r\n\r\nWhen threatened, Heterocephalus rolls up into a ball to shield itself with the armored plates on its back, much like an armadillo. It then rolls around like an oversized bowling ball, smashing through rocks, walls and hopefully its aggressor.\r\n\r\nDomesticated\r\nWhile hardly a ferocious war beast, Heterocephalus is an effective transport that can carry up to three passengers. In theory, it could also be siege weapon, as its rolling attack can dent even metal. Fortunately, most survivors use a special saddle that deploys a protective canopy when it starts spinning, which not only keeps them from getting squished, but provides extra protection to rider and mount alike.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 翻滚鼠\r\n拉丁学名: Heterocephalus Magnus\r\n正式名称: Heterocephalus Magnus\r\n时代: 全新世\r\n食性: 植食\r\n性情: 温顺\r\n\r\n\r\n野生\r\n与它的亲戚裸鼹鼠有很多相似的地方, 翻滚巨裸鼹鼠是一个用其巨大的门齿挖掘植物和真菌的泥足巨人。在觅食的过程中, 它们经常无意发现珍贵的资源, 但是生存者们应当慎重, 否则会引起它的攻击性反应。\r\n当受到威胁, 翻滚巨裸鼹鼠会蜷成一个巨球, 利用背上的装甲板保护自己, 就像犰狳那样。之后他会像一个保龄球一样到处滚动, 贯穿岩石, 墙壁, 以及对它不怀好意的掠食者。\r\n\r\n\r\n家养\r\n虽然不是凶猛的战兽, 翻滚巨裸鼹鼠仍然是一个高效的交通工具, 它能一次携带三个乘客。理论上它可以成为一个攻城利器, 它的滚球攻击甚至可以造成金属的凹陷。\r\n而幸运的是, 大部分生存者会制作一个特殊的鞍, 当翻滚巨裸鼹鼠开始滚动攻击时, 上面安装的保护罩会保护骑手不会被碾压, 并且还为骑手坐骑都提供了额外的保护。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::420437912",
      "Source": "Rider Protection",
      //生物特性-BuffName
      "Trans": {"SC":"骑手保护","JA":"騎手保護"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::136782629",
      "Source": "Reduced damage during and after riding",
      "Trans": {"SC":"减少在骑乘期间及在脱离骑乘后受到的伤害","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3406759098",
