    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1230938169",
      "Source": "\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 1, 1\">All Explorer Notes found +10 Max Levels</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"\\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 1, 1\">所有探险者笔记已找到 +10 最高等级上限</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3780230035",
      "Source": "Bob:  Maybe it’s a good thing, you drawing all the crazy mischief I got up to in the old days.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  或许是件好事, 你把我曾经的那些不好的事情都画了出来。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::190846452",
      "Source": "Bob:  Might help me remember things better next time some kid starts hanging around me like a bad smell...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  这应该会让我好好地长个记性, 尤其是当有小孩像苍蝇一样围着我转个不停...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::805110743",
      "Source": "Bob:  Pestering me for my dumb tales...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  缠着我要听那些无聊的故事的时候...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3158017137",
      "Source": "Meeka:  I’m just visiting with Honker here.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  我只是在这和 \"小喇叭\" 聊天而已。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::686419629",
      "Source": "Bob:  Fine by me.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  开心就好。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2545250910",
      "Source": "Meeka:  But you did say you had a really scary story next...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  但你真的说过接下来要讲一个恐怖故事的...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::820138528",
      "Source": "Meeka:  About the place where you met -- you know -- him.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  关于你在那个地方遇见的 -- 你懂的 -- 就他。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1503196133",
      "Source": "Bob:  (gulp) Yeah, well, your old man’s gonna come looking for me, he finds out I gave you bad dreams.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  (吞咽) 嗯, 好吧, 如果你老爸发现我讲了会让你做噩梦的故事, 他可是会来找我的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3576858988",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Pfft! Like he’d even notice how *I* feel.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Puu! 就好像他会注意「我」的感受似的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2860196218",
      "Source": "Bob:  Well, no need for my name to even come up, is all I’m saying.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  呃, 我想说的是万一, 最好别提我的名字。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1147271187",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Quit! Stalling!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  别! 磨叽了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1586105187",
      "Source": "Bob:  Okay, okay! (sigh)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  好吧, 好吧! (叹气)","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2599608620",
      "Source": "Bob:  How about we call this one...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  那我们把这个故事叫做...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3725836259",
      "Source": "Bob:  “Journey to the Center of the Broken ARK”",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  “方舟地心历险记”","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1666927057",
      "Source": "Meeka:  As long as it’s the Scary Version!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  只要是恐怖的版本就行!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1564678590",
      "Source": "Bob:  Careful what you wish for. Things got weird and dark down there...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  当心你盼啥来啥。下面的事情既诡异又阴暗...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::160698528",
      "Source": "Bob:  Especially for poor Doc Rockwell.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  尤其是对可怜的罗克韦尔博士来说。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1888132402",
      "Source": "Meeka:  What’d he do, that was so bad?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  他做了什么, 那么糟糕?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2500332005",
      "Source": "Bob:  The guy got a little too curious for his own good...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  这家伙有点过于好奇了, 这对他来说可不是什么好事...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::115547807",
      "Source": "Bob:  Messed around with some mumbo jumbo he shouldn’t have.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  他瞎摆弄了一些他碰不得的乱七八糟的玩意儿。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::669123773",
      "Source": "Bob:  He wouldn’t listen to anyone that tried to warn him, neither.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  他也不会听从任何想要告诫他的人。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1340119567",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Well, I’m listening to you. And I want to know ALL about it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  好吧, 我在听你讲。我想知道关于这件事的一切。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-序幕
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1706333881",
      "Source": "Bob:  We fell for what seemed like forever. Turned out that pit had a bottom after all.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  We fell for what seemed like forever. Turned out that pit had a bottom after all.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3904020236",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Whoa. Were you guys scared?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Whoa. Were you guys scared?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::513316244",
      "Source": "Bob:  At first, things were more weird than scary down there, like something out of the funny pages.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  At first, things were more weird than scary down there, like something out of the funny pages.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2708984379",
      "Source": "Bob:  Little Miss Professor and the Doc couldn’t get enough of it all. Sheesh.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Little Miss Professor and the Doc couldn’t get enough of it all. Sheesh.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1775501670",
      "Source": "Bob:  Doc Rockwell in particular kept wandering deeper and deeper in, where I couldn’t keep an eye on him.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Doc Rockwell in particular kept wandering deeper and deeper in, where I couldn’t keep an eye on him.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1759393504",
      "Source": "Bob:  Anyways, before I could round up those two eggheads, the whole place started spinning and shaking itself to pieces...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Anyways, before I could round up those two eggheads, the whole place started spinning and shaking itself to pieces...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::165880501",
      "Source": "Bob:  ...like we were on the world’s biggest ‘Tilt-A-Whirl’!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  ...like we were on the world’s biggest ‘疯狂大转盘’!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::767779658",
      "Source": "Meeka:  No fair -- you just got there!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  No fair -- you just got there!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-1
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1355660833",
      "Source": "Bob:  Funny thing: all that shaking left a buncha stuff lying around that I could see was gonna come in handy.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Funny thing: all that shaking left a buncha stuff lying around that I could see was gonna come in handy.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2280746161",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Huh, lucky you!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Huh, lucky you!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::71181613",
      "Source": "Bob:  Well, with nothing much down there but rocks and fungus, we were gonna need some luck.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Well, with nothing much down there but rocks and fungus, we were gonna need some luck.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3921204012",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Ugh, gross... mushrooms!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Ugh, gross... mushrooms!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2580669208",
      "Source": "Bob:  Not a fan myself, but Doc Rockwell said, “Gonna need to adapt to survive”.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Not a fan myself, but Doc Rockwell said, “Gonna need to adapt to survive”.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3158152046",
      "Source": "Bob:  Not sure why I ever listened to that old kook.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Not sure why I ever listened to that old kook.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3597870895",
      "Source": "Bob:  Suddenly felt like I was on the sauce again, 'cept worse.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Suddenly felt like I was on the sauce again, 'cept worse.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4199719000",
      "Source": "Bob:  A lot worse.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  A lot worse.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-2
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4044579319",
      "Source": "Bob:  Those red spotty ‘shrooms were bad news, but some of the others turned out to be okay...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Those red spotty ‘shrooms were bad news, but some of the others turned out to be okay...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::60636768",
      "Source": "Bob:  We just had to see what the local wildlife would eat.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  We just had to see what the local wildlife would eat.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3572262910",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Well, then I guess I would’ve starved. No mushrooms for me!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Well, then I guess I would’ve starved. No mushrooms for me!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::685434472",
      "Source": "Bob:  Be glad you get to be picky, kid. That means you’re well fed.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Be glad you get to be picky, kid. That means you’re well fed.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3020650664",
      "Source": "Bob:  In fact, you’d be surprised what you’re willing to eat when you’re starving for real.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  In fact, you’d be surprised what you’re willing to eat when you’re starving for real.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3496981189",
      "Source": "Bob:  Mmm... just like chicken.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  嗯~~ 鸡肉味嘎嘣脆。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::723845040",
      "Source": "Meeka:  (sigh) Poor Bulby...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  (唉) 可怜的小灯泡...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-3
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1033905712",
      "Source": "Bob:  So I had things MOSTLY under control before that scary dame showed me up in her FANCY armor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  So I had things MOSTLY under control before that scary dame showed me up in her FANCY armor.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4077299366",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Ooo, who was she?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Ooo, who was she?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::83604240",
      "Source": "Bob:  Someone from back on that jungle island. The ‘Beast Queen’, she called herself.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Someone from back on that jungle island. The ‘Beast Queen’, she called herself.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::509016839",
      "Source": "Bob:  Little Miss Professor was making a big deal about her still being alive.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Little Miss Professor was making a big deal about her still being alive.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::947472658",
      "Source": "Meeka:  But where’d she get the armor?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  But where’d she get the armor?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2338720504",
      "Source": "Bob:  Turned out our Beast Queen had a whole squad of roughnecks from the future backing her up.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Turned out our Beast Queen had a whole squad of roughnecks from the future backing her up.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2311717999",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Whoa...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Whoa...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-4
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3335907961",
      "Source": "Bob:  So yeah, there were people from the future on that ARK.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  So yeah, there were people from the future on that ARK.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1138611625",
      "Source": "Meeka:  MY future?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  MY future?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3789753106",
      "Source": "Bob:  Errr, no... I mean, the future to me. But what do I know, I’m just some grunt who bought the big one in 1944.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Errr, no... I mean, the future to me. But what do I know, I’m just some grunt who bought the big one in 1944.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2354957822",
      "Source": "Bob:  Anyway, you’ll never guess who was in charge of their outfit.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Anyway, you’ll never guess who was in charge of their outfit.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2456791114",
      "Source": "Meeka:  (sigh) My dad...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  (sigh) My dad...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3787035765",
      "Source": "Bob:  Huh. Yeah. That’s where ol’ Santiago and I met for the very first time!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Huh. Yeah. That’s where ol’ Santiago and I met for the very first time!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::325643204",
      "Source": "Bob:  I introduced him to my pals... not that Doc even noticed. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  I introduced him to my pals... not that Doc even noticed. ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4171975751",
      "Source": "Bob:  He was too busy gawking at all the shiny toys those Future-People had brought to the camp.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  He was too busy gawking at all the shiny toys those Future-People had brought to the camp.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2508317176",
      "Source": "Meeka:  I would be, too!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  I would be, too!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1944517071",
      "Source": "Bob:  Sure you would. That's the problem.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Sure you would. That's the problem.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-5
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2608628571",
      "Source": "Bob:  So at first, I guess, your old man was having trouble puzzling out the crazy super-science running the ARKs.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  So at first, I guess, your old man was having trouble puzzling out the crazy super-science running the ARKs.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-6
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3042316224",
      "Source": "Bob:  Santiago said the ARK’s ‘Tek’ was from further into the future than his own time, but he still thought he could get it to work for us.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Santiago said the ARK’s ‘Tek’ was from further into the future than his own time, but he still thought he could get it to work for us.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-6
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3305773734",
      "Source": "Meeka:  I guess DAD didn’t have any RULES against using Tek back THEN...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  I guess DAD didn’t have any RULES against using Tek back THEN...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-6
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2772277810",
      "Source": "Bob:  Not so sure about that. His people had to rush underground after your dad messed-up on the first try...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Not so sure about that. His people had to rush underground after your dad messed-up on the first try...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-6
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::326758900",
      "Source": "Bob:  And cooked everything topside. The whole surface of the ARK went up in flames.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  And cooked everything topside. The whole surface of the ARK went up in flames.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-6
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4221039732",
      "Source": "Bob:  Santiago wanted another crack at it, and asked if we wanted in.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Santiago wanted another crack at it, and asked if we wanted in.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-6
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3472924234",
      "Source": "Bob:  I couldn’t exactly say no... not in front of the ladies. Gotta keep up my reputation, and all.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  I couldn’t exactly say no... not in front of the ladies. Gotta keep up my reputation, and all.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-6
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::369317853",
      "Source": "Meeka:  I wanna hear more about the GIRLS in Dad’s camp, back on that ARK.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  I wanna hear more about the GIRLS in Dad’s camp, back on that ARK.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3952969970",
      "Source": "Bob:  Oh yeah? Lessee, I told you about Little Miss Professor Helena, and the Beast Queen.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Oh yeah? Lessee, I told you about Little Miss Professor Helena, and the Beast Queen.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3418683261",
      "Source": "Bob:  Those two seemed real close until this pilot from the future showed up. Diana. And suddenly Helena was the odd one out.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Those two seemed real close until this pilot from the future showed up. Diana. And suddenly Helena was the odd one out.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3353306683",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Really? Huh...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Really? Huh...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3019226732",
      "Source": "Bob:  Then again, after we all got to know each other better, there was something between Diana and Santiago, too...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Then again, after we all got to know each other better, there was something between Diana and Santiago, too...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::255987767",
      "Source": "Bob:  Almost like they’d known each other before. Probably more of that ‘future’ gobbledygoop that gives me a headache.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Almost like they’d known each other before. Probably more of that ‘future’ gobbledygoop that gives me a headache.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::892704961",
      "Source": "Bob:  Still, Diana decided to hang back at the camp, while the other two ladies and me went along on Santiago’s crazy mission.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Still, Diana decided to hang back at the camp, while the other two ladies and me went along on Santiago’s crazy mission.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::660781878",
      "Source": "Bob:  Don’t think Diana trusted ol’ Doc Rockwell.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Don’t think Diana trusted ol’ Doc Rockwell.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2218741562",
      "Source": "Bob:  He’d been acting extra squirrelly by then, and she seemed worried he’d gone completely off his nut.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  He’d been acting extra squirrelly by then, and she seemed worried he’d gone completely off his nut.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2452890472",
      "Source": "Bob:  Good instincts, hers.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Good instincts, hers.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3937086911",
      "Source": "Meeka:  ‘Good instincts’...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  ‘Good instincts’...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-7
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4099926817",
      "Source": "Bob:  We had our marching orders.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  We had our marching orders.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1546825345",
      "Source": "Bob:  But before Santiago took us topside, we had to suit ourselves up in that shiny future-armor of theirs.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  But before Santiago took us topside, we had to suit ourselves up in that shiny future-armor of theirs.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1665789405",
      "Source": "Bob:  Supposedly radiation from space would’ve cooked us otherwise.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Supposedly radiation from space would’ve cooked us otherwise.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::157098053",
      "Source": "Bob:  Didn’t much like the sound of that. I never did tan that well.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Didn’t much like the sound of that. I never did tan that well.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3427144518",
      "Source": "Bob:  Even armored up, we had to wait until things cooled down after dark before we could follow your dad outside.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Even armored up, we had to wait until things cooled down after dark before we could follow your dad outside.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2091036345",
      "Source": "Bob:  Things didn’t go exactly as planned, but we did manage to get into a big, creepy lab with tanks full of sleeping animals.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Things didn’t go exactly as planned, but we did manage to get into a big, creepy lab with tanks full of sleeping animals.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3039370591",
      "Source": "Bob:  And... people were stored there, too.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  And... people were stored there, too.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3757485571",
      "Source": "Bob:  We covered your dad while he did his thing, but before we had a chance to celebrate...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  We covered your dad while he did his thing, but before we had a chance to celebrate...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3201536471",
      "Source": "Bob:  We got a message that something bad went down back at camp.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  We got a message that something bad went down back at camp.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3583747363",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Oh no... was Diana okay?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Oh不...戴安娜还好吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-8
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3329755383",
      "Source": "Bob:  Your dad did something that, uh, beamed us straight back to camp. But we were still too late to save Diana.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Your dad did something that, uh, beamed us straight back to camp. But we were still too late to save Diana.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1493017570",
      "Source": "Meeka:  What!? What happened?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  什么!? 发生了什么事情?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3179632359",
      "Source": "Bob:  Turned out she was right not to trust Doc Rockwell. He found some GOOP deep down in the caves.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Turned out she was right not to trust Doc Rockwell. He found some GOOP deep down in the caves.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::650883720",
      "Source": "Bob:  He used it to change himself into something straight out of a creature-feature.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  He used it to change himself into something straight out of a creature-feature.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::896832660",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Rockwell... killed her? ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  罗克韦尔...把她杀了? ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3945174022",
      "Source": "Bob:  Yup, and scampered off somewhere down in the dark, coward that he was...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Yup, and scampered off somewhere down in the dark, coward that he was...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3860178824",
      "Source": "Bob:  ‘Cause he knew we weren’t gonna let him get away with what he’d done.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  ‘Cause he knew we weren’t gonna let him get away with what he’d done.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-9
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2725334693",
      "Source": "Bob:  We could barely keep up with the Beast Queen.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  We could barely keep up with the Beast Queen.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1322485706",
      "Source": "Bob:  She really took it hard, what Rockwell did to her... ‘good friend’.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  She really took it hard, what Rockwell did to her... ‘good friend’.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3139634654",
      "Source": "Meeka:  But you found him. Right?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  But you found him. Right?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::910976594",
      "Source": "Bob:  What was left of the poor guy.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  What was left of the poor guy.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1083500800",
      "Source": "Bob:  And then we put that twisted freak out of his misery... and ours.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  And then we put that twisted freak out of his misery... and ours.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2236691813",
      "Source": "Bob:  We were sure glad we’d never have to deal with him again.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  We were sure glad we’d never have to deal with him again.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1135158329",
      "Source": "Bob:  So it was all over by the time your dad caught up with us, to say he’d rigged a way for us to leave that ARK behind for Earth.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  So it was all over by the time your dad caught up with us, to say he’d rigged a way for us to leave that ARK behind for Earth.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2117303239",
      "Source": "Bob:  Believe you me, spoke for all of us when he said he wanted to forget all about the place...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Believe you me, spoke for all of us when he said he wanted to forget all about the place...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1067699292",
      "Source": "Bob:  ‘Specially that creepy cargo hold we found, full of clones.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  ‘Specially that creepy cargo hold we found, full of clones.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2790189098",
      "Source": "Bob:  Wasn’t great finding out for sure we weren’t the original Bob or Santiago.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Wasn’t great finding out for sure we weren’t the original Bob or Santiago.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3023463480",
      "Source": "Bob:  How many times had we died and been brought back already? Just thinking about it gave me the heebie-jeebies.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  How many times had we died and been brought back already? Just thinking about it gave me the heebie-jeebies.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::139991968",
      "Source": "Meeka:  ‘Brought back...’",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  ‘Brought back...’","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-10
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::480074606",
      "Source": "Meeka:  So, we’re all just...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  So, we’re all just...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1279649105",
      "Source": "Meeka:  CLOWNS?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  CLOWNS?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3267424469",
      "Source": "Bob:  Clones. Copies of our original selves, but with our memories and, I dunno, maybe our souls too.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Clones. Copies of our original selves, but with our memories and, I dunno, maybe our souls too.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::576218375",
      "Source": "Bob:  Who knows? It’s all way beyond this G.I.’s pay-grade.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Who knows? It’s all way beyond this G.I.’s pay-grade.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1193355372",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Copies... of our souls?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Copies... of our souls?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1931297970",
      "Source": "Bob:  Uh, Meeka -- listen, kid... these are just dumb stories.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Uh, Meeka -- listen, kid... these are just dumb stories.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3749503911",
      "Source": "Bob:  I don’t know the half of what actually went on down there.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  I don’t know the half of what actually went on down there.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3403600445",
      "Source": "Meeka:  No, that part was true -- I can tell.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  No, that part was true -- I can tell.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2856162412",
      "Source": "Meeka:  If we ARE clones... If we all died...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  If we ARE clones... If we all died...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4002223389",
      "Source": "Meeka:  And ‘Tek’ brought us back...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  And ‘Tek’ brought us back...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1359046383",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Then we could use it to bring back other lost people, right?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Then we could use it to bring back other lost people, right?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1503214865",
      "Source": "Bob:  Hey now -- the Doc wanted to bring someone back with that stuff. Didn’t work out so good for him, did it?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Hey now -- the Doc wanted to bring someone back with that stuff. Didn’t work out so good for him, did it?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4245982452",
      "Source": "Meeka:  You said Rockwell was from the wrong time to even know how to use Tek! But my dad--",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  You said Rockwell was from the wrong time to even know how to use Tek! But my dad--","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::471174144",
      "Source": "Bob:  Your dad was from the ‘right time’, but he and I saw up-close how that crap wrecked the whole damn world!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Your dad was from the ‘right time’, but he and I saw up-close how that crap wrecked the whole damn world!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3008962932",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Ahem. Language?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Ahem. Language?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1988795332",
      "Source": "Bob:  Oh yeah. Uh, sorry. Anyhow, that story can wait...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Oh yeah. Uh, sorry. Anyhow, that story can wait...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1045701329",
      "Source": "Bob:  Right now, you need to find something for your pal Honker here to eat.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Right now, you need to find something for your pal Honker here to eat.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1558722453",
      "Source": "Meeka:  Okayyy.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"咪卡:  Okayyy.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1291607196",
      "Source": "Bob:  Atta girl. ‘Cause this next bit, well...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  Atta girl. ‘Cause this next bit, well...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1619333724",
      "Source": "Bob:  It’s filled with some tough memories for ol’ Bob.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲍勃:  It’s filled with some tough memories for ol’ Bob.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //鲍勃图鉴-蒸汽朋克-尾声
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1533981668",
      "Source": "Fertilized Jumping Spider Egg",
      "Trans": {"SC":"受精的跳蛛蛋","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2005125025",
      "Source": "Standing Tek Sleeping Pod",
      "Trans": {"SC":"立式泰克睡眠舱","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2114176479",
      "Source": "Remove As Input",
      "Trans": {"SC":"移除指令信息","JA":""},
