      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of a shirt into a bare chest on men or a bikini top on women.\r\n\r\nA swim suit with lots of \"bat\"-itude.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将男士的上衣隐藏或是将女士的上衣变成比基尼。\r\n\r\n一件充满‘蝙蝠’特色的泳衣。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2022931748",
      "Source": "This will override all other skins, acting as a full-body costume perfect for that full moon.\r\n\r\nShould always be set on Torso Armor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个皮肤来覆盖其它外观, 充当全身套装。该皮肤装备在躯干或胸甲上。\r\n\r\n非常适合满月之夜!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
