    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1389594039",
      "Source": "Common Name: Archelon\r\nSpecies: Archelon Physicorum\r\nTime: Late Cretaceous \r\nDiet: Cnidaria\r\nTemperament: Docile\r\n\r\nWild \r\nArchelon Physicorum is a kinder denizen of the deep. With a massive and thick carapace, Archelon survives exclusively on a diet of Cnidaria. These giants are often found in a group with at least one additional specimen, deep in the Islands waters.\r\nMost Likely due to their diet, Archelon are immune to the effects of torpor and tranquilization. Luckily, taming an Archelon can be done by hand, and only requires a hefty amount of time and biotoxin...\r\n... lots and lots of biotoxin.\r\narchelon appear to possess the ability to gain unprecedented amounts of strength when they consume their favorite prey. Once they devour the corpse of a Cnidaria, Archelon have shown an increased resistance to damage, and a tremendous increase in their own attacks.\r\n\r\nDomesticated\r\nOnce they've had their fill of biotoxin, Archelon show great promise as undersea mounts. While they maintain their additional perks consuming Cnidaria, Archelon also produce an amazing algae that herbivorous creatures seem to LOVE! On top of all this, Archelon can seat and additional 4 survivors atop their saddles while also providing oxygen! I would consider it foolish for a tribe to not have at least one Archelon available to them.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 古巨龟\r\n拉丁学名: Archelon Physicorum\r\n正式名称: Archelon Physicorum\r\n时代: 晚白垩世\r\n食性: 刺胞生物\r\n性情: 温顺\r\n\r\n\r\n野生\r\n古巨龟是一个友好的深海居民。有着巨大而厚重的甲壳, 它只以刺胞动物为食。这些巨人经常在岛屿水域深处与至少另一个额外的标本一起被发现。\r\n很有可能是由于它们的饮食习惯,古巨龟对麻醉和镇定剂的影响免疫。幸运的是, 古巨龟可以用手完成驯服, 只是需要大量的时间和生物毒素...\r\n...大量的生物毒素。\r\n当它们吃掉自己最喜欢的猎物时, 会获得前所未有的力量能力。一旦他们吞噬了刺胞动物的尸体, 就会表现出更强的抗性, 并且自身的攻击力也会大大增加。\r\n\r\n\r\n家养\r\n一旦它们吃饱了生物毒素, 古巨龟在海底山脉会展现出巨大的潜力。在消化刺胞动物的同时, 古巨龟还产生了一种令人惊叹的藻类, 草食动物似乎非常喜欢这种藻类! 除此之外, 古巨龟还可以让另外4名生存者做在鞍上, 同时提供氧气。\r\n我认为一个部落没有至少一只古巨龟是愚蠢的行为。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
