    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4183047494",
      "Source": "Walk Tamed Creatures onto this while active to grind them into Kibble. Requires Power to activate.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在设施处于激活状态下将驯服的生物驱赶到该设施, 就可将它们磨成饲料。需要电力来激活。","JA":""},
