    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1191892745",
      "Source": "Kibble produced from grinding tamed creatures ends up here. Requires Gasoline or Power to be activated.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"研磨驯服生物所产生的饲料会存放在这里。需要电力或汽油才能启动。","JA":""},
