    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3631730259",
      "Source": "A natural defense tower that houses a Bladewasp colony. Bladewasps pester small Creatures away, and deal damage to flying Creatures over time. Consumes sulfur to \"fire\". Requires Honey to activate.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种天然的防御塔, 内部栖息着刀蜂群落。刀蜂会驱赶小型生物, 并对飞行生物造成持续伤害。消耗硫磺以“发动攻击”。需要蜂蜜激活。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
