      "Source": "Projectiles fired by this weapon have their speed increased by 50%, and reduce the effect of gravity on them by 50%.\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0.25,0.25,1\">Trait must be applied in a Makeshift Megalab</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用该武器发射出的弹药速度会提升50%, 同时其受到的重力影响也会减少50%。\r\n\r\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0.25,0.25,1\">该特性只能在简易大型实验桌中应用</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
      //装备特性-描述
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2107206303",
      "Source": "Projectiles fired by this weapon have their speed increased by {!SpeedIncrease}%, and reduce the effect of gravity on them by {GravityDrop}%.",
