    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2635029121",
      "Source": "Rockwell Recipes: Dilophosaur Kibble",
      "Trans": {"SC":"罗克韦尔配方: 双嵴龙饲料","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::199497848",
      "Source": "This recipe will produce a consumable which the Ankylosaurus, Doedicurus, and Pachycephalosaurus have a very high affinity for.\n\n1 Dilophosaur Egg\n1 Cooked Meat Jerky\n1 Citronal\n2 Mejoberries\n3 Fiber (aids digestion)\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a CookingPot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种食物深受甲龙、星尾兽和肿头龙的喜爱。\n\n1颗双嵴龙蛋\n1份熟肉干\n1个柠檬\n2个紫色浆果\n3个纤维 (帮助消化)\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2961161727",
      "Source": "VR Dilophosaur",
      "Trans": {"SC":"VR 双嵴龙","JA":"VR 双脊龙"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":true,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::4053421389",
      "Source": "You can't ride Dilophosaurs, but they can carry goods for you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你无法骑乘双嵴龙, 但是他们可以帮你携带物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
