    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4153663501",
      "Source": "This recipe will produce a consumable which Carnotaurus have a very high affinity for.\n\n1 Ankylosaurus Egg\n1 Prime Meat Jerky\n1 Savoroot\n2 Mejoberries\n3 Fiber (aids digestion)\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a CookingPot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种食物深受肉食牛龙的喜爱。\n\n1颗甲龙蛋\n1份优质肉干\n1个土豆\n2个紫色浆果\n3个纤维 (帮助消化)\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1626651102",
      "Source": "This recipe will produce a consumable which the Direwolf, Direbear, and Triceratops have a very high affinity for.\n\n1 Carnotaurus Egg\n1 Cooked Meat\n1 Savoroot\n2 Mejoberries\n3 Fiber (aids digestion)\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a CookingPot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种食物深受恐狼、恐熊和三角龙的喜爱。\n\n1颗肉食牛龙蛋\n1份熟肉\n1个土豆\n2个紫色浆果\n3个纤维 (帮助消化)\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
