    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3656177631",
      "Source": "Eating raw food will SLIGHTLY sate hunger, but is unhealthy for humans.  Most wild carnivores prefer raw meat to cooked meat.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"吃生肉可以略微减轻饥饿感, 但有害人类健康。大多数的野生食肉动物比起熟肉更喜欢生肉。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::787460813",
      "Source": "Eating raw food will SLIGHTLY sate hunger, but is unhealthy for humans.  This excellent cut spoils very quickly. Most wild carnivores love this meat.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"吃生肉可以略微减轻饥饿感, 但有害人类健康。这块优质生肉极易腐烂。\n绝大多数野生食肉动物超爱这种肉。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::26319745",
      "Source": "Eating raw food will sate hunger, but is unhealthy for humans.  Most wild carnivores prefer raw meat to cooked meat.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"吃生肉可以减轻饥饿感, 但有害人类健康。大多数的野生食肉动物比起熟肉更喜欢生肉。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1251899612",
      "Source": "Eating raw food will sate hunger, but is unhealthy for humans.  This excellent cut spoils very quickly.\nMost wild carnivores love this meat.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"吃生肉可以减轻饥饿感, 但有害人类健康。这块优质生肉极易腐烂。\n绝大多数野生食肉动物超爱这种肉。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1019751691",
      "Source": "Sates your hunger, and provides health while being digested.  Lasts longer than cooked meat.\nWild carnivores will eat it, but prefer raw meat.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"减轻你的饥饿感, 消化时恢复生命值。比熟肉保鲜期更长。\n野生食肉动物虽然会吃它, 但还是更喜爱生肉。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4104574310",
      "Source": "Sates your hunger, and provides health while being digested.  More effective than normal meat jerky, and lasts longer than cooked prime meat.\nWild carnivores like this meat a lot.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"减轻你的饥饿感, 消化时恢复生命值。比普通肉干更有效, 比优质熟肉保鲜期更长。\n野生食肉动物很喜欢。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
